fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-53-Ultimate-Calm-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7206&token=588e2781&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-53-Ultimate-Calm-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7206&token=588e2781&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-53-Ultimate-Calm-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7206&token=588e2781&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-53-Ultimate-Calm-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7206&token=588e2781&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Erland Cooper\",\"caption\":\"Erland Cooper © Andrea Fiumana \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"BBC Proms\",\"Electronic\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/ultimate-calm\",\"DateDescription\":\"Thursday 27 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#342a83\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-53-Ultimate-Calm-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7206&token=588e2781&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-53-Ultimate-Calm-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7206&token=588e2781&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-53-Ultimate-Calm-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7206&token=588e2781&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-53-Ultimate-Calm-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7206&token=588e2781&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Erland Cooper\",\"caption\":\"Erland Cooper © Andrea Fiumana \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2122-101120\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101120,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-27T22:15:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Late Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-27T21:40:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":4.25,\"MaximumPrice\":28,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":50,\"ContentType\":\"Show Promo Code Box\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-53-Ultimate-Calm-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7206&token=588e2781\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Ultimate Calm has been taking listeners on immersive and reflective journeys through classical and ambient music since the show launched in 2022, with presenters including&nbsp;<strong>&Oacute;lafur Arnalds</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Hania Rani</strong>&nbsp;and now&nbsp;<strong>Erland Cooper</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>Airing across BBC Radio 3 and its sister station Radio 3 Unwind, this late-night Prom will include music by Cooper, originally from the Orkney Islands and whose work explores the themes of nature and landscape, along with guest artists, atmospheric soundscapes and electronic elements. A uniquely serene and escapist concert for the night hours.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p><em>Broadcast live on BBC Radio 3 and Radio 3 Unwind.</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Erland Cooper&nbsp;</strong><em>presenter</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2091,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101122,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-05T22:15:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-05T22:15:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Under African Skies - The Songs of Graceland\",\"Suffix\":\"Late Night\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"South African vocal group Ladysmith Black Mambazo make their Proms debut 50 years on from the Soweto Uprising and 40 years since the release of Paul Simon’s era-defining album Graceland, which brought the group to international attention.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-26-Under-African-Skies-2820-x-1480-AUG-5.jpg?type=image&id=7179&token=15871fc5&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-26-Under-African-Skies-2820-x-1480-AUG-5.jpg?type=image&id=7179&token=15871fc5&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-26-Under-African-Skies-2820-x-1480-AUG-5.jpg?type=image&id=7179&token=15871fc5&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-26-Under-African-Skies-2820-x-1480-AUG-5.jpg?type=image&id=7179&token=15871fc5&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-26-Under-African-Skies-2820-x-1480-AUG-5.jpg?type=image&id=7179&token=15871fc5&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Ladysmith Black Mambazo\",\"caption\":\"Ladysmith Black Mambazo © Ladysmith Black Mambazo \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"BBC Proms\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/under-african-skies\",\"DateDescription\":\"Wednesday 5 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f5d8e9\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-26-Under-African-Skies-2820-x-1480-AUG-5.jpg?type=image&id=7179&token=15871fc5&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-26-Under-African-Skies-2820-x-1480-AUG-5.jpg?type=image&id=7179&token=15871fc5&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-26-Under-African-Skies-2820-x-1480-AUG-5.jpg?type=image&id=7179&token=15871fc5&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-26-Under-African-Skies-2820-x-1480-AUG-5.jpg?type=image&id=7179&token=15871fc5&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Ladysmith Black Mambazo\",\"caption\":\"Ladysmith Black Mambazo © Ladysmith Black Mambazo \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2091-101122\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101122,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-05T22:15:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Late Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-05T21:40:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":5.1,\"MaximumPrice\":37,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-26-Under-African-Skies-2820-x-1480-AUG-5.jpg?type=image&id=7179&token=15871fc5\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Celebrate the 40th anniversary of&nbsp;<em>Graceland</em>&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;<strong>Paul Simon</strong>&rsquo;s Grammy Award-winning, era-defining album, in a concert featuring Simon&rsquo;s original collaborators&nbsp;<strong>Ladysmith Black Mambazo</strong>&nbsp;(making its Royal Albert Hall Proms debut) and special guest artists.</p>\\r\\n<p>Defying Apartheid-era restrictions,&nbsp;<em>Graceland</em>&nbsp;not only featured Black South African musicians but also introduced global audiences to the country&rsquo;s music. Forty years on we trace the album&rsquo;s influences and echoes. ?</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Ladysmith Black Mambazo</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Nu Civilisation Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Peter Edwards&nbsp;</strong><em>director</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2137,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101180,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-06T11:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-06T11:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: John Wilson Conducts the Sinfonia of London Strings\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"John Wilson and his Sinfonia of London present a concert of English music, pairing two works by Britten – the Variations on a Theme of Frank Bridge and orchestral song-cycle Les illuminations – with music by Berkeley, Bridge and Imogen Holst.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-65-John-Wilson-conducts-the-Sinfonia-of-London-Strings-2820-x-1480-SEP-6.jpg?type=image&id=7218&token=ad5d0000&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-65-John-Wilson-conducts-the-Sinfonia-of-London-Strings-2820-x-1480-SEP-6.jpg?type=image&id=7218&token=ad5d0000&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-65-John-Wilson-conducts-the-Sinfonia-of-London-Strings-2820-x-1480-SEP-6.jpg?type=image&id=7218&token=ad5d0000&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-65-John-Wilson-conducts-the-Sinfonia-of-London-Strings-2820-x-1480-SEP-6.jpg?type=image&id=7218&token=ad5d0000&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-65-John-Wilson-conducts-the-Sinfonia-of-London-Strings-2820-x-1480-SEP-6.jpg?type=image&id=7218&token=ad5d0000&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"John Wilson\",\"caption\":\"John Wilson © Astrid Ackermann \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Opera\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/john-wilson-conducts-the-sinfonia-of-london-strings\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 6 September 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f5d8e9\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-65-John-Wilson-conducts-the-Sinfonia-of-London-Strings-2820-x-1480-SEP-6.jpg?type=image&id=7218&token=ad5d0000&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-65-John-Wilson-conducts-the-Sinfonia-of-London-Strings-2820-x-1480-SEP-6.jpg?type=image&id=7218&token=ad5d0000&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-65-John-Wilson-conducts-the-Sinfonia-of-London-Strings-2820-x-1480-SEP-6.jpg?type=image&id=7218&token=ad5d0000&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-65-John-Wilson-conducts-the-Sinfonia-of-London-Strings-2820-x-1480-SEP-6.jpg?type=image&id=7218&token=ad5d0000&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"John Wilson\",\"caption\":\"John Wilson © Astrid Ackermann \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2137-101180\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101180,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-09-06T11:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Morning\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-06T10:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7,\"MaximumPrice\":56,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-65-John-Wilson-conducts-the-Sinfonia-of-London-Strings-2820-x-1480-SEP-6.jpg?type=image&id=7218&token=ad5d0000\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>&lsquo;I alone hold the key to this wild parade.&rsquo;&nbsp;<strong>Benjamin Britten</strong>&nbsp;is the keystone of this second concert by&nbsp;<strong>John Wilson</strong>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<strong>Sinfonia of London</strong>&nbsp;(see 24 July), a family tree of English music. The shimmering, kaleidoscopic visions of the composer&rsquo;s orchestral song-cycle&nbsp;<em>Les illuminations</em>&nbsp;&ndash; performed by rising-star soprano&nbsp;<strong>Julie Roset</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; and the taut, witty invention of his&nbsp;<em>Variations on a Theme of Frank Bridge&nbsp;</em>are framed by works by members of Britten&rsquo;s circle: teachers, friends and colleagues.</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Imogen Holst</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Suite for String Orchestra</em>&nbsp;&ndash; her homage to England&rsquo;s musical past and vision for its future &ndash; receives its Proms premiere.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>L. Berkeley</strong>&nbsp;Serenade for Strings&nbsp;<em>13&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>Bridge</strong>&nbsp;Lament&nbsp;<em>4&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>Britten</strong>&nbsp;Les illuminations&nbsp;<em>22&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>I. Holst&nbsp;</strong>Suite for String Orchestra&nbsp;<em>16&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>Britten</strong>&nbsp;Variations on a Theme of Frank Bridge&nbsp;<em>26&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Julie Roset&nbsp;</strong><em>soprano</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Sinfonia of London&nbsp;</strong>(strings)<br /><strong>John Wilson&nbsp;</strong><em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2017,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100898,\"PerformanceNumber\":100725,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2027-03-10T19:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2027-03-10T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Philharmonic Orchestra presents\",\"Title\":\"Best of Broadway\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Back by demand, the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra’s Best of Broadway returns to the Hall for one night only. \",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Best-of-Broadway-2027-no-text-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6929&token=9c2df4ef&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Best-of-Broadway-2027-no-text-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6929&token=9c2df4ef&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Best-of-Broadway-2027-no-text-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6929&token=9c2df4ef&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Best-of-Broadway-2027-no-text-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6929&token=9c2df4ef&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Best-of-Broadway-2027-no-text-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6929&token=9c2df4ef&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Silhouettes of singers are performing behind an image of the Royal Albert Hall\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/100725\",\"Categories\":[\"Entertainment\",\"Musicals\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/best-of-broadway\",\"DateDescription\":\"Wednesday 10 March 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0d2626\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Best-of-Broadway-2027-no-text-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6929&token=9c2df4ef&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Best-of-Broadway-2027-no-text-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6929&token=9c2df4ef&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Best-of-Broadway-2027-no-text-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6929&token=9c2df4ef&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Best-of-Broadway-2027-no-text-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6929&token=9c2df4ef&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Silhouettes of singers are performing behind an image of the Royal Albert Hall\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2017-100725\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100725,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100898,\"Date\":\"2027-03-10T19:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-03-13T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-03-10T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7,\"MaximumPrice\":262.75,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra presents</p>\\r\\n<p>Back by demand, the&nbsp;<strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Best of Broadway</em>&nbsp;returns to the Hall for one night only.</p>\\r\\n<p>Join the RPO and a sensational cast of West End stars for a celebration of Broadway musicals.</p>\\r\\n<p>Including much-loved music and smash-hit songs from:&nbsp;<em>Chicago, Mamma Mia, Wicked, Hamilton, The Lion King, Chess; Dreamgirls, Six, Little Shop of Horrors, Cats, &amp;Juliet, Les Mis&eacute;rables, Hadestown, Kinky Boots</em>&nbsp;and more.</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING </strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n<p>____________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2072,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101158,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-07-23T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-07-23T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Afterlife - Visions of the Beyond\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"For their first Prom of the 2026 season, Ryan Bancroft and the BBC National Orchestra of Wales perform spiritually charged works by Lili Boulanger, Szymanowski, Messiaen and Strauss, each reflecting on death and the afterlife.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-9-Afterlife-Visions-of-the-Beyond-2820-x-1480-JUL-23.jpg?type=image&id=7164&token=50894dd9&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-9-Afterlife-Visions-of-the-Beyond-2820-x-1480-JUL-23.jpg?type=image&id=7164&token=50894dd9&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-9-Afterlife-Visions-of-the-Beyond-2820-x-1480-JUL-23.jpg?type=image&id=7164&token=50894dd9&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-9-Afterlife-Visions-of-the-Beyond-2820-x-1480-JUL-23.jpg?type=image&id=7164&token=50894dd9&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-9-Afterlife-Visions-of-the-Beyond-2820-x-1480-JUL-23.jpg?type=image&id=7164&token=50894dd9&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Ryan Bancroft\",\"caption\":\"Ryan Bancroft © Benjamin Ealovega \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Opera\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/afterlife-visions-of-the-beyond\",\"DateDescription\":\"Thursday 23 July 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#342a83\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-9-Afterlife-Visions-of-the-Beyond-2820-x-1480-JUL-23.jpg?type=image&id=7164&token=50894dd9&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-9-Afterlife-Visions-of-the-Beyond-2820-x-1480-JUL-23.jpg?type=image&id=7164&token=50894dd9&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-9-Afterlife-Visions-of-the-Beyond-2820-x-1480-JUL-23.jpg?type=image&id=7164&token=50894dd9&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-9-Afterlife-Visions-of-the-Beyond-2820-x-1480-JUL-23.jpg?type=image&id=7164&token=50894dd9&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Ryan Bancroft\",\"caption\":\"Ryan Bancroft © Benjamin Ealovega \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2072-101158\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101158,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-07-23T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-07-23T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":5.1,\"MaximumPrice\":46,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-9-Afterlife-Visions-of-the-Beyond-2820-x-1480-JUL-23.jpg?type=image&id=7164&token=50894dd9\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Music pierces the veil between heaven and earth in a spiritually charged concert that opens in contemplation and ends in the blaze of ascension and transfiguration.</p>\\r\\n<p>Voices are raised in prayer in&nbsp;<strong>Lili Boulanger</strong>&rsquo;s haunting&nbsp;<em>Vieille pri&egrave;re bouddhique</em>, intensified in the rapt, intimate intercessions of&nbsp;<strong>Szymanowski</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Stabat mater</em>. Unearthly beauty is revealed in&nbsp;<strong>Messiaen</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>L&rsquo;Ascension</em>, before a dying man is raised to heaven in&nbsp;<strong>Strauss</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Death and Transfiguration</em>.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>L. Boulanger</strong>&nbsp;Vieille pri&egrave;re bouddhique&nbsp;<em>7&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><strong>Szymanowski</strong>&nbsp;Stabat mater&nbsp;<em>28&rsquo;&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Messiaen</strong>&nbsp;L&rsquo;Ascension &ndash; four symphonic mediations&nbsp;<em>27&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>R. Strauss</strong>&nbsp;Death and Transfiguration&nbsp;<em>23&rsquo;</em>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Mari Eriksmoen&nbsp;</strong><em>soprano</em><br /><strong>Paula Murrihy</strong><em>&nbsp;mezzo-soprano</em><br /><strong>James Way&nbsp;</strong><em>tenor</em><br /><strong>Szymon Mechlinski&nbsp;</strong><em>baritone</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>BBC National Chorus of Wales</strong><br /><strong>London Philharmonic Choir</strong><br /><strong>BBC National Orchestra of Wales&nbsp;</strong><br /><strong>Ryan Bancroft</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2069,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101132,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-07-21T18:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-07-21T18:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Also sprach Zarathustra\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"John Storgårds and the BBC Philharmonic Orchestra perform Strauss’s monumental tone-poem alongside Betsy Jolas’s evocative Tales of a Summer Sea. Sueye Park joins them for Sibelius’s Nordic-tinged Violin Concerto.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-6-Also-sprach-Zarathustra-2820-x-1480-JUL-21.jpg?type=image&id=7161&token=9cc17307&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-6-Also-sprach-Zarathustra-2820-x-1480-JUL-21.jpg?type=image&id=7161&token=9cc17307&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-6-Also-sprach-Zarathustra-2820-x-1480-JUL-21.jpg?type=image&id=7161&token=9cc17307&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-6-Also-sprach-Zarathustra-2820-x-1480-JUL-21.jpg?type=image&id=7161&token=9cc17307&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-6-Also-sprach-Zarathustra-2820-x-1480-JUL-21.jpg?type=image&id=7161&token=9cc17307&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"John Storgårds\",\"caption\":\"John Storgårds © Phil Sharp\"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/also-sprach-zarathustra\",\"DateDescription\":\"Tuesday 21 July 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#ef911f\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-6-Also-sprach-Zarathustra-2820-x-1480-JUL-21.jpg?type=image&id=7161&token=9cc17307&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-6-Also-sprach-Zarathustra-2820-x-1480-JUL-21.jpg?type=image&id=7161&token=9cc17307&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-6-Also-sprach-Zarathustra-2820-x-1480-JUL-21.jpg?type=image&id=7161&token=9cc17307&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-6-Also-sprach-Zarathustra-2820-x-1480-JUL-21.jpg?type=image&id=7161&token=9cc17307&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"John Storgårds\",\"caption\":\"John Storgårds © Phil Sharp\"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2069-101132\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101132,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-07-21T18:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-07-21T17:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7.23,\"MaximumPrice\":68,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-6-Also-sprach-Zarathustra-2820-x-1480-JUL-21.jpg?type=image&id=7161&token=9cc17307\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div id=\\\"e11531\\\" class=\\\"element content-panel\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"content-panel__inner\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"content-panel__body s-prose\\\">\\r\\n<p>&lsquo;Sensational&rsquo; 2025 Sibelius Competition-winner&nbsp;<strong>Sueye Park&nbsp;</strong>makes her Proms debut, joining&nbsp;<strong>John Storg&aring;rds</strong>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<strong>BBC Philharmonic Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;as soloist in&nbsp;<strong>Sibelius</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Violin Concerto</em>. All fire and ice, a love song for the composer&rsquo;s own instrument, it&rsquo;s the Romantic concerto par excellence: deeply personal and powerfully expressive.</p>\\r\\n<p>Sibelius&rsquo;s Nordic lakes meet the choppy ocean waters of&nbsp;<strong>Betsy Jolas</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Tales of a Summer Sea</em>, and later the dark forests and tectonic stirrings of&nbsp;<strong>Strauss</strong>&rsquo;s Nietzsche- inspired tone-poem&nbsp;<em>Also sprach Zarathustra</em>, its blazing orchestral sunrise made famous by Stanley Kubrick&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>2001: A Space Odyssey</em>.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section id=\\\"e11532\\\" class=\\\"element program-panel\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__inner\\\">\\r\\n<h2 class=\\\"program-panel__title\\\">Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__items\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__item\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__composer\\\">&nbsp;</div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__pieces\\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>Betsy Jolas</strong>&nbsp;Tales of a Summer Sea&nbsp;<em>15&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><em>UK premiere</em><br /><strong>Sibelius</strong>&nbsp;Violin Concerto in D minor&nbsp;<em>35&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__item program-panel__item--intermission\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__intermission\\\"><span class=\\\"program-panel__intermission-text\\\">Interval</span><hr class=\\\"program-panel__intermission-hr\\\" /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__item\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__composer\\\">&nbsp;</div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__pieces\\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>R. Strauss</strong>&nbsp;Also sprach Zarathustra&nbsp;<em>33&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"program-panel__notes\\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>Sueye Park&nbsp;</strong><em>violin</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>BBC Philharmonic Orchestra&nbsp;</strong><br /><strong>John Storg&aring;rds</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":792,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100723,\"PerformanceNumber\":100724,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-12-31T19:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-12-31T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Future Makers Competition Entries\",\"Suffix\":\"Finding tomorrow's music talent\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Future Makers entry information for the annual music competition. \",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Engagement/2024/2024-11-06-Future-Makers/53.jpg?type=image&id=3343&token=402a2b9c&mode=fill&top=17&left=0&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Engagement/2024/2024-11-06-Future-Makers/53.jpg?type=image&id=3343&token=402a2b9c&mode=fill&top=22&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600