Arcangelo-2820-x-1480-SEP-10.jpg?type=image&id=7224&token=bcf14b34&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-71-Bachs-Mass-in-B-Minor-with-Arcangelo-2820-x-1480-SEP-10.jpg?type=image&id=7224&token=bcf14b34&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Jeanine De Bique\",\"caption\":\"Jeanine De Bique © Marco Borggreve \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2143-101114\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101114,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-09-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-10T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":13,\"MaximumPrice\":86,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-71-Bachs-Mass-in-B-Minor-with-Arcangelo-2820-x-1480-SEP-10.jpg?type=image&id=7224&token=bcf14b34\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>The spiritual and musical summation of a life,&nbsp;<strong>J. S. Bach</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Mass in B minor</em>&nbsp;is one of the most powerful and universal statements in art, as well as one of the most joyous musical experiences of the repertoire. This compendium of styles and textures &ndash; thrilling contrapuntal choruses, virtuosic and emotive arias and duets, brilliantly inventive orchestral writing &ndash; comes together in a deeply moving musical epic.</p>\\r\\n<p>Continuing their &lsquo;tremendous&rsquo; Proms performances of sacred Baroque masterpieces,<strong>&nbsp;Arcangelo</strong>&nbsp;and Music Director&nbsp;<strong>Jonathan Cohen</strong>&nbsp;return with an exciting team of soloists that includes soprano&nbsp;<strong>Jeanine De Bique</strong>&nbsp;and counter-tenor&nbsp;<strong>Hugh Cutting</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>J. S. Bach&nbsp;</strong>Mass in B minor&nbsp;<em>115&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Jeanine De Bique&nbsp;</strong><em>soprano</em><br /><strong>Eva Za&iuml;cik&nbsp;</strong><em>soprano</em><br /><strong>Hugh Cutting&nbsp;</strong><em>counter-tenor</em><br /><strong>Nick Pritchard&nbsp;</strong><em>tenor</em><br /><strong>Florian St&ouml;rtz&nbsp;</strong><em>bass-baritone</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Arcangelo</strong><br /><strong>Jonathan Cohen&nbsp;</strong><em>director/harpsichord</em></p>\\r\\n<p><em>There will be one interval.</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2103,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101173,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-14T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-14T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Marvin Gaye - Prince of Soul\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"The BBC Concert Orchestra and Edwin Outwater pay tribute to a musical icon, Marvin Gaye.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Marvin-Gaye-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7378&token=1fdf2431&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Marvin-Gaye-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7378&token=1fdf2431&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Marvin-Gaye-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7378&token=1fdf2431&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Marvin-Gaye-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7378&token=1fdf2431&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Marvin-Gaye-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7378&token=1fdf2431&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Marvin Gaye\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"BBC Proms\",\"Rock and Pop\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/marvin-gaye-prince-of-soul\",\"DateDescription\":\"Friday 14 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0093dd\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Marvin-Gaye-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7378&token=1fdf2431&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Marvin-Gaye-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7378&token=1fdf2431&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Marvin-Gaye-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7378&token=1fdf2431&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Marvin-Gaye-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7378&token=1fdf2431&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Marvin Gaye\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2103-101173\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101173,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-14T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-14T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":5.95,\"MaximumPrice\":56,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Marvin-Gaye-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7378&token=1fdf2431\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>With velvety vocals packing an emotional punch and songs straddling soul, Motown, gospel, R&amp;B and funk,&nbsp;<strong>Marvin Gaye</strong>&nbsp;embraced a unique range spanning intimacy and protest, the physical and the spiritual. A pioneer of soul- baring songwriting, he has influenced countless artists, from Stevie Wonder and Prince to hip hop and rap artists.</p>\\r\\n<p>The&nbsp;<strong>BBC Concert Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Edwin Outwater</strong>&nbsp;pay tribute to a musical icon, joined by guest singers for new orchestral arrangements of hits Gaye recorded with close collaborator&nbsp;<strong>Tammi Terrell</strong>&nbsp;(such as '<em>Aint No Mountain High Enough</em>'), as well as favourites including '<em>I Heard it Through the Grapevine</em>', '<em>What's Going On</em>' and '<em>Ain't Nothing Like the Real Thing</em>'.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p><em>Broadcast on BBC TV and BBC iPlayer.</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>BBC Concert Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Edwin Outwater</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n<p><em>There will be one interval.&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2150,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101724,\"PerformanceNumber\":101730,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2027-03-31T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2027-03-31T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Live Nation presents\",\"Title\":\"Loreena McKennitt \",\"Suffix\":\"The Mask and Mirror 30th Anniversary Tour\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Composer and singer, Loreena McKennitt is coming to the Hall in March 2027.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Loreena-McKennitt-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7670&token=42aca022&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Loreena-McKennitt-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7670&token=4