=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Loreena-McKennitt-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7670&token=42aca022&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Loreena-McKennitt-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7670&token=42aca022&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Loreena McKennitt\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2150-101730\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101730,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101724,\"Date\":\"2027-03-31T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-29T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-03-31T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":35,\"MaximumPrice\":346.08,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"6\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":72,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Fine Dining \",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Front Arena Seat <br />*Three course dinner in Coda by Chavot Restaurant<br />*Welcome glass Champagne and half bottle of wine per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":79,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Private Hire of a Box for 8 guests&nbsp;<br />*Half bottle Moet Champagne per person <br />*1/4 bottle wine per person <br />*Canapes, cold and hot bowl dishes<br />*Dessert canapes <br />*Service waiter</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Private Hire of a Box for 4 guests&nbsp;<br />*Half bottle Moet Champagne per person <br />*1/4 bottle wine per person <br />*Canapes, cold and hot bowl dishes<br />*Dessert canapes <br />*Service waiter</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":293,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Premium Stalls Seating <br />*Pre and interval VIP Lounge<br />*Canapes, bowl dishes, desserts, wine, beer and soft drinks</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2068,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101131,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-07-20T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-07-20T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Beethoven’s Ninth\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Gianandrea Noseda leads massed forces in Beethoven’s monumental ‘Choral’ Symphony. We also hear the UK premiere of Jessie Montgomery’s These Righteous Paths with South African cellist Abel Selaocoe.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-5-Beethovens-Ninth-2820-x-1480-JUL-20.jpg?type=image&id=7160&token=11df297a&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-5-Beethovens-Ninth-2820-x-1480-JUL-20.jpg?type=image&id=7160&token=11df297a&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-5-Beethovens-Ninth-2820-x-1480-JUL-20.jpg?type=image&id=7160&token=11df297a&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-5-Beethovens-Ninth-2820-x-1480-JUL-20.jpg?type=image&id=7160&token=11df297a&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-5-Beethovens-Ninth-2820-x-1480-JUL-20.jpg?type=image&id=7160&token=11df297a&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Leah Hawkins\",\"caption\":\"Leah Hawkins © Curtis Brown \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Opera\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/beethovens-ninth\",\"DateDescription\":\"Monday 20 July 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#342a83\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-5-Beethovens-Ninth-2820-x-1480-JUL-20.jpg?type=image&id=7160&token=11df297a&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-5-Beethovens-Ninth-2820-x-1480-JUL-20.jpg?type=image&id=7160&token=11df297a&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-5-Beethovens-Ninth-2820-x-1480-JUL-20.jpg?type=image&id=7160&token=11df297a&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-5-Beethovens-Ninth-2820-x-1480-JUL-20.jpg?type=image&id=7160&token=11df297a&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Leah Hawkins\",\"caption\":\"Leah Hawkins © Curtis Brown \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2068-101131\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101131,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-07-20T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-07-20T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7.23,\"MaximumPrice\":68,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-5-Beethovens-Ninth-2820-x-1480-JUL-20.jpg?type=image&id=7160&token=11df297a\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Genre-defying South African cellist&nbsp;<strong>Abel Selaocoe</strong>&nbsp;returns as soloist in the UK premiere of American composer&nbsp;<strong>Jessie Montgomery</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>These Righteous Paths</em>&nbsp;&ndash; inspired by her late mother, the poet and playwright Robbie McCauley.</p>\\r\\n<p>The concert opens with&nbsp;<strong>Bach</strong>&rsquo;s mighty&nbsp;<em>Fantasia and Fugue in G minor</em>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<strong>Andrew Davis</strong>&rsquo;s colourful orchestral arrangement. After the interval comes the monumental power of&nbsp;<strong>Beethoven</strong>&rsquo;s &lsquo;<em>Choral&rsquo; Symphony</em>: a musical cry for freedom and brotherhood that culminates in the radiant &lsquo;<em>Ode to Joy</em>&rsquo;.</p>\\r\\n<p>This concert marks&nbsp;<strong>Gianandrea Noseda</strong>&rsquo;s return to the podium of the&nbsp;<strong>BBC Philharmonic Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;after his final appearance as its Chief Conductor 11 years ago.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>J. S. Bach, orch. A. Davis</strong>&nbsp;Fantasia and Fugue in G minor, BWV 542&nbsp;<em>11&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><strong>Jessie Montgomery&nbsp;</strong>These Righteous Paths&nbsp;<em>20&rsquo;</em><br /><em>BBC co-commission: UK premiere</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Beethoven</strong>&nbsp;Symphony No. 9 in D minor, &lsquo;Choral&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>65&rsquo;&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Abel Selaocoe&nbsp;</strong><em>cello</em><br /><strong>Leah Hawkins&nbsp;</strong><em>soprano</em><br /><strong>Martin Muehle</strong>&nbsp;<em>tenor</em><br /><strong>Stephanie Wake-Edwards&nbsp;</strong><em>mezzo-soprano</em><br /><strong>Derek Welton</strong><em>&nbsp;bass</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Philharmonia Chorus</strong><br /><strong>BBC Philharmonic Orchestra&nbsp;</strong><br /><strong>Gianandrea Noseda&nbsp;</strong><em>conductor&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2148,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101654,\"PerformanceNumber\":101655,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-19T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-19T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"AEG presents \",\"Title\":\"An Evening with Art Garfunkel\",\"Suffix\":\"What A Wonderful World \",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Celebrated as the “Voice of Generations” in the entertainment history, Art Garfunkel is returning to the Hall in October 2026.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Art-Garfunkel-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7331&token=6415fa6e&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Art-Garfunkel-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7331&token=6415fa6e&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Art-Garfunkel-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7331&token=6415fa6e&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Art-Garfunkel-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7331&token=6415fa6e&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Art-Garfunkel-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7331&token=6415fa6e&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Art Garfunkel\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/101655\",\"Categories\":[],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/art-garfunkel\",\"DateDescription\":\"Monday 19 October 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#8c52de\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Art-Garfunkel-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7331&token=6415fa6e&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Art-Garfunkel-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7331&token=6415fa6e&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Art-Garfunkel-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7331&token=6415fa6e&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Art-Garfunkel-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7331&token=6415fa6e&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Art Garfunkel\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2148-101655\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101655,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101654,\"Date\":\"2026-10-19T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-04-17T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-10-19T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":45,\"MaximumPrice\":95,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"6\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>AEG presents&nbsp;<strong>Art Garfunkel&nbsp;What A Wonderful World</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Celebrated as the &ldquo;Voice of Generations&rdquo; in the entertainment history,&nbsp;<strong>Art Garfunkel</strong>&nbsp;is returning to the Hall in October 2026.</p>\\r\\n<p>He is an 8x Grammy Award winner including the Grammy Lifetime Achievement Award. In addition, he is a Rock and Roll Hall of Fame inductee, and Rolling Stone Magazine names him one of 100 Greatest Singers of All Time.</p>\\r\\n<p>As architect and lead singer of Simon &amp; Garfunkel, he shaped modern popular culture with songs such as&nbsp;<em>Bridge Over Troubled Water</em>,&nbsp;<em>The Sound of Silence</em>, and&nbsp;<em>Mrs. Robinson</em>. His voice defines eras and continues to influence artists and audiences worldwide.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2160,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99180,\"PerformanceNumber\":101744,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2027-04-07T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2027-04-07T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Philharmonic Orchestra presents\",\"Title\":\"Mahler ‘Resurrection’\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Vasily Petrenko conducts two outstanding singers and the mighty Philharmonia Chorus for Gustav Mahler’s ‘Resurrection’ Symphony.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/4-April/Mahler-Resurrection-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7347&token=32c1123f&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/4-April/Mahler-Resurrection-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7347&token=32c1123f&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/4-April/Mahler-Resurrection-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7347&token=32c1123f&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/4-April/Mahler-Resurrection-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7347&token=32c1123f&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/4-April/Mahler-Resurrection-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7347&token=32c1123f&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Two feathered wings with a yellow and orange filter over the image\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/101744\",\"Categories\":[\"Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/mahler-resurrection\",\"DateDescription\":\"Wednesday 7 April 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0d2626\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/4-April/Mahler-Resurrection-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7347&token=32c1123f&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/4-April/Mahler-Resurrection-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7347&token=32c1123f&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/4-April/Mahler-Resurrection-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7347&token=32c1123f&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/4-April/Mahler-Resurrection-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7347&token=32c1123f&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Two feathered wings with a yellow and orange filter over the image\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2160-101744\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101744,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99180,\"Date\":\"2027-04-07T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-04-28T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-04-07T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7,\"MaximumPrice\":287.25,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<h1>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra presents</h1>\\r\\n<h1>Mahler &lsquo;Resurrection&rsquo;</h1>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>A man stands alone at the grave of a friend. Shattered by grief, he cries out in sorrow and takes the first step on an odyssey that will take him to the end of the world &ndash; and beyond.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>This is&nbsp;<strong>Gustav Mahler</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>&lsquo;Resurrection&rsquo; Symphony</em>, and if it sounds epic on paper, just wait till you hear it live. It&rsquo;s quite simply overwhelming &ndash; and if you only know it from recordings, you really haven&rsquo;t heard it all. It could have been written for the Hall, so prepare yourself for the musical adventure of a lifetime, as RPO Music Director&nbsp;<strong>Vasily Petrenko</strong>&nbsp;conducts two outstanding singers and the mighty&nbsp;<strong>Philharmonia Chorus</strong>&nbsp;in music to shake the heavens &ndash; plus a haunting curtain-raiser from&nbsp;<strong>Arvo P&auml;rt</strong>.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>P&auml;rt</strong>&nbsp;Kanon Pokajanen: Ode VII&nbsp;<br /><strong>Mahler</strong>&nbsp;Symphony No.2, &lsquo;Resurrection&rsquo;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Vasily Petrenko&nbsp;</strong><em>conductor</em><br /><strong>Miah Persson&nbsp;</strong><em>soprano</em><br /><strong>Beth Taylor&nbsp;</strong><em>mezzo-soprano&nbsp;</em><br /><strong>Philharmonia Chorus</strong><br /><strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><em>Please note, there will be no interval in this performance.</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING </strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2134,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101116,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-03T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-03T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Berlin Philharmonic Plays Beethoven and Scriabin\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"The Berlin Philharmonic and Chief Conductor Kirill Petrenko return for their second Prom of the season, joining forces with Augustin Hadelich for Beethoven’s Violin Concerto before a performance Scriabin’s intoxicating Third Symphony.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-62-Berlin-Philharmonic-Plays-Beethoven-and-Scriabin-2820-x-1480-SEP-3.jpg?type=image&id=7215&token=22f1e991&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-62-Berlin-Philharmonic-Plays-Beethoven-and-Scriabin-2820-x-1480-SEP-3.jpg?type=image&id=7215&token=22f1e991&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-62-Berlin-Philharmonic-Plays-Beethoven-and-Scriabin-2820-x-1480-SEP-3.jpg?type=image&id=7215&token=22f1e991&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-62-Berlin-Philharmonic-Plays-Beethoven-and-Scriabin-2820-x-1480-SEP-3.jpg?type=image&id=7215&token=22f1e991&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-62-Berlin-Philharmonic-Plays-Beethoven-and-Scriabin-2820-x-1480-SEP-3.jpg?type=image&id=7215&token=22f1e991&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Augustin Hadelich\",\"caption\":\"Augustin Hadelich © Suxiao Yang\"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/berlin-philharmonic-plays-beethoven-and-scriabin\",\"DateDescription\":\"Thursday 3 September 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#342a83\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-62-Berlin-Philharmonic-Plays-Beethoven-and-Scriabin-2820-x-1480-SEP-3.jpg?type=image&id=7215&token=22f1e991&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-62-Berlin-Philharmonic-Plays-Beethoven-and-Scriabin-2820-x-1480-SEP-3.jpg?type=image&id=7215&token=22f1e991&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-62-Berlin-Philharmonic-Plays-Beethoven-and-Scriabin-2820-x-1480-SEP-3.jpg?type=image&id=7215&token=22f1e991&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-62-Berlin-Philharmonic-Plays-Beethoven-and-Scriabin-2820-x-1480-SEP-3.jpg?type=image&id=7215&token=22f1e991&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Augustin Hadelich\",\"caption\":\"Augustin Hadelich © Suxiao Yang\"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2134-101116\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101116,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-09-03T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-03T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":16.5,\"MaximumPrice\":110,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>The &lsquo;sumptuous&rsquo; and &lsquo;sublime&rsquo;&nbsp;<strong>Berlin Philharmonic</strong>&nbsp;and Chief Conductor&nbsp;<strong>Kirill Petrenko</strong>&nbsp;pair<strong>&nbsp;Beethoven</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Violin Concerto</em>&nbsp;&ndash; with the singing lyricism of its slow movement and exuberant dancing&nbsp;<em>Rondo&nbsp;</em>&ndash; with the rapturous musical tussle of&nbsp;<strong>Scriabin</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Third Symphony</em>: worldly pleasure and spiritual enlightenment locked in an intoxicating, mystical battle of wills, &lsquo;A joyful and liberating affirmation of &hellip; liberty and unity with the universe&rsquo;.</p>\\r\\n<p>Grammy Award-winning violinist&nbsp;<strong>Augustin Hadelich</strong>&nbsp;returns to the Proms following his &lsquo;intimate, poised and heartbreakingly direct&rsquo; performance of Mendelssohn&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Violin Concerto</em>&nbsp;last season.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Beethoven</strong>&nbsp;Violin Concerto in D major&nbsp;<em>42&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Scriabin</strong>&nbsp;Symphony No. 3 in C minor, &lsquo;The Divine Poem&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>50&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Augustin Hadelich&nbsp;</strong><em>violin</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Berlin Philharmonic</strong><br /><strong>Kirill Petrenko</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2132,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101117,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-02T18:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-02T18:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Berlin Philharmonic Plays Elgar and Tchaikovsky\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"The Berlin Philharmonic and Chief Conductor Kirill Petrenko return to the Proms with two works filled with musical secrets and concealed identities: Elgar’s ‘Enigma’ Variations and Tchaikovsky’s Symphony No. 4.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/R