e show</p>\\r\\n<p>*Hot bowl dishes and dessert canap&eacute;s served in the interval</p>\\r\\n<p>*A dedicated service waiter per box</p>\\r\\n<p>*A cracker and gift per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private hire of a box for 4 guests</p>\\r\\n<p>*Half bottle of Champagne, half bottle wine, mulled wine,</p>\\r\\n<p>*A selection of mineral water and soft drinks</p>\\r\\n<p>*Luxury canap&eacute;s and a cold bowl dish served pre show</p>\\r\\n<p>*Hot bowl dishes and dessert canap&eacute;s served in the interval</p>\\r\\n<p>*A dedicated service waiter per box</p>\\r\\n<p>*A cracker and gift per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":126,\"ContentType\":\"PT: BSL User\",\"Content\":\"<p>  Please select the assigned seats in the Stalls which are positioned for the best view of the BSL (British Sign Language) interpreter .</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":127,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Companion - BSL\",\"Content\":\"<p>This seat is for customers who are accompanying a BSL (British Sign Language) user.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":248,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Grand Tier Festive Pvt. Dining\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Grand Tier Box for 12 guests</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private dining room dressed with Christmas Tree</p>\\r\\n<p>*Half bottle of Champagne, half bottle wine, mineral water</p>\\r\\n<p>*Three course meal</p>\\r\\n<p>*Dessert canap&eacute;s served in interval</p>\\r\\n<p>*A dedicated room manager and service waiter</p>\\r\\n<p>*Exclusive hire of a Grand Tier Box located opposite private dining room</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":258,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: BSL User\",\"Content\":\"This seat is only for customers who require a view of the BSL (British Sign Language) interpreter. Please book alternative seats if you do not need this service.\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":259,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: Companion - BSL\",\"Content\":\"This seat is only for customers who are accompanying a BSL (British Sign Language) user. Please book alternative seats if you are not accompanying a BSL user.\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":408,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge Stalls\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include</p>\\r\\n<p>*Premium stalls seat <br />*Access to 1871 VIP lounge <br />*Canapes, bowl dishes, desserts served pre show and during the interval<br />*Wine, beer and soft drinks. </p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":416,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge Arena NEW\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Front Arena seat (within the first 7 rows)<br />*Glass of Champagne on arrival, wine, beer, soft drinks <br />*A festive menu served pre show in the Christmas VIP Lounge</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2094,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101142,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-08T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-08T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Berlioz’s ‘Symphonie fantastique’\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Thomas Adès conducts the National Youth Orchestra in a thrilling musical journey to Hell and back, featuring Liszt’s Mephisto Waltz No. 1, Berlioz’s Symphonie fantastique and Purgatorio, the central panel of Adès’s own Dante-inspired ballet.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-29-Berliozs-Symphonie-fantastique-2820-x-1480-AUG-8.jpg?type=image&id=7182&token=fa308920&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-29-Berliozs-Symphonie-fantastique-2820-x-1480-AUG-8.jpg?type=image&id=7182&token=fa308920&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-29-Berliozs-Symphonie-fantastique-2820-x-1480-AUG-8.jpg?type=image&id=7182&token=fa308920&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-29-Berliozs-Symphonie-fantastique-2820-x-1480-AUG-8.jpg?type=image&id=7182&token=fa308920&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-29-Berliozs-Symphonie-fantastique-2820-x-1480-AUG-8.jpg?type=image&id=7182&token=fa308920&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Thomas Adès\",\"caption\":\"Thomas Adès © Mathias Benguigui  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Opera\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/berliozs-symphonie-fantastique\",\"DateDescription\":\"Saturday 8 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#ef911f\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-29-Berliozs-Symphonie-fantastique-2820-x-1480-AUG-8.jpg?type=image&id=7182&token=fa308920&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-29-Berliozs-Symphonie-fantastique-2820-x-1480-AUG-8.jpg?type=image&id=7182&token=fa308920&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-29-Berliozs-Symphonie-fantastique-2820-x-1480-AUG-8.jpg?type=image&id=7182&token=fa308920&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-29-Berliozs-Symphonie-fantastique-2820-x-1480-AUG-8.jpg?type=image&id=7182&token=fa308920&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Thomas Adès\",\"caption\":\"Thomas Adès © Mathias Benguigui  \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2094-101142\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101142,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-08T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-08T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7.23,\"MaximumPrice\":68,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-29-Berliozs-Symphonie-fantastique-2820-x-1480-AUG-8.jpg?type=image&id=7182&token=fa308920\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Does the Devil really have all the best tunes? When it comes to classical music, he just might.&nbsp;<strong>Thomas Ad&egrave;s</strong>&nbsp;conducts the&nbsp;<strong>National Youth Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; over 150 of Britain&rsquo;s most talented teenagers &ndash; in a thrilling musical journey to Hell and back.</p>\\r\\n<p>Follow&nbsp;<strong>Faust</strong>&nbsp;into the irresistible, whirling dance of&nbsp;<strong>Liszt</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Mephisto Waltz No. 1</em>; contemplate Purgatory, &lsquo;a sort of pre-dawn, before the sun of Paradise&rsquo;, in Purgatorio &ndash; the central panel of&nbsp;<strong>Ad&egrave;s</strong>&rsquo;s own Grammy Award- winning, Dante-inspired ballet; and surrender to the vast soundscapes and phantasmagoria of&nbsp;<strong>Berlioz</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Symphonie fantastique</em>, culminating in a horrifying &lsquo;Witches&rsquo; Sabbath&rsquo;.</p>\\r\\n<p><em>B</em><em>roadcast on BBC TV and BBC iPlayer</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Liszt&nbsp;</strong>Mephisto Waltz No. 1&nbsp;<em>11&rsquo;</em>&nbsp;<br /><strong>Thomas Ad&egrave;s&nbsp;</strong>Dante &ndash; Part 2: Purgatorio&nbsp;<em>24&rsquo;&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Berlioz</strong>&nbsp;Symphonie fantastique&nbsp;<em>49&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Julien Henric&nbsp;</strong><em>tenor&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>National Youth Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Thomas Ad&egrave;s</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2129,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101152,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-30T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-30T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Berlioz’s ‘The Damnation of Faust’\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Jakob Lehmann and period-instrument group Les Siècles bring to life Berlioz’s ‘Dramatic Legend’ in a concert performance with an international cast of soloists, including American tenor John Osborn, Gerald Finley and Véronique Gens.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-57-Berliozs-The-Damnation-of-Faust-2820-x-1480-AUG-30.jpg?type=image&id=7210&token=992cefa3&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-57-Berliozs-The-Damnation-of-Faust-2820-x-1480-AUG-30.jpg?type=image&id=7210&token=992cefa3&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-57-Berliozs-The-Damnation-of-Faust-2820-x-1480-AUG-30.jpg?type=image&id=7210&token=992cefa3&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-57-Berliozs-The-Damnation-of-Faust-2820-x-1480-AUG-30.jpg?type=image&id=7210&token=992cefa3&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-57-Berliozs-The-Damnation-of-Faust-2820-x-1480-AUG-30.jpg?type=image&id=7210&token=992cefa3&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Véronique Gens\",\"caption\":\"Véronique Gens © Jean-Baptiste Millot\"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Opera\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/berliozs-the-damnation-of-faust\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 30 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#ef911f\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-57-Berliozs-The-Damnation-of-Faust-2820-x-1480-AUG-30.jpg?type=image&id=7210&token=992cefa3&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-57-Berliozs-The-Damnation-of-Faust-2820-x-1480-AUG-30.jpg?type=image&id=7210&token=992cefa3&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-57-Berliozs-The-Damnation-of-Faust-2820-x-1480-AUG-30.jpg?type=image&id=7210&token=992cefa3&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-57-Berliozs-The-Damnation-of-Faust-2820-x-1480-AUG-30.jpg?type=image&id=7210&token=992cefa3&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Véronique Gens\",\"caption\":\"Véronique Gens © Jean-Baptiste Millot\"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2129-101152\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101152,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-30T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-30T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7.23,\"MaximumPrice\":68,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-57-Berliozs-The-Damnation-of-Faust-2820-x-1480-AUG-30.jpg?type=image&id=7210&token=992cefa3\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Berlioz</strong>&rsquo;s &lsquo;Dramatic Legend&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>The Damnation of Faust&nbsp;</em>is an operatic thrill-ride, a tour de force for orchestra, chorus and soloists that throws all of music&rsquo;s capacity at one simple question: what is the price of the human soul? A story of heaven and hell, of demons and angels is best staged in sound and imagination &ndash; too cinematic for the confines of the stage.</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Jakob Lehmann</strong>&nbsp;and the period musicians of&nbsp;<strong>Les Si&egrave;cles</strong>&nbsp;bring it to life in a concert performance with an international cast of soloists, including American tenor&nbsp;<strong>John Osborn</strong>&nbsp;in the title-role,&nbsp;<strong>Gerald Finley</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>V&eacute;ronique Gens</strong>.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Berlioz</strong>&nbsp;The Damnation of Faust<em>&nbsp;130&rsquo;</em><br /><em>(concert performance; sung in French, with English surtitles)&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>John Osborn&nbsp;</strong><em>Faust</em><br /><strong>V&eacute;ronique Gens&nbsp;</strong><em>Marguerite</em><br /><strong>Gerald Finley&nbsp;</strong><em>M&eacute;phistoph&eacute;l&egrave;s</em><br /><strong>Thomas Doli&eacute;&nbsp;</strong><em>Brander</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Ma&icirc;trise de Radio France</strong><br /><strong>Choeur de Radio France</strong><br /><strong>Les Si&egrave;cles</strong><br /><strong>Jakob Lehmann&nbsp;</strong><em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n<p><em>There will be one interval.</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2066,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101157,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-07-19T11:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-07-19T11:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Black Dyke Band\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Yorkshire’s esteemed Black Dyke Band shows off its virtuosity and versatility in a programme of contemporary pieces, arrangements of popular classics and excerpts from soundtracks by John Williams and Hans Zimmer.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-3-Black-Dyke-Band-2820-x-1480-JUL-19.jpg?type=image&id=7158&token=26fd0d91&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-3-Black-Dyke-Band-2820-x-1480-JUL-19.jpg?type=image&id=7158&token=26fd0d91