 tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2179,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101649,\"PerformanceNumber\":101650,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-11-26T19:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-11-26T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Live Nation presents\",\"Title\":\"BICEP\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Following a three-year hiatus, BICEP LIVE returns for a special show at the Hall on Thursday 26 November 2026.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/BICEP-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7464&token=5fb6d1c4&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/BICEP-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7464&token=5fb6d1c4&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/BICEP-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7464&token=5fb6d1c4&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/BICEP-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7464&token=5fb6d1c4&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/BICEP-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7464&token=5fb6d1c4&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"BICEP\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/101650\",\"Categories\":[\"Electronic\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/bicep\",\"DateDescription\":\"Thursday 26 November 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f2e861\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/BICEP-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7464&token=5fb6d1c4&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/BICEP-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7464&token=5fb6d1c4&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/BICEP-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7464&token=5fb6d1c4&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/BICEP-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7464&token=5fb6d1c4&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"BICEP\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2179-101650\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101650,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101649,\"Date\":\"2026-11-26T19:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-15T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-11-26T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":45,\"MaximumPrice\":95,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"6\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":63,\"ContentType\":\"T&C Checkbox\",\"Content\":\"<p>Reselling a ticket, other than through Twickets, makes it void and the ticketholder may be refused entry. Tickets sold via third parties and other unauthorised outlets, including online auction sites, are not valid for admission.&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<header>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Live Nation presents</h2>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</header>\\r\\n<div data-swiftype-index=\\\"true\\\">\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Following a three-year hiatus,&nbsp;<strong>BICEP</strong>&nbsp;LIVE returns for a special show at the Hall on Thursday 26 November 2026.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>For fans who have been clamouring for the duo&rsquo;s return while they&rsquo;ve been locked away in the studio working on a new BICEP album &ndash; alongside rolling out their recent&nbsp;<em>CHROMA</em>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>TAKKUUK</em>&nbsp;projects &ndash; the night promises brand new material alongside classic BICEP tracks, performed in one of the UK&rsquo;s most storied live music venues.</p>\\r\\n<p>Debuting in 2017, their BICEP LIVE show is now an infamous spectacle, renowned for its epic, immersive production and visuals from Black Box Echo&rsquo;s&nbsp;<strong>Zak Norman</strong>. Their subsequent touring has seen them play across some of the world&rsquo;s most revered festival stages, as well as sold-out headline shows across the UK, Europe, North America and beyond.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2106,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101146,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-16T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-16T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Elgar’s Cello Concerto\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Spanish cellist Pablo Ferrández makes his Proms debut with Elgar’s famous concerto. He joins Vasily Petrenko and the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra for a concert that opens with Webern’s lush Passacaglia and closes with Walton’s Symphony No. 2.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-40-Elgars-Cello-Concerto-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7193&token=e29aaeca&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-40-Elgars-Cello-Concerto-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7193&token=e29aaeca&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-40-Elgars-Cello-Concerto-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7193&token=e29aaeca&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-40-Elgars-Cello-Concerto-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7193&token=e29aaeca&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-40-Elgars-Cello-Concerto-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7193&token=e29aaeca&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Pablo Ferrández\",\"caption\":\"Pablo Ferrández © Mario Wurzburger  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/elgars-cello-concerto\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 16 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f5d8e9\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-40-Elgars-Cello-Concerto-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7193&token=e29aaeca&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-40-Elgars-Cello-Concerto-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7193&token=e29aaeca&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-40-Elgars-Cello-Concerto-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7193&token=e29aaeca&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-40-Elgars-Cello-Concerto-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7193&token=e29aaeca&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Pablo Ferrández\",\"caption\":\"Pablo Ferrández © Mario Wurzburger  \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2106-101146\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101146,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-16T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-16T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7.23,\"MaximumPrice\":68,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-40-Elgars-Cello-Concerto-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7193&token=e29aaeca\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><em>Le Figaro</em>&nbsp;called him a &lsquo;new cello genius&rsquo;. Now prize-winning Spanish cellist&nbsp;<strong>Pablo Ferr&aacute;ndez</strong>&nbsp;makes his Proms debut with&nbsp;<strong>Elgar</strong>&rsquo;s achingly passionate concerto.</p>\\r\\n<p>He joins&nbsp;<strong>Vasily Petrenko</strong>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;for a programme that measures out the griefs, conflicts and shifting identities of the 20th century &ndash; opening with&nbsp;<strong>Webern</strong>&rsquo;s lushly Romantic 1908&nbsp;<em>Passacaglia</em>, whose sequence of intricate variations finds a ghostly echo in the finale of&nbsp;<strong>Walton</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Second Symphony</em>. Premiered in 1960, the latter work looks back rather than forwards, rejecting the avant-garde in favour of a dense, Expressionistic intensity.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Webern</strong>&nbsp;Passacaglia&nbsp;<em>11&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><strong>Elgar</strong>&nbsp;Cello Concerto in E minor&nbsp;<em>30&rsquo;&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Walton</strong>&nbsp;Symphony No. 2&nbsp;<em>28&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Pablo Ferr&aacute;ndez&nbsp;</strong><em>cello</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Vasily Petrenko</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n<section data-swiftype-index=\\\"false\\\">\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Part of the</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1837,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":98158,\"PerformanceNumber\":98159,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-09T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-09T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Black Panther in Concert (12A)\",\"Suffix\":\"with Chineke! Orchestra\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"See the Marvel Studios box office hit accompanied by Chineke! Orchestra and talking drum soloist Massamba Diop.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Black-Panther/DIC_BP_14.jpg?type=image&id=5618&token=a6a737cb&mode=fill&top=0&left=0&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Black-Panther/DIC_BP_14.jpg?type=image&id=5618&token=a6a737cb&mode=fill&top=0&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Black-Panther/DIC_BP_14.jpg?type=image&id=5618&token=a6a737cb&mode=fill&top=0&left=0&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Black-Panther/DIC_BP_14.jpg?type=image&id=5618&token=a6a737cb&mode=fill&top=0&left=0&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Ima