 with the Mahler Academy Orchestra\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Musicians from across Europe come together under Philipp von Steinaecker in the Mahler Academy Orchestra’s Proms debut. They perform Mahler’s monumental Ninth Symphony, journeying from the first movement’s brooding farewell to the radiant finale.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-72-Mahlers-9th-2820-x-1480-SEP-11.jpg?type=image&id=7225&token=119abcbb&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-72-Mahlers-9th-2820-x-1480-SEP-11.jpg?type=image&id=7225&token=119abcbb&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-72-Mahlers-9th-2820-x-1480-SEP-11.jpg?type=image&id=7225&token=119abcbb&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-72-Mahlers-9th-2820-x-1480-SEP-11.jpg?type=image&id=7225&token=119abcbb&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-72-Mahlers-9th-2820-x-1480-SEP-11.jpg?type=image&id=7225&token=119abcbb&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Philipp von Steinaecker\",\"caption\":\"Philipp von Steinaecker © Marco Caselli Nirmal \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/