reserved table seating assigned on the day. It is very likely you will be asked to share a table with other patrons. Programme is subject to change.  Not recommend for under 5s\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":407,\"ContentType\":\"OLD BA\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2113,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101176,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-23T11:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-23T11:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Mozart’s ‘Haffner’ Symphony\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"The Academy of St Martin in the Fields spotlights the French horn and bassoon in concertos by Mozart and Thea Musgrave. Britten’s playful Simple Symphony and Mozart’s ‘Haffner’ Symphony bookend the concert.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-47-Mozarts-Haffner-Symphony-2820-x-1480-AUG-23.jpg?type=image&id=7200&token=0b3362f4&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-47-Mozarts-Haffner-Symphony-2820-x-1480-AUG-23.jpg?type=image&id=7200&token=0b3362f4&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-47-Mozarts-Haffner-Symphony-2820-x-1480-AUG-23.jpg?type=image&id=7200&token=0b3362f4&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-47-Mozarts-Haffner-Symphony-2820-x-1480-AUG-23.jpg?type=image&id=7200&token=0b3362f4&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-47-Mozarts-Haffner-Symphony-2820-x-1480-AUG-23.jpg?type=image&id=7200&token=0b3362f4&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Felix Klieser\",\"caption\":\"Felix Klieser © MJ Kim  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/mozarts-haffner-symphony\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 23 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#ef911f\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-47-Mozarts-Haffner-Symphony-2820-x-1480-AUG-23.jpg?type=image&id=7200&token=0b3362f4&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-47-Mozarts-Haffner-Symphony-2820-x-1480-AUG-23.jpg?type=image&id=7200&token=0b3362f4&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-47-Mozarts-Haffner-Symphony-2820-x-1480-AUG-23.jpg?type=image&id=7200&token=0b3362f4&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-47-Mozarts-Haffner-Symphony-2820-x-1480-AUG-23.jpg?type=image&id=7200&token=0b3362f4&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Felix Klieser\",\"caption\":\"Felix Klieser © MJ Kim  \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2113-101176\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101176,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-23T11:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Morning\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-23T10:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":5.95,\"MaximumPrice\":56,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-47-Mozarts-Haffner-Symphony-2820-x-1480-AUG-23.jpg?type=image&id=7200&token=0b3362f4\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Academy of St Martin in the Fields</strong>&nbsp;spotlights the French horn and bassoon in two concertos: one classic, one contemporary. The ink is still wet on veteran Scottish composer&nbsp;<strong>Thea Musgrave</strong>&rsquo;s new&nbsp;<em>Bassoon Concerto, &lsquo;Out of the Darkness&rsquo;</em>, receiving its world premiere.</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Mozart</strong>&rsquo;s good-natured&nbsp;<em>Horn Concerto No. 3&nbsp;</em>ends with a rollicking Allegro that&rsquo;s hard to resist. There are more dancing rhythms from&nbsp;<strong>Britten</strong>&rsquo;s playful&nbsp;<em>Simple Symphony</em>&nbsp;&ndash; based on themes written by the composer before the age of 12.</p>\\r\\n<p><em>Broadcast on BBC TV and BBC iPlayer.</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Britten</strong>&nbsp;Simple Symphony&nbsp;<em>17&rsquo;</em>&nbsp;<br /><strong>Mozart&nbsp;</strong>Horn Concerto No. 3 in E flat major&nbsp;<em>16&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Thea Musgraves</strong>&nbsp;Bassoon Concerto, &lsquo;Out of the Darkness&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>c12&rsquo;</em><br /><em>BBC commission: world premiere</em><br /><strong>Elgar</strong>&nbsp;Romance for bassoon and orchestra&nbsp;<em>5&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>Mozart</strong>&nbsp;Symphony No. 35 in D major, &lsquo;Haffner&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>18&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Felix Klieser</strong><em>&nbsp;horn</em><br /><strong>Amy Harman&nbsp;</strong><em>bassoon</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Academy of St Martin in the Fields</strong><br /><strong>Benjamin Marquise Gilmore</strong>&nbsp;<em>director/leader</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2076,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101161,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-07-26T11:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-07-26T11:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Olivier Latry Plays Bach\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Titular Organist of the Grand Organ at Notre-Dame in Paris, Olivier Latry returns for an all-Bach programme including an improvisation on Bach’s musical signature \",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-J