\"Date\":\"2026-08-07T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-07T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":5.95,\"MaximumPrice\":56,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Nil-Venditti-2820x1480.jpg?type=image&id=7389&token=d1ba1afb\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Fragments of Gregorian chant are reassembled in the jewel-toned mosaic that is&nbsp;<strong>Respighi</strong>&rsquo;s 1927&nbsp;<em>Church Windows</em>&nbsp;&ndash; given its Proms debut by&nbsp;<strong>Nil Venditti</strong>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<strong>BBC Symphony Orchestra</strong>. Four richly scored orchestral movements each depict a different scene in sound: a shimmering nocturne for &lsquo;The Flight into Egypt&rsquo;, a luminous portrait of St Clare and explosive martial conflict for &lsquo;The Archangel Saint Michael&rsquo;.</p>\\r\\n<p>Ancient musical models also inspired&nbsp;<strong>Rossini</strong>&rsquo;s operatic&nbsp;<em>Stabat mater</em>&nbsp;&ndash; a powerful spiritual statement from the master of secular drama.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Respighi&nbsp;</strong>Church Windows&nbsp;<em>27&rsquo;&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Rossini&nbsp;</strong>Stabat mater&nbsp;<em>61&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Federica Lombardi&nbsp;</strong><em>soprano</em><br /><strong>Chiara Amar&ugrave;&nbsp;</strong><em>mezzo-soprano</em><br /><strong>Ren&eacute; Barbera&nbsp;</strong><em>tenor</em><br /><strong>Nicola Ulivieri&nbsp;</strong><em>bass</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Epiphoni Consort</strong><br /><strong>BBC Symphony Chorus</strong><br /><strong>BBC Symphony Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Nil Venditti</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2097,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101172,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Salonen Conducts 20th-Century Classics\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Esa-Pekka Salonen conducts the combined orchestras of London’s Royal Academy of Music and New York’s Juilliard School in three 20th-century masterworks by Bartók, Stravinsky and Berg.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-32-Salonen-Conducts-20th-Century-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-10.jpg?type=image&id=7185&token=61b65f9d&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-32-Salonen-Conducts-20th-Century-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-10.jpg?type=image&id=7185&token=61b65f9d&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-32-Salonen-Conducts-20th-Century-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-10.jpg?type=image&id=7185&token=61b65f9d&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-32-Salonen-Conducts-20th-Century-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-10.jpg?type=image&id=7185&token=61b65f9d&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-32-Salonen-Conducts-20th-Century-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-10.jpg?type=image&id=7185&token=61b65f9d&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Vilde Frang\",\"caption\":\"Vilde Frang © Marco Borggreve  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/salonen-conducts-20th-century-classics\",\"DateDescription\":\"Monday 10 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#342a83\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-32-Salonen-Conducts-20th-Century-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-10.jpg?type=image&id=7185&token=61b65f9d&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-32-Salonen-Conducts-20th-Century-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-10.jpg?type=image&id=7185&token=61b65f9d&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-32-Salonen-Conducts-20th-Century-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-10.jpg?type=image&id=7185&token=61b65f9d&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-32-Salonen-Conducts-20th-Century-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-10.jpg?type=image&id=7185&token=61b65f9d&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Vilde Frang\",\"caption\":\"Vilde Frang © Marco Borggreve  \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2097-101172\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101172,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-10T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-10T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":5.95,\"MaximumPrice\":56,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-32-Salonen-Conducts-20th-Century-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-10.jpg?type=image&id=7185&token=61b65f9d\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Esa-Pekka Salonen&nbsp;</strong>conducts the combined orchestras of London&rsquo;s&nbsp;<strong>Royal Academy of Music</strong>&nbsp;and New York&rsquo;s&nbsp;<strong>Juilliard School&nbsp;</strong>in three 20th-century orchestral masterworks. Award-winning Norwegian violinist&nbsp;<strong>Vilde Frang</strong>&nbsp;is the soloist in&nbsp;<strong>Berg</strong>&rsquo;s heartbreaking elegy of a&nbsp;<em>Violin Concerto</em>, with its embedded&nbsp;<strong>Bach</strong>&nbsp;chorale, dedicated &lsquo;to the memory of an angel&rsquo;.</p>\\r\\n<p>Completed in the dying days of the Second World War,&nbsp;<strong>Stravinsky</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Symphony in Three Movements</em>&nbsp;offers a &lsquo;cinematographic impression of the war&rsquo; &ndash; jagged and convulsively rhythmic.</p>\\r\\n<p>Moving &lsquo;from austerity to the affirmation of life&rsquo;,&nbsp;<strong>Bart&oacute;k</strong>&rsquo;s 1943&nbsp;<em>Concerto for Orchestra</em>&nbsp;responds more optimistically to war, defiant in its folk-inspired melodies and collective virtuosity.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Stravinsky</strong>&nbsp;Symphony in Three Movements&nbsp;<em>22&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><strong>Berg</strong>&nbsp;Violin Concerto&nbsp;<em>22&rsquo;&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Bart&oacute;k&nbsp;</strong>Concerto for Orchestra&nbsp;<em>36&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Vilde Frang</strong>&nbsp;<em>violin</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Juilliard Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Royal Academy of Music Symphony Orchestra&nbsp;</strong><br /><strong>Esa-Pekka Salonen</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2108,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101164,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Shostakovich’s Tenth\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Cristian Măcelaru leads the BBC Symphony Orchestra in one of the great masterpieces of the 20th century, Shostakovich’s Symphony No. 10. The concert opens with the UK premiere of Édith Canat de Chizy’s intricately textured Skyline.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-42-Shostakovichs-Tenth-2820-x-1480-AUG-18.jpg?type=image&id=7195&token=92b5c227&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-42-Shostakovichs-Tenth-2820-x-1480-AUG-18.jpg?type=image&id=7195&token=92b5c227&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-42-Shostakovichs-Tenth-2820-x-1480-AUG-18.jpg?type=image&id=7195&token=92b5c227&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-42-Shostakovichs-Tenth-2820-x-1480-AUG-18.jpg?type=image&id=7195&token=92b5c227&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-42-Shostakovichs-Tenth-2820-x-1480-AUG-18.jpg?type=image&id=7195&token=92b5c227&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Cristian Mǎcelaru\",\"caption\":\"Cristian Mǎcelaru © Peter Adamik  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/shostakovichs-tenth\",\"DateDescription\":\"Tuesday 18 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0093dd\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-42-Shostakovichs-Tenth-2820-x-1480-AUG-18.jpg?type=image&id=7195&token=92b5c227&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-42-Shostakovichs-Tenth-2820-x-1480-AUG-18.jpg?type=image&id=7195&token=92b5c227&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-42-Shostakovichs-Tenth-2820-x-1480-AUG-18.jpg?type=image&id=7195&token=92b5c227&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-42-Shostakovichs-Tenth-2820-x-1480-AUG-18.jpg?type=image&id=7195&token=92b5c227&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Cristian Mǎcelaru\",\"caption\":\"Cristian Mǎcelaru © Peter Adamik  \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2108-101164\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101164,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-18T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":5.1,\"MaximumPrice\":46,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-42-Shostakovichs-Tenth-2820-x-1480-AUG-18.jpg?type=image&id=7195&token=92b5c227\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Cristian Macelaru</strong>, whose own childhood was spent in communist Romania, conducts the&nbsp;<strong>BBC Symphony Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<strong>Shostakovich</strong>&rsquo;s devastatingly powerful&nbsp;<em>Symphony No. 10</em>. Premiered after Stalin&rsquo;s death in 1953, it&rsquo;s a work whose fierce rage, violence and grief tell a terrifying story of life in the dictator&rsquo;s Russia &ndash; a painfully personal history, and one shot through with the composer&rsquo;s own musical signature: DSCH.</p>\\r\\n<p>The concert opens with the UK premiere of&nbsp;<strong>&Eacute;dith Canat de Chizy</strong>&rsquo;s intricately textured&nbsp;<em>Skyline</em>&nbsp;for three percussionists, timpani and orchestra &ndash; a musical vision of the cosmos, from void to teeming, multiplying musical life.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>&Eacute;dith Canat de Chizy</strong>&nbsp;Skyline (Concerto for three percussionists, timpani and orchestra)&nbsp;<em>20&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><em>BBC co-commission: UK premiere</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Shostakovich&nbsp;</strong>Symphony No. 10 in E minor&nbsp;<em>55&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>BBC Symphony Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Cristian Macelaru</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2080,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101166,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-07-28T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-07-28T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Sibelius’s Second\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Guy Johnston is the soloist in Benjamin Britten’s Cello Symphony. He joins the BBC Symphony Orchestra and Sakari Oramo, who also perform Sibelius’s Symphony No. 2 and the UK premiere of Mark-Anthony Turnage’s Festen Suite.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-16-Sibeliuss-Second-2820-x-1480-JUL-28.jpg?type=image&id=7170&token=2f69d3db&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-16-Sibeliuss-Second-2820-x-1480-JUL-28.jpg?type=image&id=7170&token=2f69d3db&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-16-Sibeliuss-Second-2820-x-1480-JUL-28.jpg?type=image&id=7170&token=2f69d3db&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-16-Sibeliuss-Second-2820-x-1480-JUL-28.jpg?type=image&id=7170&token=2f69d3db&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-16-Sibeliuss-Second-2820-x-1480-JUL-28.jpg?type=image&id=7170&token=2f69d3db&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Guy Johnston\",\"caption\":\"Guy Johnston © Frances Marshall \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/sibeliuss-second\",\"DateDescription\":\"Tuesday 28 July 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f5d8e9\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-16-Sibeliuss-Second-2820-x-1480-JUL-28.jpg?type=image&id=7170&token=2f69d3db&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-16-Sibeliuss-Second-2820-x-1480-JUL-28.jpg?type=image&id=7170&token=2f69d3db&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-16-Sibeliuss-Second-2820-x-1480-JUL-28.jpg?type=image&id=7170&token=2f69d3db&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-16-Sibeliuss-Second-2820-x-1480-JUL-28.jpg?type=image&id=7170&token=2f69d3db&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Guy Johnston\",\"caption\":\"Guy Johnston © Frances Marshall \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2080-101166\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101166,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-07-28T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-07-28T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":5.95,\"MaximumPrice\":56,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-16-Sibeliuss-Second-2820-x-1480-JUL-28.jpg?type=image&id=7170&token=2f69d3db\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Fifty years since&nbsp;<strong>Benjamin Britten</strong>&rsquo;s death, former BBC Young Musician winner&nbsp;<strong>Guy Johnston</strong>&nbsp;brings the composer&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Cello Symphony</em>&nbsp;to the Proms. Originally written for Mstislav Rostropovich, it&rsquo;s the composer at his most intense: a tour de force for the soloist, set against a brooding, often eerie orchestral backdrop.</p>\\r\\n<p>There&rsquo;s darkness in&nbsp;<strong>Sibelius</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Symphony No. 2</em>&nbsp;as well &ndash; gloriously thrown aside in the glowing finale &ndash; but is it the weight of Russian political oppression or of personal loss? The concert opens with the UK premiere of&nbsp;<strong>Mark-Anthony Turnage</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Festen Suite</em>, adapted from the composer&rsquo;s multi-Olivier-Award-winning 2025 opera.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Mark-Anthony Turnage</strong>&nbsp;Festen Suite&nbsp;<em>21&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><em>BBC co-commission: UK premiere</em><br /><strong>Britten</strong>&nbsp;Cello Symphony&nbsp;<em>34&rsquo;&nbsp;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Sibelius</strong>&nbsp;Symphony No. 2 in D major&nbsp;<em>40&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Guy Johnston&nbsp;</strong><em>cello</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>BBC Symphony Orchestra&nbsp;</strong><br /><strong>Sakari Oramo</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2133,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101124,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-02T22:15:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-02T22:15:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Steve Reich at 9