ive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-61-Steve-Reich-at-90-2820-x-1480-SEP-2.jpg?type=image&id=7214&token=0d4d120d\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2142,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101182,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Strauss’s ‘Four Last Songs’\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Paweł Kapuła conducts the BBC Scottish Symphony Orchestra for its final Prom of the season. They perform works by Hans Werner Henze, Schubert and Mahler before soprano Natalya Romaniw takes to the stage for Richard Strauss’s famous musical farewell.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-70-Strausss-Four-Last-Songs-2820-x-1480-SEP-9.jpg?type=image&id=7223&token=81aac0eb&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-70-Strausss-Four-Last-Songs-2820-x-1480-SEP-9.jpg?type=image&id=7223&token=81aac0eb&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-70-Strausss-Four-Last-Songs-2820-x-1480-SEP-9.jpg?type=image&id=7223&token=81aac0eb&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-70-Strausss-Four-Last-Songs-2820-x-1480-SEP-9.jpg?type=image&id=7223&token=81aac0eb&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-70-Strausss-Four-Last-Songs-2820-x-1480-SEP-9.jpg?type=image&id=7223&token=81aac0eb&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Natalya Romaniw\",\"caption\":\"Natalya Romaniw © Frances Marshall \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/strausss-four-last-songs\",\"DateDescription\":\"Wednesday 9 September 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0093dd\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-70-Strausss-Four-Last-Songs-2820-x-1480-SEP-9.jpg?type=image&id=7223&token=81aac0eb&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-70-Strausss-Four-Last-Songs-2820-x-1480-SEP-9.jpg?type=image&id=7223&token=81aac0eb&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-70-Strausss-Four-Last-Songs-2820-x-1480-SEP-9.jpg?type=image&id=7223&token=81aac0eb&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-70-Strausss-Four-Last-Songs-2820-x-1480-SEP-9.jpg?type=image&id=7223&token=81aac0eb&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Natalya Romaniw\",\"caption\":\"Natalya Romaniw © Frances Marshall \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2142-101182\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101182,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-09-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-09T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7,\"MaximumPrice\":56,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-70-Strausss-Four-Last-Songs-2820-x-1480-SEP-9.jpg?type=image&id=7223&token=81aac0eb\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Schubert</strong>&rsquo;s &lsquo;<em>Unfinished</em>&rsquo;, one of at least three symphonies he left incomplete at his death, is one of his most popular, combining private drama with lyrical sweetness. The same composer&rsquo;s alarming song &lsquo;<em>Erlk&ouml;nig</em>&rsquo; inspired Hans Werner Henze to create his vivid orchestral fantasy evoking a terrifying, supernatural night-ride.</p>\\r\\n<p>&lsquo;My new god&rsquo; was what&nbsp;<strong>Benjamin Britten</strong>&nbsp;discovered on hearing his first&nbsp;<strong>Mahler</strong>&nbsp;symphony soon after leaving school. His arrangement of&nbsp;<em>&lsquo;What the Wild Flowers Tell Me&rsquo;</em>, the second movement of Mahler&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Third Symphony</em>, reclothes a piece inspired by the abundant blooms around the Austrian composer&rsquo;s lakeside composing hut by the Swiss Alps.</p>\\r\\n<p>First performed at the Royal Albert Hall in 1950,&nbsp;<strong>Richard Strauss</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Four Last Songs</em>&nbsp;is the composer&rsquo;s achingly nostalgic musical farewell.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Henze</strong>&nbsp;Erlk&ouml;nig &ndash; orchestral fantasy&nbsp;<em>6&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>Schubert</strong>&nbsp;Symphony No. 8 in B minor, &lsquo;Unfinished&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>25&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Mahler, arr. Britten&nbsp;</strong>What the Wild Flowers Tell Me&nbsp;<em>10&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>R. Strauss</strong>&nbsp;Four Last Songs&nbsp;<em>24&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Natalya Romaniw&nbsp;</strong><em>soprano</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>BBC Scottish Symphony Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Pawel Kapula</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2127,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101151,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-29T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-29T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Stravinsky and Prokofiev with the Oslo Philharmonic\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Mirga Gražinytė-Tyla and the Oslo Philharmonic join maverick virtuoso Patricia Kopatchinskaja for Stravinsky’s Violin Concerto. We also hear Øyvind Torvund’s symphonic poem ‘Forest Morning’ and excerpts from Prokofiev’s ballet Romeo and Juliet.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-55-Stravinsky-and-Prokofiev-with-the-Oslo-Philharmonic-2820-x-1480-AUG-29.jpg?type=image&id=7208&token=16f970f2&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-55-Stravinsky-and-Prokofiev-with-the-Oslo-Philharmonic-2820-x-1480-AUG-29.jpg?type=image&id=7208&token=16f970f2&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-55-Stravinsky-and-Prokofiev-with-the-Oslo-Philharmonic-2820-x-1480-AUG-29.jpg?type=image&id=7208&token=16f970f2&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-55-Stravinsky-and-Prokofiev-with-the-Oslo-Philharmonic-2820-x-1480-AUG-29.jpg?type=image&id=7208&token=16f970f2&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-55-Stravinsky-and-Prokofiev-with-the-Oslo-Philharmonic-2820-x-1480-AUG-29.jpg?type=image&id=7208&token=16f970f2&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Patricia Kopatchinskaja \",\"caption\":\"Patricia Kopatchinskaja © Marco Borggreve  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/stravinsky-and-prokofiev-with-the-oslo-philharmonic\",\"DateDescription\":\"Saturday 29 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0093dd\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-55-Stravinsky-and-Prokofiev-with-the-Oslo-Philharmonic-2820-x-1480-AUG-29.jpg?type=image&id=7208&token=16f970f2&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-55-Stravinsky-and-Prokofiev-with-the-Oslo-Philharmonic-2820-x-1480-AUG-29.jpg?type=image&id=7208&token=16f970f2&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-55-Stravinsky-and-Prokofiev-with-the-Oslo-Philharmonic-2820-x-1480-AUG-29.jpg?type=image&id=7208&token=16f970f2&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-55-Stravinsky-and-Prokofiev-with-the-Oslo-Philharmonic-2820-x-1480-AUG-29.jpg?type=image&id=7208&token=16f970f2&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Patricia Kopatchinskaja \",\"caption\":\"Patricia Kopatchinskaja © Marco Borggreve  \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2127-101151\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101151,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-29T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-29T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7.23,\"MaximumPrice\":68,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-55-Stravinsky-and-Prokofiev-with-the-Oslo-Philharmonic-2820-x-1480-AUG-29.jpg?type=image&id=7208&token=16f970f2\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Powerhouse conductor&nbsp;<strong>Mirga Gražinyte-Tyla</strong>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<strong>Oslo Philharmonic</strong>&nbsp;team up with maverick virtuoso&nbsp;<strong>Patricia Kopatchinskaja&nbsp;</strong>for&nbsp;<strong>Stravinsky</strong>&rsquo;s Bach-inspired&nbsp;<em>Violin Concerto</em>&nbsp;&ndash; a ferociously demanding work that showcases all the violinist&rsquo;s signature &lsquo;beauty, passion and imagination&rsquo;.</p>\\r\\n<p>Shakespeare&rsquo;s warring families and passionate young lovers come to life in excerpts from&nbsp;<strong>Prokofiev</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Romeo and Juliet</em>, and the concert opens with Norwegian composer&nbsp;<strong>&Oslash;yvind Torvund</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>symphonic poem &lsquo;Forest Morning&rsquo;</em>&nbsp;for orchestra and electronics, in which idyllic birdsong is gradually taken over by the sounds of traffic and urban bustle.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>&Oslash;yvind Torvund</strong>&nbsp;Symphonic Poem No. 1, &lsquo;Forest Morning&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>12&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><strong>Stravinsky</strong>&nbsp;Violin Concerto&nbsp;<em>22&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Prokofiev</strong>&nbsp;Romeo and Juliet &ndash; excerpts&nbsp;<em>42&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Patricia Kopatchinskaja&nbsp;</strong><em>violin</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Oslo Philharmonic</strong><br /><strong>Mirga Gražinyte-Tyla</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2105,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101174,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-16T11:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-16T11:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Swedish Chamber Orchestra - Beethoven and Baroque\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Together with the Swedish Chamber Orchestra, Maverick clarinet virtuoso Martin Fröst explores the evolution of dance in a wide-ranging programme that climaxes – via Rameau, Hans Ek, Handel and Bach – in Beethoven’s Symphony No. 7.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-39-Evelyn-Glennie-and-the-Fantasia-Orchestra-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7192&token=4537faaf&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-39-Evelyn-Glennie-and-the-Fantasia-Orchestra-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7192&token=4537faaf&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-39-Evelyn-Glennie-and-the-Fantasia-Orchestra-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7192&token=4537faaf&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-39-Evelyn-Glennie-and-the-Fantasia-Orchestra-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7192&token=4537faaf&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-39-Evelyn-Glennie-and-the-Fantasia-Orchestra-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7192&token=4537faaf&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Martin Fröst\",\"caption\":\"Martin Fröst © Mats Bäcker  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/swedish-chamber-orchestra-beethoven-and-baroque\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 16 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#ef911f\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-39-Evelyn-Glennie-and-the-Fantasia-Orchestra-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7192&token=4537faaf&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-39-Evelyn-Glennie-and-the-Fantasia-Orchestra-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7192&token=4537faaf&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-39-Evelyn-Glennie-and-the-Fantasia-Orchestra-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7192&token=4537faaf&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-39-Evelyn-Glennie-and-the-Fantasia-Orchestra-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7192&token=4537faaf&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Martin Fröst\",\"caption\":\"Martin Fröst © Mats Bäcker  \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2105-101174\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101174,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-16T11:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Morning\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-16T10:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":5.95,\"MaximumPrice\":56,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-39-Evelyn-Glennie-and-the-Fantasia-Orchestra-2820-x-1480-AUG-16.jpg?type=image&id=7192&token=4537faaf\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Maverick clarinet virtuoso&nbsp;<strong>Martin Fr&ouml;st</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; praised for his &lsquo;unsurpassed musicianship&rsquo; by The New York Times &ndash; explores the evolution of dance in a wide-ranging programme that contrasts the courtly with the rustic and climaxes in&nbsp;<strong>Beethoven</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Symphony No. 7</em>: dance unleashed as never before.</p>\\r\\n<p>The courtly dances of Rameau and Handel give way to Bach&rsquo;s contrapuntal invention and folk music&rsquo;s instinctive pulse, transformed into something provocative and dynamic in works by contemporary Swedish composers&nbsp;<strong>Hans Ek&nbsp;</strong>and&nbsp;<strong>Jacob M&uuml;hlrad</strong>.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Jacob M&uuml;hlrad</strong>&nbsp;Helix&nbsp;<em>c5&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><em>BBC commission: world premiere</em><br /><strong>Hans Ek</strong>&nbsp;DNA Suite (orchestrations of pieces by Rameau, J. S. Bach and Handel, plus transitions)&nbsp;<em>20&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><em>UK premiere</em><br /><strong>G&ouml;ran and Martin Fr&ouml;st</strong>&nbsp;Nomadic Dances 5&rsquo;&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Beethoven&nbsp;</strong>Symphony No. 7 in A major&nbsp;<em>38&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Swedish Chamber Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Martin Fr&ouml;st&nbsp;</strong><em>conductor/clarinet</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2121,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101115,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-27T18:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-27T18:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: The Met Orchestra Plays Mahler\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"For their second concert of the season The Met Orchestra is joined by Joyce DiDonato for Mahler’s Rückert- Lieder. We also heard the composer’s nature-loving Symphony No. 4 and Kaija Saariaho’s Lumière et pesanteur.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-52-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Mahler-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7205&token=a6f6ad42&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-52-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Mahler-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7205&token=a6f6ad42&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-52-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Mahler-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7205&token=a6f6ad42&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-52-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Mahler-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7205&token=a6f6ad42&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-52-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Mahler-2820-x-1480-AUG-27.jpg?type=image&id=7205&token=a6f6ad42&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Joyce DiDonato\",\"caption\":\"Joyce DiDonato © Chris Gonz  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.