410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-51-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Strauss-2820-x-1480-AUG-26.jpg?type=image&id=7204&token=e2402884&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-51-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Strauss-2820-x-1480-AUG-26.jpg?type=image&id=7204&token=e2402884&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-51-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Strauss-2820-x-1480-AUG-26.jpg?type=image&id=7204&token=e2402884&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Elza van den Heever\",\"caption\":\"Elza van den Heever © Chris Gonz  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/the-met-orchestra-plays-strauss\",\"DateDescription\":\"Wednesday 26 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0093dd\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-51-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Strauss-2820-x-1480-AUG-26.jpg?type=image&id=7204&token=e2402884&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-51-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Strauss-2820-x-1480-AUG-26.jpg?type=image&id=7204&token=e2402884&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-51-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Strauss-2820-x-1480-AUG-26.jpg?type=image&id=7204&token=e2402884&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-51-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Strauss-2820-x-1480-AUG-26.jpg?type=image&id=7204&token=e2402884&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Elza van den Heever\",\"caption\":\"Elza van den Heever © Chris Gonz  \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2120-101110\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101110,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-26T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-26T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":14.03,\"MaximumPrice\":110,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-51-The-Met-Orchestra-plays-Strauss-2820-x-1480-AUG-26.jpg?type=image&id=7204&token=e2402884\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>A long-awaited Proms debut for the&nbsp;<strong>Metropolitan Opera&rsquo;s Met Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; praised for its &lsquo;white-hot musical drama&rsquo; &ndash; under Music Director&nbsp;<strong>Yannick N&eacute;zet-S&eacute;guin</strong>. A sumptuous all-Strauss programme includes a suite from&nbsp;<em>Der Rosenkavalier</em>&nbsp;&ndash; a ravishing homage to Vienna&rsquo;s golden age &ndash; as well as the autobiographical drama of&nbsp;<em>Ein Heldenleben</em>&nbsp;&ndash; a striving, battling &lsquo;Hero&rsquo;s Life&rsquo; brought to vivid orchestral life.</p>\\r\\n<p>Celebrated South African soprano&nbsp;<strong>Elza van den Heever</strong>&nbsp;joins the orchestra for the final scene of the composer&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Salome</em>&nbsp;&ndash; a searing centrepiece for one of the world&rsquo;s great opera orchestras.</p>\\r\\n<p><em>Broadcast on BBC TV and BBC iPlayer.</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>R. Strauss, arr. Attrib. A. Rodzinski</strong>&nbsp;Der Rosenkavalier &ndash; suite<em>&nbsp;26&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><strong>R. Strauss&nbsp;</strong>Salome &ndash; final scene&nbsp;<em>18&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>R. Strauss&nbsp;</strong>Ein Heldenleben&nbsp;<em>46&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Elza van den Heever&nbsp;</strong><em>soprano</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>The Met Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Yannick N&eacute;zet-S&eacute;guin</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2096,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101143,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: The OAE Plays Mozart and Haydn\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Peter Whelan leads the Orchestra of the Age of Enlightenment and massed forces in a musical postcard from 18th-century Vienna, featuring Haydn’s choral tour de force the ‘Nelson Mass’ as well as works by Mozart and Zelenka.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-31-The-OAE-Plays-Mozart-and-Haydn-2820-x-1480-AUG-9.jpg?type=image&id=7184&token=df477bea&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-31-The-OAE-Plays-Mozart-and-Haydn-2820-x-1480-AUG-9.jpg?type=image&id=7184&token=df477bea&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-31-The-OAE-Plays-Mozart-and-Haydn-2820-x-1480-AUG-9.jpg?type=image&id=7184&token=df477bea&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-31-The-OAE-Plays-Mozart-and-Haydn-2820-x-1480-AUG-9.jpg?type=image&id=7184&token=df477bea&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-31-The-OAE-Plays-Mozart-and-Haydn-2820-x-1480-AUG-9.jpg?type=image&id=7184&token=df477bea&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Erin Morley\",\"caption\":\"Erin Morley © Dario Acosta  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Opera\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/the-oae-plays-mozart-and-haydn\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 9 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#ef911f\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-31-The-OAE-Plays-Mozart-and-Haydn-2820-x-1480-AUG-9.jpg?type=image&id=7184&token=df477bea&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-31-The-OAE-Plays-Mozart-and-Haydn-2820-x-1480-AUG-9.jpg?type=image&id=7184&token=df477bea&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-31-The-OAE-Plays-Mozart-and-Haydn-2820-x-1480-AUG-9.jpg?type=image&id=7184&token=df477bea&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-31-The-OAE-Plays-Mozart-and-Haydn-2820-x-1480-AUG-9.jpg?type=image&id=7184&token=df477bea&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Erin Morley\",\"caption\":\"Erin Morley © Dario Acosta  \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2096-101143\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101143,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-09T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-09T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7.23,\"MaximumPrice\":68,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-31-The-OAE-Plays-Mozart-and-Haydn-2820-x-1480-AUG-9.jpg?type=image&id=7184&token=df477bea\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>A musical postcard from 18th-century Vienna. The threat to Austria from Napoleon&rsquo;s army is vividly rendered in the turbulent opening of&nbsp;<strong>Haydn</strong>&rsquo;s choral tour de force the &lsquo;Nelson Mass&rsquo;, but it&rsquo;s Nelson&rsquo;s victory we hear in the celebratory ending.</p>\\r\\n<p>There&rsquo;s brooding spiritual darkness from&nbsp;<strong>Zelenka</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Miserere</em>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Mozart</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Masonic Funeral Music</em>&nbsp;&ndash; written in response to the deaths of two of the composer&rsquo;s fellow Freemasons. Soprano&nbsp;<strong>Erin Morley</strong>&nbsp;is the soloist in two of Mozart&rsquo;s showstopping &lsquo;insertion&rsquo; arias.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Zelenka</strong>&nbsp;Miserere in C minor&nbsp;<em>14&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><strong>Mozart</strong>&nbsp;Masonic Funeral Music&nbsp;<em>5&rsquo;</em>&nbsp;<br />Aria &lsquo;Schon lacht der holde Fr&uuml;hling&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>8&rsquo;</em><br />Aria &lsquo;Vorrei spiegarvi, oh Dio!&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>6&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Haydn</strong>&nbsp;Mass in D minor, &lsquo;Nelson Mass&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>42&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Erin Morley&nbsp;</strong><em>soprano</em><br /><strong>Helen Charlston&nbsp;</strong><em>mezzo-soprano</em><br /><strong>Guy Cutting&nbsp;</strong><em>tenor</em><br /><strong>William Thomas&nbsp;</strong><em>bass</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Choir of the Enlightenment</strong><br /><strong>Orchestra of the Age of Enlightenment&nbsp;</strong><br /><strong>Peter Whelan</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2075,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101160,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-07-25T18:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-07-25T18:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: Horrible Science - The Big Bang Proms Experiment\",\"Suffix\":\"Evening performance\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Join Albert Einstein and Marie Curie as they present CBBC’s hit sketch show Horrible Science live at the Royal Albert Hall with some scientifically proven bangers from the classical canon, including Holst’s The Planets and John Williams’s Star Wars.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Horrible-Sciences-2820x1487-v3.png?type=image&id=7678&token=cb00ab16&mode=f