ymphony-No-9-2820-x-1480-SEP-4.jpg?type=image&id=7216&token=08ba496c&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-63-Vaughan-Williamss-Fantasia-and-Symphony-No-9-2820-x-1480-SEP-4.jpg?type=image&id=7216&token=08ba496c&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-63-Vaughan-Williamss-Fantasia-and-Symphony-No-9-2820-x-1480-SEP-4.jpg?type=image&id=7216&token=08ba496c&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-63-Vaughan-Williamss-Fantasia-and-Symphony-No-9-2820-x-1480-SEP-4.jpg?type=image&id=7216&token=08ba496c&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Simone Lamsma\",\"caption\":\"Simone Lamsma © Otto van den Toorn \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/vaughan-williamss-fantasia-and-symphony-no-9\",\"DateDescription\":\"Friday 4 September 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#ef911f\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-63-Vaughan-Williamss-Fantasia-and-Symphony-No-9-2820-x-1480-SEP-4.jpg?type=image&id=7216&token=08ba496c&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-63-Vaughan-Williamss-Fantasia-and-Symphony-No-9-2820-x-1480-SEP-4.jpg?type=image&id=7216&token=08ba496c&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-63-Vaughan-Williamss-Fantasia-and-Symphony-No-9-2820-x-1480-SEP-4.jpg?type=image&id=7216&token=08ba496c&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-63-Vaughan-Williamss-Fantasia-and-Symphony-No-9-2820-x-1480-SEP-4.jpg?type=image&id=7216&token=08ba496c&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Simone Lamsma\",\"caption\":\"Simone Lamsma © Otto van den Toorn \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2135-101179\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101179,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-09-04T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-04T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7,\"MaximumPrice\":56,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-63-Vaughan-Williamss-Fantasia-and-Symphony-No-9-2820-x-1480-SEP-4.jpg?type=image&id=7216&token=08ba496c\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Andrew Manze&nbsp;</strong>conducts the<strong>&nbsp;Royal Liverpool Philharmonic Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;in a celebration of English music, including a commission from&nbsp;<strong>Carmel Smickersgill</strong>&nbsp;exploring resilience in the face of tragedy.</p>\\r\\n<p>The starkly beautiful landscape of Thomas Hardy&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Wessex</em>&nbsp;haunts the score of&nbsp;<strong>Vaughan Williams</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Symphony No. 9</em>&nbsp;&ndash; pastoral yearning tinged with darker wartime memories and fears, a contrast to the radiant spiritual affirmation of the composer&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Fantasia on a Theme</em>&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Thomas Tallis</strong>, with its shimmering clouds of strings.</p>\\r\\n<p>&lsquo;Eloquent&rsquo; Dutch violinist&nbsp;<strong>Simone Lamsma</strong>&nbsp;makes her Proms debut in&nbsp;<strong>Benjamin Britten</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Violin Concerto</em>, another work steeped in thoughts of war and hopes of peace.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Vaughan Williams</strong>&nbsp;Fantasia on a Theme by Thomas Tallis&nbsp;<em>15&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>Britten</strong>&nbsp;Violin Concerto&nbsp;<em>32&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Carmel Smickersgill</strong>&nbsp;A Brick Thrown with Love&nbsp;<em>c10&rsquo;</em><br /><em>BBC co-commission: world premiere</em><br /><strong>Vaughan Williams</strong>&nbsp;Symphony No. 9 in E minor&nbsp;<em>33&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Simone Lamsma&nbsp;</strong><em>violin</em><br /><strong>Royal Liverpool Philharmonic Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Andrew Manze</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2109,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101109,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-19T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-19T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: ‘Ariadne auf Naxos’ from Glyndebourne\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Fresh from the Glyndebourne Festival, the Proms presents Strauss’s opera-within-an-opera Ariadne auf Naxos, performed complete at the festival for the first time in nearly half a century.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-43-Ariadne-auf-Naxos-from-Glyndebourne-2820-x-1480-AUG-19.jpg?type=image&id=7196&token=2e6651e1&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-43-Ariadne-auf-Naxos-from-Glyndebourne-2820-x-1480-AUG-19.jpg?type=image&id=7196&token=2e6651e1&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-43-Ariadne-auf-Naxos-from-Glyndebourne-2820-x-1480-AUG-19.jpg?type=image&id=7196&token=2e6651e1&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-43-Ariadne-auf-Naxos-from-Glyndebourne-2820-x-1480-AUG-19.jpg?type=image&id=7196&token=2e6651e1&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-43-Ariadne-auf-Naxos-from-Glyndebourne-2820-x-1480-AUG-19.jpg?type=image&id=7196&token=2e6651e1&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Rachel Willi