bert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-54-Altin-Gunn-2820-x-1480-AUG-28.jpg?type=image&id=7207&token=be4c4ff9&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-54-Altin-Gunn-2820-x-1480-AUG-28.jpg?type=image&id=7207&token=be4c4ff9&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-54-Altin-Gunn-2820-x-1480-AUG-28.jpg?type=image&id=7207&token=be4c4ff9&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-54-Altin-Gunn-2820-x-1480-AUG-28.jpg?type=image&id=7207&token=be4c4ff9&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Altın Gün\",\"caption\":\"Altın Gün © Sanja Marusic\"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2126-101178\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101178,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-28T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-28T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":5.95,\"MaximumPrice\":56,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-54-Altin-Gunn-2820-x-1480-AUG-28.jpg?type=image&id=7207&token=be4c4ff9\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Grammy-nominated Dutch-Turkish band&nbsp;<strong>Altin G&uuml;n</strong>&nbsp;brings its unique blend of psychedelic folk-rock to the BBC Proms for the first time, drawing on its recent Anatolian rock album&nbsp;<em>Garip</em>&nbsp;(&lsquo;Strange&rsquo;), a tribute to the great Turkish folk musician&nbsp;<strong>Neset Ertas</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>The band joins forces with&nbsp;<strong>Jules Buckley</strong>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<strong>BBC Symphony Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;to turn cool riffs and Anatolian folk textures into rich orchestral colours.</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Derya Yildirim</strong><br /><strong>Altin G&uuml;n</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>BBC Symphony Chorus&nbsp;</strong><br /><strong>BBC Symphony Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Jules Buckley</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n<p><em>There will be no interval.</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":228,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 18 & Under\",\"Content\":\"The government have introduced a temporary reduced rate of VAT for children's tickets of 5% between 25 June and 1 September, and the prices of BBC Proms 18-and-under tickets for this period have been reduced in order to pass this reduced rate onto customers.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2116,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"PerformanceNumber\":101150,\"WishlistNumber\":447,\"StartDate\":\"2026-08-24T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-08-24T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"BBC Proms presents\",\"Title\":\"BBC Proms: American Classics\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Marin Alsop leads the Philharmonia Orchestra in a barn-storming celebration of American music, with works including Bernstein’s West Side Story, Gershwin’s jazz-infused Rhapsody in Blue and Copland’s Appalachian Spring.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-49-American-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-24.jpg?type=image&id=7202&token=6c705b9a&mode=fill&top=0&left=9&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-49-American-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-24.jpg?type=image&id=7202&token=6c705b9a&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-49-American-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-24.jpg?type=image&id=7202&token=6c705b9a&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-49-American-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-24.jpg?type=image&id=7202&token=6c705b9a&mode=fill&top=0&left=18&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-49-American-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-24.jpg?type=image&id=7202&token=6c705b9a&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Marin Alsop\",\"caption\":\"Marin Alsop © Nancy Horowitz  \"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Proms Planner\",\"BookingURL\":null,\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"BBC Proms\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/proms/bbc-proms-2026/american-classics\",\"DateDescription\":\"Monday 24 August 2026\",\"Type\":\"PromPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":true,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0093dd\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-49-American-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-24.jpg?type=image&id=7202&token=6c705b9a&mode=fill&top=0&left=12&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-49-American-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-24.jpg?type=image&id=7202&token=6c705b9a&mode=fill&top=0&left=24&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-49-American-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-24.jpg?type=image&id=7202&token=6c705b9a&mode=fill&top=57&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-49-American-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-24.jpg?type=image&id=7202&token=6c705b9a&mode=fill&top=114&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Marin Alsop\",\"caption\":\"Marin Alsop © Nancy Horowitz  \"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2116-101150\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101150,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99706,\"Date\":\"2026-08-24T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-16T09:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-08-24T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7.23,\"MaximumPrice\":68,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"12\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":50,\"ContentType\":\"Show Promo Code Box\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":54,\"ContentType\":\"Proms Thumbnail url\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/BBC-Proms-2026/Prom-49-American-Classics-2820-x-1480-AUG-24.jpg?type=image&id=7202&token=6c705b9a\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>An all-American celebration, from the urban rhythms of&nbsp;<strong>Bernstein</strong>&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>West Side Story&nbsp;</em>and&nbsp;<em>On the Town</em>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>Copland</strong>&rsquo;s barn dances and&nbsp;<strong>Gerwshin</strong>&rsquo;s jazz-infused&nbsp;<em>Rhapsody in Blue</em>. To these are added all-American landscapes in&nbsp;<em>The Big Country</em>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>Appalachian Spring</em>, as well as a fanfare dedicated to tonight&rsquo;s conductor,&nbsp;<strong>Marin Alsop</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p><em>Broadcast on BBC TV and BBC iPlayer.</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Joan Tower</strong>&nbsp;Fanfare for the Uncommon Woman&nbsp;<em>3&rsquo;&nbsp;</em><br /><strong>Bernstein</strong>&nbsp;Symphonic Dances from &lsquo;West Side Story&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>24&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>Gershwin, orch. Grof&eacute;</strong>&nbsp;Rhapsody in Blue&nbsp;<em>16&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Interval<hr /></div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Moross&nbsp;</strong>The Big Country &ndash; prelude&nbsp;<em>3&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>Copland&nbsp;</strong>Appalachian Spring &ndash; suite&nbsp;<em>23&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>Still&nbsp;</strong>Three Visions &ndash; No. 2: Summerland&nbsp;<em>5&rsquo;</em><br /><strong>Bernstein&nbsp;</strong>On the Town &ndash; Three Dance Episodes&nbsp;<em>11&rsquo;</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Marcus Roberts Trio</strong><br /><strong>Philharmonia Orchestra</strong><br /><strong>Marin Alsop</strong>&nbsp;<em>conductor</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"I