al-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Matilda-in-Concert/Matilda-2.jpg?type=image&id=5606&token=c069107d&mode=fill&top=137&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":null,\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2196-102638\",\"PerformanceNumber\":102638,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102637,\"Date\":\"2026-10-30T14:00:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-07-31T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-10-30T13:25:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":4.54,\"MaximumPrice\":4.54,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":50,\"ContentType\":\"Show Promo Code Box\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":63,\"ContentType\":\"T&C Checkbox\",\"Content\":\"This film is rated PG\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":366,\"ContentType\":\"STC: Standing Room\",\"Content\":\"You are buying a standing space in the Gallery. We expect standing to be popular for this event so there may be more than one row. Standing spaces are on a first come first served basis.\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2222,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102787,\"PerformanceNumber\":102788,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-11T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-11T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Kilimanjaro Live presents\",\"Title\":\"Gil Scott-Heron by Brian Jackson & Yasiin Bey\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Brian Jackson is stepping on stage to transport us back to the rich indulgent sound of Gil Scott-Heron ‘live’ for one night only, at the Hall.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Gil-Scott-Heron-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7747&token=c1acb3e7&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Gil-Scott-Heron-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7747&token=c1acb3e7&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Gil-Scott-Heron-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7747&token=c1acb3e7&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Gil-Scott-Heron-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7747&token=c1acb3e7&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Gil-Scott-Heron-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7747&token=c1acb3e7&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Gil Scott-Heron\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/102788\",\"Categories\":[\"Rock and Pop\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/gil-scott-heron-by-brian-jackson-and-yasiin-bey\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 11 October 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#fc9400\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Gil-Scott-Heron-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7747&token=c1acb3e7&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Gil-Scott-Heron-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7747&token=c1acb3e7&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Gil-Scott-Heron-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7747&token=c1acb3e7&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Gil-Scott-Heron-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7747&token=c1acb3e7&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Gil Scott-Heron\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2222-102788\",\"PerformanceNumber\":102788,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102787,\"Date\":\"2026-10-11T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-06-19T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-10-11T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":55,\"MaximumPrice\":150,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"8\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Over 55 years since they released their first album together, <strong>Brian Jackson</strong> is stepping on stage to transport us back to the rich indulgent sound of <strong>Gil Scott-Heron</strong> &lsquo;live&rsquo; for one night only, at the Hall; accompanied by iconic US rapper, <strong>Yasiin Bey</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>One half of the Scott-Heron/Jackson legendary duo, Brian has chosen his own birthday as the special night to bring this incredible show to London, igniting the Hall with a roof-busting explosion of jazz, blues, soul, spoken word and poetry, in memory of his illustrious partner, Gil Scott Heron.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2163,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99180,\"PerformanceNumber\":101806,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-11-23T19:00:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-11-23T19:00:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Philharmonic Orchestra presents\",\"Title\":\"Hisaishi conducts Hisaishi\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"This November, the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra welcomes the renowned composer, Joe Hisaishi – whose scores for the films of Studio Ghibli have enchanted a captive audience of millions across the world.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Joe-Hisaishi-23-Nov-26-RAH-web-2820x1487-c-Tim-Lutton-RPO.jpg?type=image&id=7353&token=4f7017d9&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Joe-Hisaishi-23-Nov-26-RAH-web-2820x1487-c-Tim-Lutton-RPO.jpg?type=image&id=7353&token=4f7017d9&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Joe-Hisaishi-23-Nov-26-RAH-web-2820x1487-c-Tim-Lutton-RPO.jpg?type=image&id=7353&token=4f7017d9&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Joe-Hisaishi-23-Nov-26-RAH-web-2820x1487-c-Tim-Lutton-RPO.jpg?type=image&id=7353&token=4f7017d9&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Joe-Hisaishi-23-Nov-26-RAH-web-2820x1487-c-Tim-Lutton-RPO.jpg?type=image&id=7353&token=4f7017d9&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Joe Hisaishi conducting\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/101806\",\"Categories\":[\"Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/hisaishi-conducts-hisaishi\",\"DateDescription\":\"Monday 23 November 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#8c52de\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Joe-Hisaishi-23-Nov-26-RAH-web-2820x1487-c-Tim-Lutton-RPO.jpg?type=image&id=7353&token=4f7017d9&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Joe-Hisaishi-23-Nov-26-RAH-web-2820x1487-c-Tim-Lutton-RPO.jpg?type=image&id=7353&token=4f7017d9&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Joe-Hisaishi-23-Nov-26-RAH-web-2820x1487-c-Tim-Lutton-RPO.jpg?type=image&id=7353&token=4f7017d9&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Joe-Hisaishi-23-Nov-26-RAH-web-2820x1487-c-Tim-Lutton-RPO.jpg?type=image&id=7353&token=4f7017d9&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Joe Hisaishi conducting\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2163-101806\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101806,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99180,\"Date\":\"2026-11-23T19:00:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-04-28T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-11-23T18:25:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7,\"MaximumPrice\":341.18,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<h1>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra presents</h1>\\r\\n<h1>Hisaishi conducts Hisaishi</h1>\\r\\n<p>From delicate piano chords that ripple like grass in the wind, to melodies in the strings that soar into a blue infinite sky, little music can make your imagination instantly take flight like the music of&nbsp;<strong>Joe Hisaishi</strong>. This November, the&nbsp;<strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;welcomes the renowned composer &ndash; whose scores for the films of&nbsp;<strong>Studio Ghibli</strong>&nbsp;have enchanted a captive audience of millions across the world &ndash; to the stage of Royal Albert Hall as he conducts a selection of his own works.</p>\\r\\n<p>Beyond the screen, Joe Hisaishi&rsquo;s music for the concert hall has been performed extensively: from the BBC Proms to Seoul's Lotte Concert Hall and Vienna&rsquo;s Musikverein. His contemporary music unites his gift for orchestration with inspiration that draws from minimalism to Romanticism to the Baroque. Expect something extraordinary and startlingly inventive as we perform the UK premiere of his kaleidoscopic&nbsp;<em>Concerto for Orchestra</em>.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>To let the unrestrained magic of Joe Hisaishi&rsquo;s music work on you, there&rsquo;s nothing like being there to hear it in person.</p>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Hisaishi</strong>&nbsp;Concerto for Orchestra UK premiere</p>\\r\\n<p><em>Full programme to be confirmed</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Joe Hisaishi&nbsp;</strong><em>conductor</em><br /><strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING </strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":81,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Arena Fine Dining\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Front Arena Seat <br />*Three course dinner in Coda by Chavot Restaurant<br />*Welcome glass Champagne and half bottle of wine per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":408,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge Stalls\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include</p>\\r\\n<p>*Premium Stalls Seating <br />*Pre and interval VIP Lounge<br />*Canapes, bowl dishes, desserts, wine, beer and soft drinks</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2192,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102288,\"PerformanceNumber\":102337,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-07-14T20:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-07-14T20:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Kankyō London: Yumiko Morioka, Nick Luscombe and James Greer\",\"Suffix\":\"Ambient Music and Environmental Sound \",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Yumiko Morioka brings her signature sound of the kankyō ongaku style of environmental ambient music to the Elgar Room.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/Yumiko-Morioka-1.png?type=image&id=7523&token=e726492d&mode=fill&top=6&left=0&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/Yumiko-Morioka-1.png?type=image&id=7523&token=e726492d&mode=fill&top=7&left=0&width=410&height=2