melody-gardot\",\"DateDescription\":\"Monday 16 November 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f2e861\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Melody-Gardot-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7391&token=818c5de2&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Melody-Gardot-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7391&token=818c5de2&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Melody-Gardot-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7391&token=818c5de2&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Melody-Gardot-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7391&token=818c5de2&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Melody Gardot\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2166-101729\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101729,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101728,\"Date\":\"2026-11-16T19:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-01T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-11-16T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":35,\"MaximumPrice\":75,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Serious presents: <strong>Melody Gardot</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>For one extraordinary night only, <strong>Melody Gardo</strong>t brings her unmistakable artistry to the Hall as part of the EFG London Jazz Festival. This very special performance promises an unforgettable evening, featuring special guests and a host of exciting surprises that will make the night truly spectacular.</p>\\r\\n<p>Melody Gardot stands as one of the most compelling and distinctive voices in contemporary music - an artist whose work has not only captivated jazz audiences but resonated deeply with listeners worldwide.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2045,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100899,\"PerformanceNumber\":100900,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-11-08T19:00:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-11-08T19:00:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"The Really Big Chorus presents\",\"Title\":\"Messiah from Scratch\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Messiah from Scratch an adrenaline-filled performance of Handel’s masterpiece, filling the Hall with the sound of more than 3,000 voices.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Messiah-from-Scratch-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7082&token=78cc2ac5&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Messiah-from-Scratch-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7082&token=78cc2ac5&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Messiah-from-Scratch-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7082&token=78cc2ac5&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Messiah-from-Scratch-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7082&token=78cc2ac5&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Messiah-from-Scratch-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7082&token=78cc2ac5&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Performance of Messiah from Scratch taking place in the Royal Albert Hall auditorium\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/100900\",\"Categories\":[\"Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/messiah-from-scratch\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 8 November 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[{\"Type\":\"Music Group\",\"Title\":\"The Really Big Chorus\",\"Role\":null,\"Website\":null},{\"Type\":\"Music Group\",\"Title\":\"The English Festival Orchestra\",\"Role\":null,\"Website\":null},{\"Type\":\"Person\",\"Title\":\"Brian Kay\",\"Role\":\"conductor\",\"Website\":null}],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f2e861\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Messiah-from-Scratch-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7082&token=78cc2ac5&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Messiah-from-Scratch-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7082&token=78cc2ac5&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Messiah-from-Scratch-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7082&token=78cc2ac5&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Messiah-from-Scratch-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7082&token=78cc2ac5&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Performance of Messiah from Scratch taking place in the Royal Albert Hall auditorium\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2045-100900\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100900,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100899,\"Date\":\"2026-11-08T19:00:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-04-09T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-11-08T18:25:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":25,\"MaximumPrice\":74,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":43,\"ContentType\":\"Performance T&C's\",\"Content\":\"You can move around the seating map and select more tickets than initially chosen in other voice or audience seating areas.\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":50,\"ContentType\":\"Show Promo Code Box\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>The Really Big Chorus presents: Messiah from Scratch</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>The Really Big Chorus</strong>&nbsp;presents the world&rsquo;s most celebrated choral participation event &ndash;&nbsp;<strong>Messiah from Scratch</strong>. Audience tickets are available via this page. Singing tickets are also on sale but can only be purchased via a link on the promoter&rsquo;s website:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://www.trbc.co.uk/booking-for-messiah-from-scratch/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">www.trbc.co.uk</a>.</p>\\r\\n<p>Messiah from Scratch is the most adrenaline-filled performance of&nbsp;<strong>Handel</strong>&rsquo;s masterpiece you are ever likely to hear, and one not to be missed, with singers and audience alike leaving the concert buzzing with excitement.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>This unique event returns year after year, filling the Hall with the sound of more than 3,000 voices. Performers often outnumber the audience by three to one; audience tickets are therefore limited, so book now for this unforgettable experience.</p>\\r\\n<p>This is the ideal event to kick-start your Christmas celebrations: tickets would make a wonderful Christmas present and enable you and your guests to support a fantastically worthwhile charity at the same time. This year, all money raised from programme sales, advertising and sponsorship will benefit The Royal Society of Musicians of Great Britain.</p>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":146,\"ContentType\":\"Pre-sale T&C Checkbox\",\"Content\":\"Tickets purchased through Priority Booking are strictly for your own personal use and may not be transferred or sold.\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":418,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Bass\",\"Content\":\"This is a Bass singing ticket\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":420,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Audience\",\"Content\":\"This is an audience ticket\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":421,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Soprano\",\"Content\":\"This is a Soprano singing ticket\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":422,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Tenor\",\"Content\":\"This is a Tenor singing ticket\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":423,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Contralto\",\"Content\":\"This is a Contralto singing ticket\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":482,\"ContentType\":\"Override Discount \",\"Content\":\"Singer Type\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":483,\"ContentType\":\"Override Disc. description\",\"Content\":\"Please choose Singer type above \",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1988,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100324,\"PerformanceNumber\":100327,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-11-29T14:00:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-11-29T14:00:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Fane presents\",\"Title\":\"Miriam's Full English LIVE\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Join Miriam Margolyes this November for stories from her new book, naughty confessions and a no-holds-barred Q&A where no question is off-limits.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Mirima-Margoyles-x-Graham-Norton-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7733&token=a2b88eeb&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Mirima-Margoyles-x-Graham-Norton-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7733&token=a2b88eeb&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Mirima-Margoyles-x-Graham-Norton-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7733&token=a2b88eeb&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Mirima-Margoyles-x-Graham-Norton-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7733&token=a2b88eeb&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Mirima-Margoyles-x-Graham-Norton-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7733&token=a2b88eeb&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Miriam Margoyles and Graham Norton\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/100327\",\"Categories\":[\"Talk\",\"Comedy\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/miriams-full-english-live\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 29 November 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f2e861\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Mirima-Margoyles-x-Graham-Norton-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7733&token=a2b88eeb&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Mirima-Margoyles-x-Graham-Norton-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7733&token=a2b88eeb&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Mirima-Margoyles-x-Graham-Norton-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7733&token=a2b88eeb&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Mirima-Margoyles-x-Graham-Norton-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7733&token=a2b88eeb&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Miriam Margoyles and Graham Norton\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"1988-100327\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100327,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100324,\"Date\":\"2026-11-29T14:00:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-02-13T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-11-29T13:25:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":0,\"MaximumPrice\":120,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":58,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Standard\",\"Content\":\"This seat does not include a book.\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<div>Fane presents\\r\\n<h1>Miriam's Full English LIVE</h1>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<p>Join Britain's most outspoken national treasure,&nbsp;<strong>Miriam Margolyes OBE</strong>, in conversation this November for stories from her new book, naughty confessions and a no-holds-barred Q&amp;A where no question is off-limits.</p>\\r\\n<p>Following three bestselling memoirs and sold-out tours that left audiences in stitches, Miriam Margolyes is back on the road and she's not holding back.</p>\\r\\n<p>In her new book, Miriam's Full English, she turns her documentary-maker's eye on her own backyard.</p>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>It starts with the title. The joy of a full English is the wildly different things piled together on one plate to make something delicious. That's Britain's secret too, not shutting things out, but welcoming more in. Who better than Miriam Margolyes to celebrate our not-terribly United Kingdom in one unforgettable show? There will be heroes and villains, belly laughs and sharp insights, outrageous surprises and of course, lashings of... sauce.</p>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":126,\"ContentType\":\"PT: BSL User\",\"Content\":\"<p>The BSL (British Sign Language) interpreter will be positioned to one side of the stage. Please select the assigned seats in the stalls which are positioned for the best view.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":196,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: Standard \",\"Content\":\"This seat does not include a book.\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":227,\"ContentType\":\"PT: 2nd Tier\",\"Content\":\"This ticket includes a copy of the book ‘ Miriam's Full English’ by Miriam Margolyes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":258,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: BSL User\",\"Content\":\"This seat is only for customers who require a view of the BSL (British Sign Language) interpreter\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":265,\"ContentType\":\"PT: BSL - Companion \",\"Content\":\"<p>Please select the number of tickets for companions of those using the BSL (British Sign Language) description service.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":451,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: Loggia\",\"Content\":\"This ticket includes a copy of the book ‘ Miriam's Full English’ by Miriam Margolyes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":452,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: Stalls\",\"Content\":\"This seat does not include a book.\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":453,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: Arena \",\"Content\":\"This ticket includes a copy of the book ‘ Miriam's Full English’ by Miriam Margolyes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":461,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: 2nd Tier \",\"Content\":\"This ticket includes a copy of the book ‘ Miriam's Full English’ by Miriam Margolyes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":462,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: Grand Tier\",\"Content\":\"This ticket includes a copy of the book ‘ Miriam's Full English’ by Miriam Margolyes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":463,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: Circle \",\"Content\":\"This ticket includes a copy of the book ‘ Miriam's Full English’ by Miriam Margolyes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":464,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Arena\",\"Content\":\"This ticket includes a copy of the book ‘ Miriam's Full English’ by Miriam Margolyes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":465,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Stalls\",\"Content\":\"This seat does not include a book.\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":466,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia\",\"Content\":\"This ticket includes a copy of the book ‘ Miriam's Full English’ by Miriam Margolyes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":467,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Circle\",\"Content\":\"This ticket includes a copy of the book ‘ Miriam's Full English’ by Miriam Margolyes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":468,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Grand Tier \",\"Content\":\"This ticket includes a copy of the book ‘ Miriam's Full English’ by Miriam Margolyes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":469,\"ContentType\":\"TNC: BSL - Companion\",\"Content\":\"This seat is only for customers who are accompanying a BSL (British Sign Language) user\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2175,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102086,\"PerformanceNumber\":102088,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-03T10:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-03T10:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Kapitol Promotions Ltd presents\",\"Title\":\"National Brass Band Championships\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"The Championship Section National Final of the “National Brass Band Championships of Great Britain” returns to the Hall this autumn, where it has been held since 1945.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2024/10-October/National-Brass-Band-Championships-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=5424&token=87da0d0a&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2024/10-October/National-Brass-Band-Championships-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=5424&token=87da0d0a&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2024/10-October/National-Brass-Band-Championships-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=5424&token=87da0d0a&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2024/10-October/National-Brass-Band-Championships-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=5424&token=87da0d0a&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2024/10-October/National-Brass-Band-Championships-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=5424&token=87da0d0a&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"National Brass Band Championship trophy\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/102088\",\"Categories\":[\"Entertainment\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/national-brass-band-championships\",\"DateDescription\":\"Saturday 3 October 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f2e861\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2024/10-October/National-Brass-Band-Championships-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=5424&token=87da0d0a&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2024/10-October/National-Brass-Band-Championships-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=5424&token=87da0d0a&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2024/10-October/National-Brass-Band-Championships-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=5424&token=87da0d0a&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2024/10-October/National-Brass-Band-Championships-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=5424&token=87da0d0a&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"National Brass Band Championship trophy\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2175-102088\",\"PerformanceNumber\":102088,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102086,\"Date\":\"2026-10-03T10:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"All Day\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-08T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-10-03T09:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":37,\"MaximumPrice\":75,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Kapitol Promotions Ltd presents</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Championship Section National Final of the &ldquo;<strong>National Brass Band Championships of Great Britain</strong>&rdquo; returns to the Hall this autumn, where it has been held since 1945. Often dubbed the brass banding equivalent of the Football League, the UK&rsquo;s finest bands will compete for the prestigious National title, and this year&rsquo;s lineup features giants such as&nbsp;<strong>Black Dyke</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Grimethorpe Colliery</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Cory</strong>, as well as&nbsp;<strong>Flowers</strong>&nbsp;who are the current European Champions.</p>\\r\\n<p>Steeped in history, this acclaimed and culturally significant event blends fierce competition with deep camaraderie, with many enduring friendships and relationships have been forged through years of shared passion and performance in this competition.</p>\\r\\n<p>This year's set test-piece&nbsp;<em>A Road Less Travelled By</em>&nbsp;is written by&nbsp;<strong>Philip Sparke</strong>, one of brass banding's foremost composers. Fittingly, in his 75th birthday year, his music will take centre stage at this prestigious competition.</p>\\r\\n<p>Adding to the celebration, the Gala Concert will feature a surprise artist with a 30-minute showcase, (taking place between the competition and the Results Ceremony), and the event&rsquo;s Results Ceremony will include a military fanfare to herald the new National Champion.</p>\\r\\n<p>Set against the backdrop of this world-famous venue, this is a spectacular celebration of brass, from rising stars to established greats, and offers you a unique chance to be a part of it.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2159,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99180,\"PerformanceNumber\":101804,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-23T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-23T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Philharmonic Orchestra presents\",\"Title\":\"Royal Philharmonic Orchestra at 80\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Vasily Petrenko conducts a big anniversary celebration concert as the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra turns 80.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/RPO-at-80-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7346&token=f6ead47b&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/RPO-at-80-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7346&token=f6ead47b&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/RPO-at-80-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7346&token=f6ead47b&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/RPO-at-80-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7346&token=f6ead47b&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/RPO-at-80-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7346&token=f6ead47b&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"A tree with a pink filter\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/101804\",\"Categories\":[\"Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/royal-philharmonic-orchestra-at-80\",\"DateDescription\":\"Wednesday 23 September 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0d2626\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/RPO-at-80-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7346&token=f6ead47b&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/RPO-at-80-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7346&token=f6ead47b&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/RPO-at-80-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7346&token=f6ead47b&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/RPO-at-80-RAH-web-2820x1478.jpg?type=image&id=7346&token=f6ead47b&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"A tree with a pink filter\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2159-101804\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101804,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99180,\"Date\":\"2026-09-23T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-04-28T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-23T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7,\"MaximumPrice\":287.25,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra presents</p>\\r\\n<h1>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra at 80</h1>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>A big anniversary calls for an even bigger celebration and, as the&nbsp;<strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;turns 80, that&rsquo;s exactly what we&rsquo;re hosting tonight &ndash; live from the spectacular surroundings of the Royal Albert Hall, where the RPO is proud to be Associate Orchestra.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>We&rsquo;re looking to the future, with a thrilling new fanfare from the Master of the King&rsquo;s Music,&nbsp;<strong>Errollyn Wallen CBE</strong>. We&rsquo;re inviting friends, as the world-beating team of&nbsp;<strong>Julia Fischer</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Pablo Ferr&aacute;ndez</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Jan Lisiecki</strong>&nbsp;come together for&nbsp;<strong>Beethoven</strong>&rsquo;s joyous&nbsp;<em>Triple Concerto</em>.</p>\\r\\n<p>But, above all, we&rsquo;re making music on the grandest possible scale, as&nbsp;<strong>Vasily Petrenko</strong>&nbsp;conducts&nbsp;<strong>Richard Strauss</strong>&rsquo; big-hearted story of love, art and the sheer glory of a great orchestra raising the roof. Consider this your official party invitation &ndash; join us!</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<h2>Programme</h2>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Wallen&nbsp;</strong>New commission<br /><em>World premiere</em><br /><strong>Beethoven</strong>&nbsp;Triple Concerto&nbsp;<br /><strong>Strauss</strong>&nbsp;Ein Heldenleben</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Vasily Petrenko&nbsp;</strong><em>conductor</em><br /><strong>Julia Fischer&nbsp;</strong><em>violin</em><br /><strong>Pablo Ferr&aacute;ndez&nbsp;</strong><em>cello</em><br /><strong>Jan Lisiecki&nbsp;</strong><em>piano</em><br /><strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;---------------------------------------------------</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING </strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</section>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2164,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99180,\"PerformanceNumber\":101997,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-20T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-20T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Philharmonic Orchestra presents\",\"Title\":\"The Moonwalkers: Live in Concert\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Join the RPO for an evening delving into deep space in high definition.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Moonwalkers.png?type=image&id=7388&token=94734900&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Moonwalkers.png?type=image&id=7388&token=94734900&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Moonwalkers.png?type=image&id=7388&token=94734900&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Moonwalkers.png?type=image&id=7388&token=94734900&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Moonwalkers.png?type=image&id=7388&token=94734900&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Astronaut walking on the Moon\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/booking/production/101997\",\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/the-moonwalkers-in-concert\",\"DateDescription\":\"Tuesday 20 October 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#003dba\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Moonwalkers.png?type=image&id=7388&token=94734900&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Moonwalkers.png?type=image&id=7388&token=94734900&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Moonwalkers.png?type=image&id=7388&token=94734900&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Moonwalkers.png?type=image&id=7388&token=94734900&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Astronaut walking on the Moon\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2164-101997\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101997,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99180,\"Date\":\"2026-10-20T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-04-28T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-10-20T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7,\"MaximumPrice\":287.25,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"YES\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":50,\"ContentType\":\"Show Promo Code Box\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra presents</p>\\r\\n<h1>The Moonwalkers: Live in Concert</h1>\\r\\n<p>Join the RPO for an evening delving into deep space in high definition.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>Grammy&reg; award-winning American composer&nbsp;<strong>Eric Whitacre</strong>&rsquo;s symphonic work&nbsp;<em>Deep Field&nbsp;</em>was inspired by the world&rsquo;s most famous space observatory, the Hubble Space Telescope, and its greatest discovery &ndash; the iconic Deep Field image.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>After the interval, the RPO presents&nbsp;<strong>Anne Nikitin</strong>&rsquo;s score to&nbsp;<strong>Lightroom</strong>&rsquo;s critically acclaimed&nbsp;<em>The Moonwalkers</em>. Narrated and co-written by&nbsp;<strong>Tom Hanks</strong>,&nbsp;<em>The Moonwalkers</em>&nbsp;provides an insight into the impending return of crewed surface missions to the moon by going behind-the-scenes of the Artemis programme, including interviews between Hanks and Artemis astronauts. Shown on a big screen in the Royal Albert Hall, this will be the first chance to hear Anne Nikitin&rsquo;s original soundtrack, performed live in concert by the&nbsp;<strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>Accompanying the evening&rsquo;s music, our big screen will feature two specially created films. This concert offers audiences their first opportunity to experience&nbsp;<em>The Moonwalkers</em>&nbsp;outside its original Lightroom setting, in a specially curated edition featuring original NASA footage,<strong>&nbsp;Andy Saunders</strong>&rsquo;&nbsp;<em>Apollo Remastered</em>&nbsp;images, and a pre-recorded narration by Tom Hanks &ndash; transporting you to the lunar surface. Opening the evening, Eric Whitacre&rsquo;s music is paired with&nbsp;<em>Deep Field: The Impossible Magnitude of Our Universe</em>, combining Hubble&rsquo;s breathtaking imagery with bespoke animations.</p>\\r\\n<p><em>The Moonwalkers is narrated on film by Tom Hanks, written by Tom Hanks and Christopher Riley with an original score by Anne Nikitin, and created by Lightroom. Directed and designed by 59, A Journey Studio. In association with ESK live.</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n<p><em>_____________________________________________________________</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2254,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99299,\"PerformanceNumber\":103004,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-24T21:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-24T21:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Late Night Jazz: Tamar Osborn\",\"Suffix\":\"Curated by Sarathy Korwar\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Saxophonist Tamar Osborn celebrates the release of her latest work Varier: Berlin.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\"