"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Film-Music-Live-2027-RAH-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7650&token=776abd08&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Film-Music-Live-2027-RAH-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7650&token=776abd08&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Film-Music-Live-2027-RAH-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7650&token=776abd08&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Film-Music-Live-2027-RAH-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7650&token=776abd08&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"The Royal Albert Hall sits in a desert landscape with a planet and a UFO in the background. A figure dressed in a space suit holding a violin walks towards the Hall.\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/102215\",\"Categories\":[\"Film\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/film-music-live-sci-fi-and-fantasy\",\"DateDescription\":\"Saturday 29 May 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[{\"Type\":\"Person\",\"Title\":\"Stephen Bell\",\"Role\":\"conductor\",\"Website\":null},{\"Type\":\"Music Group\",\"Title\":\"Royal Philharmonic Orchestra\",\"Role\":null,\"Website\":null}],\"ThemeColor\":\"#8c52de\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Film-Music-Live-2027-RAH-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7650&token=776abd08&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Film-Music-Live-2027-RAH-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7650&token=776abd08&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Film-Music-Live-2027-RAH-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7650&token=776abd08&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Film-Music-Live-2027-RAH-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7650&token=776abd08&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"The Royal Albert Hall sits in a desert landscape with a planet and a UFO in the background. A figure dressed in a space suit holding a violin walks towards the Hall.\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"1763-102216\",\"PerformanceNumber\":102216,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102215,\"Date\":\"2027-05-29T15:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-29T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-05-29T14:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7,\"MaximumPrice\":287.25,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Explore the wonderfully imaginative realms of sci-fi and fantasy films through the power of live music from the <strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra. </strong></p>\\r\\n<p>This spectacular concert features thrilling themes from the iconic interplanetary worlds of <em>Star Wars, Star Trek, Avatar, Superman, Dune</em> and <em>War of the Worlds</em>. Plus music from time-travelling favourites such as Back to the Future, sci-fi classics such as 2001: A Space Odyssey, and extraterrestrial?life in its many musical forms including <em>E.T.</em> and <em>Guardians of the Galaxy</em>.</p>\\r\\n<p>Stephen Bell will also conduct excerpts from the fantastical film scores of <em>The Lord of the Rings, Harry Potter, Spirited Away, KPop Demon Hunters</em> and more.</p>\\r\\n<p>_______________________________________________________________________</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n<p>_______________________________________________________________________</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"1763-102217\",\"PerformanceNumber\":102217,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102215,\"Date\":\"2027-05-29T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-29T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-05-29T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":7,\"MaximumPrice\":287.25,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2167,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102084,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2027-03-25T19:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2027-03-25T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Angélique Kidjo and Youssou Ndour\",\"Suffix\":\"The Chimes of Freedom Tour\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Angélique Kidjo and Youssou Ndour return to the Royal Albert Hall as part of the Chimes of Freedom tour.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/AngeliqueKidjo_CarnagieHall-91.jpg?type=image&id=7395&token=cd117395&mode=fill&top=15&left=0&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/AngeliqueKidjo_CarnagieHall-91.jpg?type=image&id=7395&token=cd117395&mode=fill&top=20&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/AngeliqueKidjo_CarnagieHall-91.jpg?type=image&id=7395&token=cd117395&mode=fill&top=29&left=0&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/AngeliqueKidjo_CarnagieHall-91.jpg?type=image&id=7395&token=cd117395&mode=fill&top=32&left=0&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/AngeliqueKidjo_CarnagieHall-91.jpg?type=image&id=7395&token=cd117395&mode=fill&top=40&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":null,\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/102084\",\"Categories\":[\"Rock and Pop\",\"Jazz\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/angelique-kidjo-and-youssou-ndour\",\"DateDescription\":\"Thursday 25 March 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#8c52de\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/AngeliqueKidjo_CarnagieHall-91.jpg?type=image&id=7395&token=cd117395&mode=fill&top=20&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/AngeliqueKidjo_CarnagieHall-91.jpg?type=image&id=7395&token=cd117395&mode=fill&top=40&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/AngeliqueKidjo_CarnagieHall-91.jpg?type=image&id=7395&token=cd117395&mode=fill&top=96&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/AngeliqueKidjo_CarnagieHall-91.jpg?type=image&id=7395&token=cd117395&mode=fill&top=192&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":null,\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2167-102085\",\"PerformanceNumber\":102085,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102084,\"Date\":\"2027-03-25T19:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-08T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-03-25T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":30,\"MaximumPrice\":248.04,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<header>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Royal Albert Hall presents\\r\\n<h1>Ang&eacute;lique Kidjo and Youssou NDour</h1>\\r\\nThe Chimes of Freedom Tour</div>\\r\\n<hr />\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Thursday 25 March 2027</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</header>\\r\\n<div data-swiftype-index=\\\"true\\\">\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Ang&eacute;lique Kidjo</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Youssou NDour</strong>&nbsp;return to the Royal Albert Hall as part of the&nbsp;<em>Chimes of Freedom</em>&nbsp;tour.</p>\\r\\n<p>Marking the first time they've have toured together with a night of their greatest hits and specially arranged duets. Ang&eacute;lique, described by Time Magazine as &lsquo;<em>Africa&rsquo;s premier diva</em>&rsquo;, and NDour, ranked by Rolling Stones as one of the '<em>Greatest singers of all time'</em>, have both spent over 40 years shaping West African sounds with R&amp;B, funk, jazz and more.</p>\\r\\n<p>Expect an unforgettable night as two legends of African music come together on one stage.</p>\\r\\n<p>_________________________________________</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong><br />In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p><br />This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office <br />________________________________________________________________</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":87,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private Hire of a Second Tier Box for 4 guests <br />*Half bottle wine, 1 beer and mineral water per person<br />*Cold bowl dish, loaded nachos, sliders and fries and themed desserts <br />*Popcorn <br />*Box Waiter on hand</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1970,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100171,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2027-05-12T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2027-05-12T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"SJM Concerts present\",\"Title\":\"John Bishop\",\"Suffix\":\"Let's Go Round Again\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"John Bishop is bringing his brand-new show, Let's Go Round Again to the Hall in spring 2027.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/John-Bishop-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6653&token=018800dd&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/John-Bishop-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6653&token=018800dd&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/John-Bishop-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6653&token=018800dd&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/John-Bishop-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6653&token=018800dd&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/John-Bishop-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6653&token=018800dd&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"John Bishop\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/100171\",\"Categories\":[\"Comedy\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/john-bishop\",\"DateDescription\":\"Wednesday 12 May 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#fc9400\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/John-Bishop-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6653&token=018800dd&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/John-Bishop-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6653&token=018800dd&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/John-Bishop-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6653&token=018800dd&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/John-Bishop-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6653&token=018800dd&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"John Bishop\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"1970-100172\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100172,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100171,\"Date\":\"2027-05-12T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-01-30T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-05-12T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":25,\"MaximumPrice\":267.65,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"8\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":63,\"ContentType\":\"T&C Checkbox\",\"Content\":\"Over 14s only. Under 16s must be accompanied by an adult over 18.\\r\\n\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":65,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Image URL\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/John-Bishop-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6653&token=018800dd\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>SJM Concerts presents<strong> - John Bishop: Let's Go Round Again<br /><br />John Bishop</strong>&nbsp;is bringing his brand-new show,&nbsp;<em>Let's Go Round Again</em>&nbsp;to the Hall in spring 2027.</p>\\r\\n<p>Hot on the heels of John&rsquo;s sold out critically acclaimed international &lsquo;25&rsquo; tour last year - which celebrated his incredible quarter of a century career as a comedian - the comedy superstar will play some of the biggest venues in the UK and Ireland next year.</p>\\r\\n<p>Since John&rsquo;s first gig in October 2000, he has achieved so much in his incredible career. Within three years John was playing to sold out arena audiences across the country and released the fastest selling stand-up DVD in UK history.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":87,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p><br />*Private hire of box for 4 guests <br />*Box waiter <br />*2 bottles wine per box, 4 beers, mineral water and selection of soft drinks <br />*Cold bowl dish, loaded nachos, sliders and fries and dessert canapes</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":89,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Private hire of box for 8 guests <br />*Box waiter <br />*4 bottles wine per box, 8 beers, mineral water and selection of soft drinks <br />*Cold bowl dish, loaded nachos, sliders and fries and dessert canapes</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":293,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge\",\"Content\":\"<p><br />*Premium Stalls Seating <br />*Pre and interval VIP Lounge<br />*Canapes, bowl dishes, desserts, wine, beer and soft drinks</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":427,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Premium Arena \",\"Content\":\"<p><strong>John Bishop Best Seats for Charity ticket</strong>. &nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&pound;50 from every ticket sold is donated to charity.</p>\\r\\n<p>Proceeds from the Charity Ticket will support The Talent Fund.</p>\\r\\n<p>John Bishop will donate a minimum of &pound;50&nbsp;from each Charity Ticket, (less applicable taxes), to The Talent Fund, a registered charity no. 1185346. The money raised will support&nbsp;work tackling disadvantage and promoting social justice.</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;For more information, please visit <u><a href=\\\"https://url.uk.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/IqPwCWnQ1U6PgoYtxh2HoDaOk?domain=thetalentfund.org\\\">www.thetalentfund.org</a></u></p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1893,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99230,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2027-10-28T19:45:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2027-10-28T19:45:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Triple A Entertainment presents\",\"Title\":\"Laura Pausini\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"The world’s most awarded Italian Artist, Laura Pausini, will take to the stage at the Hall on Thursday 28 October 2027.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/10-October/Laura-Pausini-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6148&token=34186f2c&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/10-October/Laura-Pausini-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6148&token=34186f2c&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/10-October/Laura-Pausini-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6148&token=34186f2c&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/10-October/Laura-Pausini-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6148&token=34186f2c&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/10-October/Laura-Pausini-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6148&token=34186f2c&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Laura Pausini\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/99230\",\"Categories\":[\"Rock and Pop\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/laura-pausini\",\"DateDescription\":\"Thursday 28 October 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#8c52de\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/10-October/Laura-Pausini-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6148&token=34186f2c&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/10-October/Laura-Pausini-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6148&token=34186f2c&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/10-October/Laura-Pausini-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6148&token=34186f2c&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/10-October/Laura-Pausini-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6148&token=34186f2c&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Laura Pausini\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"1893-99234\",\"PerformanceNumber\":99234,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99230,\"Date\":\"2027-10-28T19:45:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2025-11-28T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-10-28T19:10:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":60,\"MaximumPrice\":130,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"6\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":65,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Image URL\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/10-October/Laura-Pausini-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6148&token=34186f2c\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<header>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>Triple A Entertainment presents\\r\\n<h1>Laura Pausini</h1>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</header>\\r\\n<div data-swiftype-index=\\\"true\\\">\\r\\n<section></section>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p>The world&rsquo;s most awarded Italian Artist,&nbsp;<strong>Laura Pausini</strong>, will take to the stage at the Hall on Thursday 28 October 2027. In addition to her most celebrated hits, she will also perform some of the tracks from her new album,&nbsp;<em>IO CANTO 2</em>.</p>\\r\\n<p>The record-breaking singer-songwriter and global pop icon &mdash; with over 75 million records sold worldwide and more than 6 billion streams &mdash; is recognized as the most-listened-to Italian female artist abroad. She is the first and only Italian artist to win a Grammy Award and to enter the Billboard Hot 100.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":139,\"ContentType\":\"Friends Max Performance\",\"Content\":\"2\",\