presents\",\"Title\":\"Star Wars: A New Hope in Concert (U)\",\"Suffix\":\"with the London Symphony Orchestra\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Experience Star Wars: A New Hope in concert with the blockbuster on the big screen, all whilst John Williams' epic score is performed live-to-picture by the London Symphony Orchestra, conducted by Ludwig Wicki.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-A-New-Hope/DC_SWNH_10.jpg?type=image&id=7246&token=16edcc0e&mode=fill&top=17&left=0&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-A-New-Hope/DC_SWNH_10.jpg?type=image&id=7246&token=16edcc0e&mode=fill&top=23&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-A-New-Hope/DC_SWNH_10.jpg?type=image&id=7246&token=16edcc0e&mode=fill&top=33&left=0&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-A-New-Hope/DC_SWNH_10.jpg?type=image&id=7246&token=16edcc0e&mode=fill&top=37&left=0&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-A-New-Hope/DC_SWNH_10.jpg?type=image&id=7246&token=16edcc0e&mode=fill&top=46&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Luke Skywalker, Han Solo and Princess Leia\",\"caption\":\"© & ™ Lucasfilm Ltd\"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/101587\",\"Categories\":[\"Film\",\"Entertainment\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/star-wars-a-new-hope-in-concert\",\"DateDescription\":\"Thursday 29 April - Saturday 1 May 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#003dba\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-A-New-Hope/DC_SWNH_10.jpg?type=image&id=7246&token=16edcc0e&mode=fill&top=23&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-A-New-Hope/DC_SWNH_10.jpg?type=image&id=7246&token=16edcc0e&mode=fill&top=46&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-A-New-Hope/DC_SWNH_10.jpg?type=image&id=7246&token=16edcc0e&mode=fill&top=100&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-A-New-Hope/DC_SWNH_10.jpg?type=image&id=7246&token=16edcc0e&mode=fill&top=201&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Luke Skywalker, Han Solo and Princess Leia\",\"caption\":\"© & ™ Lucasfilm Ltd\"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2079-101590\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101590,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101587,\"Date\":\"2027-04-29T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-01T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-04-29T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":301.96,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents</p>\\r\\n<h1>Star Wars: A New Hope in Concert (U)</h1>\\r\\n<p>with the London Symphony Orchestra</p>\\r\\n<p>Experience&nbsp;<em>Star Wars: A New Hope</em>&nbsp;in concert with the blockbuster on the big screen, all whilst&nbsp;<strong>John</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Williams</strong>' epic score is performed live-to-picture by the&nbsp;<strong>London Symphony Orchestra</strong>, conducted by&nbsp;<strong>Ludwig Wicki</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>Luke Skywalker begins a journey that will change the galaxy. Nineteen years after the formation of the Empire, Luke is thrust into the struggle of the Rebel Alliance when he meets Jedi Master Obi-Wan Kenobi, who has lived for years in seclusion on the desert planet of Tatooine. Obi-Wan begins Luke&rsquo;s Jedi training as Luke joins him on a daring mission to rescue the beautiful Rebel leader Princess Leia from the clutches of Darth Vader and the evil Empire.</p>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n<p><em>_____________________________________________________________</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":295,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Decrease Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":296,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Increase Limit\",\"Content\":\"17\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"2079-101640\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101640,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101587,\"Date\":\"2027-05-01T14:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-01T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-05-01T13:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":311.76,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":118,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Hospitality Dining\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium Stalls Seating <br />*Three course brunch in Coda by Chavot Restaurant<br />*Welcome glass Champagne and half bottle of wine per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":295,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Decrease Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":296,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Increase Limit\",\"Content\":\"17\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1995,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100466,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-03-17T19:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-11-09T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":null,\"Title\":\"Themed stories from the archive tour\",\"Suffix\":\"Explore our Archive through a different lens\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":null,\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Archives-2023/2023-10-12-The-Archive-Opening/34_transform.jpg?type=image&id=6870&token=43ad1ee3&mode=fill&top=10&left=0&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Archives-2023/2023-10-12-The-Archive-Opening/34_transform.jpg?type=image&id=6870&token=43ad1ee3&mode=fill&top=14&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Archives-2023/2023-10-12-The-Archive-Opening/34_transform.jpg?type=image&id=6870&token=43ad1ee3&mode=fill&top=20&left=0&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Archives-2023/2023-10-12-The-Archive-Opening/34_transform.jpg?type=image&id=6870&token=43ad1ee3&mode=fill&top=23&lef