 Symphony Orchestra\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Experience Star Wars: Return of the Jedi in concert with the blockbuster on the big screen, all whilst John Williams' epic score is performed live-to-picture by the London Symphony Orchestra, conducted by Ludwig Wicki.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-Return-of-the-Jedi-in-Concert/DC_SWROTJ_1.jpg?type=image&id=7277&token=48aa2e9f&mode=fill&top=0&left=21&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-Return-of-the-Jedi-in-Concert/DC_SWROTJ_1.jpg?type=image&id=7277&token=48aa2e9f&mode=fill&top=0&left=28&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-Return-of-the-Jedi-in-Concert/DC_SWROTJ_1.jpg?type=image&id=7277&token=48aa2e9f&mode=fill&top=0&left=42&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-Return-of-the-Jedi-in-Concert/DC_SWROTJ_1.jpg?type=image&id=7277&token=48aa2e9f&mode=fill&top=0&left=45&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-Return-of-the-Jedi-in-Concert/DC_SWROTJ_1.jpg?type=image&id=7277&token=48aa2e9f&mode=fill&top=0&left=57&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"r2d2 and c3po\",\"caption\":\"© & ™ Lucasfilm Ltd\"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/101732\",\"Categories\":[\"Film\",\"Entertainment\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/star-wars-return-of-the-jedi\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 2 May 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#003dba\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-Return-of-the-Jedi-in-Concert/DC_SWROTJ_1.jpg?type=image&id=7277&token=48aa2e9f&mode=fill&top=0&left=28&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-Return-of-the-Jedi-in-Concert/DC_SWROTJ_1.jpg?type=image&id=7277&token=48aa2e9f&mode=fill&top=0&left=57&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-Return-of-the-Jedi-in-Concert/DC_SWROTJ_1.jpg?type=image&id=7277&token=48aa2e9f&mode=fill&top=51&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-Return-of-the-Jedi-in-Concert/DC_SWROTJ_1.jpg?type=image&id=7277&token=48aa2e9f&mode=fill&top=103&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"r2d2 and c3po\",\"caption\":\"© & ™ Lucasfilm Ltd\"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2118-101641\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101641,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101732,\"Date\":\"2027-05-02T13:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-01T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-05-02T12:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":301.96,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents</p>\\r\\n<h1>Star Wars: Return of the Jedi in Concert (PG)</h1>\\r\\n<p>with the London Symphony Orchestra</p>\\r\\n<p>The battle for the galaxy intensifies in this thrilling sixth episode of the unfolding saga, with John Williams&rsquo; iconic score performed live to film by the&nbsp;<strong>London Symphony Orchestra</strong>, conducted by&nbsp;<strong>Ludwig Wicki</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>Experience&nbsp;<em>Star Wars: Return of the Jedi</em>&nbsp;in concert with the blockbuster on the big screen, all whilst&nbsp;<strong>John</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Williams</strong>' epic score is performed live-to-picture by the&nbsp;<strong>London Symphony Orchestra</strong>, conducted by&nbsp;<strong>Ludwig Wicki</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>After a quick trip back to Tatooine, Luke Skywalker, Leia Organa, and Han Solo are reunited and join up with the amassing rebel fleet to take down the evil Empire once and for all. As the Empire prepares to crush the Rebellion with an even more powerful Death Star. Luke Skywalker confronts Darth Vader in a final climactic duel.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n<p><em>_____________________________________________________________</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":118,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Hospitality Dining\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium Stalls Seating <br />*Three course brunch in Coda by Chavot Restaurant<br />*Welcome glass Champagne and half bottle of wine per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":295,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Decrease Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":296,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Increase Limit\",\"Content\":\"17\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"2118-101642\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101642,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101732,\"Date\":\"2027-05-02T18:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-01T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-05-02T17:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":311.76,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":118,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Hospitality Dining\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium Stalls Seating <br />*Three course dinner in Coda by Chavot Restaurant<br />*Welcome glass Champagne and half bottle of wine per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":295,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Decrease Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":296,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Increase Limit\",\"Content\":\"17\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2082,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101731,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2027-04-30T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2027-05-01T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back in Concert (PG)\",\"Suffix\":\"with the London Symphony Orchestra\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"The battle for the galaxy intensifies in this thrilling fifth episode of the unfolding saga, with John Williams’ iconic score performed live to film by the London Symphony Orchestra, conducted by Ludwig Wicki.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-The-Empire-Strikes-Back-/DC_SWESB_14.jpg?type=image&id=7264&token=8ce13cd3&mode=fill&top=0&left=45&wid