l-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-The-Empire-Strikes-Back-/DC_SWESB_14.jpg?type=image&id=7264&token=8ce13cd3&mode=fill&top=0&left=62&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-The-Empire-Strikes-Back-/DC_SWESB_14.jpg?type=image&id=7264&token=8ce13cd3&mode=fill&top=0&left=124&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-The-Empire-Strikes-Back-/DC_SWESB_14.jpg?type=image&id=7264&token=8ce13cd3&mode=fill&top=27&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/Star-Wars-The-Empire-Strikes-Back-/DC_SWESB_14.jpg?type=image&id=7264&token=8ce13cd3&mode=fill&top=55&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"The Star Wars characters looking out to space\",\"caption\":\"© & ™ Lucasfilm Ltd\"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2082-101638\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101638,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101731,\"Date\":\"2027-04-30T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-01T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-04-30T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":301.96,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents</p>\\r\\n<h1>Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back in Concert (PG)</h1>\\r\\n<p>with the London Symphony Orchestra</p>\\r\\n<p>The battle for the galaxy intensifies in this thrilling fifth episode of the unfolding saga, with John Williams&rsquo; iconic score performed live to film by the&nbsp;<strong>London Symphony Orchestra</strong>, conducted by&nbsp;<strong>Ludwig Wicki</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>As Imperial Forces launch an all-out attack on the Rebel Alliance, Han Solo (Harrison Ford) and Princess Leia (Carrie Fisher) flee to Cloud City where they are captured by Darth Vader. Luke Skywalker (Mark Hamill) journeys to the mysterious, marshy planet of Dagobah, where the wise Jedi Master Yoda teaches the young hero the ways of the Force.&nbsp;Little does Luke know that all his Jedi training will be called upon so soon.</p>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n<p><em>_____________________________________________________________</em></p>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":295,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Decrease Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":296,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Increase Limit\",\"Content\":\"17\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"2082-101639\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101639,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101731,\"Date\":\"2027-05-01T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-05-01T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-05-01T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":311.76,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":295,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Decrease Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":296,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Increase Limit\",\"Content\":\"17\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2157,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100485,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-17T14:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-17T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Attack on Titan: Symphony from Paradis\",\"Suffix\":\"with the Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Join us for the world premiere of Attack on Titan: Symphony from Paradis, the first official orchestral concert dedicated to the series.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/20260413_AoTO_Web_London-2820-x-1487.jpg?type=image&id=7343&token=144e1fbf&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/20260413_AoTO_Web_London-2820-x-1487.jpg?type=image&id=7343&token=144e1fbf&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/20260413_AoTO_Web_London-2820-x-1487.jpg?type=image&id=7343&token=144e1fbf&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/20260413_AoTO_Web_London-2820-x-1487.jpg?type=image&id=7343&token=144e1fbf&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/20260413_AoTO_Web_London-2820-x-1487.jpg?type=image&id=7343&token=144e1fbf&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":null,\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/100485\",\"Categories\":[\"Film\",\"Entertainment\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/attack-on-titan-in-concert\",\"DateDescription\":\"Saturday 17 October 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0d2626\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/20260413_AoTO_Web_London-2820-x-1487.jpg?type=image&id=7343&token=144e1fbf&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/20260413_AoTO_Web_London-2820-x-1487.jpg?type=image&id=7343&token=144e1fbf&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/20260413_AoTO_Web_London-2820-x-1487.jpg?type=image&id=7343&token=144e1fbf&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/20260413_AoTO_Web_London-2820-x-1487.jpg?type=image&id=7343&token=144e1fbf&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":null,\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2157-100486\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100486,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100485,\"Date\":\"2026-10-17T14:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-04-30T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-10-17T13:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":336.27,\"WebContents\":[]},{\"ID\":\"2157-100487\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100487,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100485,\"Date\":\"2026-10-17T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-04-30T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-10-17T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":316.67,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents:&nbsp;<strong>Attack on Titan: Symphony from Paradis</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Join us for the world premiere of Attack on Titan: Symphony from Paradis, the first official orchestral concert dedicated to the series. Featuring newly created symphonic arrangements curated by original composers Hiroyuki SAWANO and KOHTA YAMAMOTO, this is a powerful new way to experience anime.</p>\\r\\n<p>The concert will bring exceptional scale and depth to the score. With the footage from the series projected on the big screen, whilst the score is performed live by the Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra and London Voices, conducted by Alexandra Cravero.</p>\\r\\n<p>Attack on Titan is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Hajime Isayama. Since its debut in 2009, it has become a global phenomenon, renowned for its complex storytelling and emotional depth. The story takes place in a world where a boy named Eren Yeager yearns to explore the world beyond his current circumstances. What began as a childish dream, though, will become an all-too-real nightmare when the Titans return, and humanity is once again on the brink of extinction.</p>\\r\\n<p><br /><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><br />In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p><br />This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office <br />____________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1980,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100269,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-07-11T20:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-07-11T20:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Live Nation presents\",\"Title\":\"Aziz Ansari\",\"Suffix\":\"Hypothetical Tour\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Award-winning actor, director, writer and comedian, Aziz Ansari is returning to the Hall this summer.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/Aziz-Ansari_2820-x-1487_RAH-size.jpg?type=image&id=6845&token=0079fed4&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/Aziz-Ansari_2820-x-1487_RAH-size.jpg?type=image&id=6845&token=0079fed4&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/Aziz-Ansari_2820-x-1487_RAH-size.jpg?type=image&id=6845&token=0079fed4&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/Aziz-Ansari_2820-x-1487_RAH-size.jpg?type=image&id=6845&token=0079fed4&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/7-July/Aziz-Ansari_2820-x-1487_RAH-size.jpg?type=image&id=6845&token=0079fed4&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Aziz Ansari\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"Ad