o Code Box\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2038,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101014,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2027-05-09T15:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2027-05-09T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"The Planets: John Wilson and Sinfonia of London\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Experience a special performance of Holst’s The Planets by John Wilson and the Sinfonia of London.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/20251125_sinfonia_of_london_grosvenor_C_eduardus_lee_019.jpg?type=image&id=7069&token=3c29ac7a&mode=fill&top=17&left=0&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/20251125_sinfonia_of_london_grosvenor_C_eduardus_lee_019.jpg?type=image&id=7069&token=3c29ac7a&mode=fill&top=22&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/20251125_sinfonia_of_london_grosvenor_C_eduardus_lee_019.jpg?type=image&id=7069&token=3c29ac7a&mode=fill&top=33&left=0&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/20251125_sinfonia_of_london_grosvenor_C_eduardus_lee_019.jpg?type=image&id=7069&token=3c29ac7a&mode=fill&top=36&left=0&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/20251125_sinfonia_of_london_grosvenor_C_eduardus_lee_019.jpg?type=image&id=7069&token=3c29ac7a&mode=fill&top=45&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Sinfonia of London performing with John Wilson\",\"caption\":\"Eduardus Lee\"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/101014\",\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/the-planets-john-wilson-and-sinfonia-of-london\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 9 May 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#fc9400\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/20251125_sinfonia_of_london_grosvenor_C_eduardus_lee_019.jpg?type=image&id=7069&token=3c29ac7a&mode=fill&top=22&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/20251125_sinfonia_of_london_grosvenor_C_eduardus_lee_019.jpg?type=image&id=7069&token=3c29ac7a&mode=fill&top=45&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/20251125_sinfonia_of_london_grosvenor_C_eduardus_lee_019.jpg?type=image&id=7069&token=3c29ac7a&mode=fill&top=100&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/5-May/20251125_sinfonia_of_london_grosvenor_C_eduardus_lee_019.jpg?type=image&id=7069&token=3c29ac7a&mode=fill&top=200&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Sinfonia of London performing with John Wilson\",\"caption\":\"Eduardus Lee\"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2038-101015\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101015,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101014,\"Date\":\"2027-05-09T15:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-03-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-05-09T14:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":272.55,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents.</p>\\r\\n<p>Experience a special performance of&nbsp;<em>The Planets&nbsp;</em>by&nbsp;<strong>John Wilson</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Sinfonia of London.</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Five years since the orchestra's debut in 2021, Sinfonia of London is known for setting a gold standard, bringing together top musicians and artists for one-of-a-kind concerts. This will be no exception, as they plan to transport audiences to outer-space, spotlighting the magnificence of&nbsp;<strong>Gustav Holst&rsquo;s&nbsp;</strong><em>The Planets</em>,<strong>&nbsp;Josef Strauss&rsquo;&nbsp;</strong><em>Music of the Spheres&nbsp;</em>and&nbsp;<strong>Jonathan Dove&rsquo;s</strong>&nbsp;<em>Stargazer</em>, featuring the extraordinary&nbsp;<strong>Peter Moore</strong>&nbsp;on trombone.</p>\\r\\n<p>____________________________________________________</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING </strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n<p>____________________________________________________</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":79,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private Hire of a Loggia Box for 8 guests</p>\\r\\n<p>*Traditional Afternoon Tea served in box&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*Quarter bottle Champagne per person&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*A dedicated service waiter per box&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private Hire of a Second Tier Box for 4 guests</p>\\r\\n<p>*Traditional Afternoon Tea served in box&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*Quarter bottle Champagne per person&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*A dedicated service waiter per box&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"2038-101021\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101021,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101014,\"Date\":\"2027-05-09T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-03-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-05-09T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":326.47,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents.</p>\\r\\n<p>Experience a special performance of&nbsp;<em>The Planets&nbsp;</em>by&nbsp;<strong>John Wilson</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Sinfonia of London.</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Five years since the orchestra's debut in 2021, Sinfonia of London is known for setting a gold standard, bringing together top musicians and artists for one-of-a-kind concerts. This will be no exception, as they plan to transport audiences to outer-space, spotlighting the magnificence of&nbsp;<strong>Gustav Holst&rsquo;s&nbsp;</strong><em>The Planets</em>,<strong>&nbsp;Josef Strauss&rsquo;&nbsp;</strong><em>Music of the Spheres&nbsp;</em>and&nbsp;<strong>Jonathan Dove&rsquo;s</strong>&nbsp;<em>Stargazer</em>, featuring the extraordinary&nbsp;<strong>Peter Moore</strong>&nbsp;on trombone.</p>\\r\\n<p>____________________________________________________</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING </strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n<p>____________________________________________________</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":79,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private Hire of a Loggia Box for 8 guests&nbsp;<br />*1/2 bottle Champagne per person <br />*1/2 bottle wine per person <br />*Canapes, bowl dishes, dessert canapes<br />*Private box waiter</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private Hire of a Second Tier Box for 4 guests&nbsp;<br />*1/2 bottle Champagne per person <br />*1/2 bottle wine per person <br />*Canapes, bowl dishes, dessert canapes<br />*Private box waiter</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2119,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102566,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-06-30T12:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-11-24T12:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":null,\"Title\":\"Relaxed Tours\",\"Suffix\":\"An acessible way to discover a London landmark\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Together with a friendly guide, you’ll take a peek at the royal areas of the Hall, see the breath-taking auditorium, and the stage that’s hosted some of the world’s biggest change-makers, history-shapers and stars.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg11