pprox 22:45.</li>\\r\\n<li>Plus all Gold guests will receive an official Giants Live goody bag &amp; souvenir show programme.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2250,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":103101,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2027-03-30T20:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2027-03-30T20:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Live Nation presents\",\"Title\":\"Avatar\",\"Suffix\":\"Feathers and Flesh 10th Anniversary\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Swedish heavy metal band, Avatar are coming to the Hall in Spring 2027.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Avatar-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7892&token=3a8a8922&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Avatar-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7892&token=3a8a8922&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Avatar-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7892&token=3a8a8922&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Avatar-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7892&token=3a8a8922&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Avatar-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7892&token=3a8a8922&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Avatar\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/103101\",\"Categories\":[\"Rock and Pop\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/avatar\",\"DateDescription\":\"Tuesday 30 March 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#8c52de\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Avatar-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7892&token=3a8a8922&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Avatar-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7892&token=3a8a8922&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Avatar-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7892&token=3a8a8922&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2027/3-March/Avatar-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7892&token=3a8a8922&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Avatar\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2250-103103\",\"PerformanceNumber\":103103,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":103101,\"Date\":\"2027-03-30T20:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-07-08T13:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-03-30T19:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":49.5,\"MaximumPrice\":70,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"6\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Swedish heavy metal band, <strong>Avatar</strong> are coming to the Hall in Spring 2027. Formed in M&ouml;lndal in 2001, the band has released ten studio albums, with the most recent, <em>Don't Go in the Forest</em>, being released in October 2025.</p>\\r\\n<p>On stage is where <strong>Avatar tru</strong>ly comes alive, known for their unique blend of suggestive theatrics and unabashed, unapologetic heavy metal. With countless international shows, they have proven that there is only one <strong>Avatar </strong>and everyone else is playing for second place.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2253,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":103104,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2027-06-06T14:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2027-06-06T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Raymond Gubbay presents\",\"Title\":\"The Music of Zimmer vs Williams 2027\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Two of the greatest film composers of all time go head-to-head in The Music of Zimmer vs Williams at the Royal Albert Hall.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":null,\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/103104\",\"Categories\":[\"Film\",\"Entertainment\",\"Contemporary Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2027/the-music-of-zimmer-vs-williams\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 6 June 2027\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#8c52de\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":null,\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2253-103105\",\"PerformanceNumber\":103105,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":103104,\"Date\":\"2027-06-06T14:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-07-10T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-06-06T13:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.45,\"MaximumPrice\":287.25,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"2253-103106\",\"PerformanceNumber\":103106,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":103104,\"Date\":\"2027-06-06T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-07-10T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2027-06-06T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.45,\"MaximumPrice\":287.25,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Prepare for an unforgettable evening as two of the greatest film composers of all time go head-to-head in <strong>The Music of Zimmer vs Williams</strong> at the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>Experience the best of <strong>Hans Zimmer</strong> and <strong>John Williams</strong> as the <strong>London Concert Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;brings to life the legendary scores that have defined the cinematic landscape for decades. This thrilling concert features music from the most iconic films, pitting the epic soundscapes of Zimmer against the timeless melodies of Williams.</p>\\r\\n<p>Feel the power, emotion, and excitement of these world-renowned soundtracks, performed live by a 70-piece orchestra. Whether you're a fan of Zimmer's bold, immersive style or Williams' timeless, iconic themes, this concert offers the ultimate showdown in film music.</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Programme</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Relive unforgettable moments with music from:</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><em>Star Wars<br /> Interstellar<br /> Harry Potter<br /> Gladiator<br /> The Pirates of the Caribbean<br /> The Lion King<br /> Witches of Eastwick</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>London Concert Orchestra<br /> Robert Emery </strong>conductor<br /><strong>Coro Spezzato</strong>&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2158,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101733,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-06-08T11:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-12-18T13:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Bring Your Own Baby\",\"Suffix\":\"A comedy gig for grown-ups\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"A comedy gig for adults that doesn't require childcare.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/4-April/BTMS/BYOB_london_brandingphotos_JWW_0062.jpg?type=image&id=7349&token=f2ab3980&mode=fill&top=16&left=0&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/4-April/BTMS/BYOB_london_brandingphotos_JWW_0062.jpg?type=image&id=7349&token=f2ab3980&mode=fill&top=22&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/4-April/BTMS/BYOB_london_brandingphotos_JWW_0062.jpg?type=image&id=7349&token=f2ab3980&mode=fill&top=32&left=0&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/4-April/BTMS/BYOB_london_brandingphotos_JWW_0062.jpg?type=image&id=7349&token=f2ab3980&mode=fill&top=36&left=0&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/4-April/BTMS/BYOB_london_brandingphotos_JWW_0062.jpg?type=image&id=7349&token=f2ab3980&mode=fill&top=45&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Bring Your Own Baby\",\"caption\":null},\"Ven