cert/39939_csnor_stl_3_h-v3.jpg?type=image&id=6269&token=6d3688e5&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"CR_13927R – Daniel Craig stars in Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Pictures/Columbia Pictures/EON Productions’ action adventure Casino Royale.\\n\\nPhoto Credit: Jay Maidment\\n\",\"caption\":\"© 2006 DANJAQ, UNITED ARTISTS\"},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/99156\",\"Categories\":[\"Film\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/casino-royale-in-concert\",\"DateDescription\":\"Wednesday 30 December 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0d2626\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Casino-Royale-in-Concert/39939_csnor_stl_3_h-v3.jpg?type=image&id=6269&token=6d3688e5&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Casino-Royale-in-Concert/39939_csnor_stl_3_h-v3.jpg?type=image&id=6269&token=6d3688e5&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Casino-Royale-in-Concert/39939_csnor_stl_3_h-v3.jpg?type=image&id=6269&token=6d3688e5&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Casino-Royale-in-Concert/39939_csnor_stl_3_h-v3.jpg?type=image&id=6269&token=6d3688e5&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"CR_13927R – Daniel Craig stars in Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Pictures/Columbia Pictures/EON Productions’ action adventure Casino Royale.\\n\\nPhoto Credit: Jay Maidment\\n\",\"caption\":\"© 2006 DANJAQ, UNITED ARTISTS\"},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"1899-99157\",\"PerformanceNumber\":99157,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99156,\"Date\":\"2026-12-30T13:00:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2025-12-09T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-12-30T12:25:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":287.25,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":118,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Hospitality Dining\",\"Content\":\"<p>&bull;Premium Stalls seats<br />&bull;Two glasses of Champagne per person*<br />&bull;Three course brunch menu served in Coda by Eric Chavot Restaurant<br />&bull;Smoothie and filter coffee and tea</p>\\r\\n<p><br />*Alcohol can only be served after 11am</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"1899-99296\",\"PerformanceNumber\":99296,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99156,\"Date\":\"2026-12-30T18:00:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2025-12-09T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-12-30T17:25:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":287.25,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents:</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Casino Royale in Concert (12A) 2026</strong><br /><strong>with the Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Celebrating its 20th anniversary, <em>Casino Royale</em> is back on the big screen, accompanied by a full symphony orchestra.</p>\\r\\n<p>Experience David Arnold's thrilling score performed live by the <strong>Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra</strong> conducted by <strong>Anthony Gabriele</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>Directed by Martin Campbell, <em>Casino Royale</em> is the 21st Bond film in the series, and the first starring Daniel Craig, with an international cast that includes Eva Green, Mads Mikkelsen, Jeffrey Wright and Dame Judi Dench.</p>\\r\\n<p><em>Casino Royale licensed by MGM. Casino Royale &copy; 2006 Danjaq, United Artists. 007 and related James Bond trademarks, TM Danjaq. All rights reserved.</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office<em><br />________________________________________________________<br /></em></p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":118,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Hospitality Dining\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium stalls seat <br />*Three course dinner in Coda by Chavot Restaurant<br />*Welcome glass of Champagne and half bottle of wine per person <br />*Still &amp; Sparkling mineral water, tea or coffee</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2021,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100320,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-12-07T14:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-12-07T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Christmas with the Royal Choral Society\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"See the celebrated choir, who have been performing at the Royal Albert Hall since our doors first opened in 1871.\",\