_106.jpg?type=image&id=6946&token=f8931b55&mode=fill&top=45&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/RS120724_106.jpg?type=image&id=6946&token=f8931b55&mode=fill&top=100&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/RS120724_106.jpg?type=image&id=6946&token=f8931b55&mode=fill&top=200&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Christmas with the Royal Choral Society 15-12-25\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2021-100321\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100321,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100320,\"Date\":\"2026-12-07T14:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-03-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-12-07T13:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":0,\"MaximumPrice\":287.25,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents:&nbsp;<strong>Christmas with the Royal Choral Society</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Join the&nbsp;<strong>Royal Choral Society</strong>&nbsp;for a concert of festive songs, carols old and new and, of course, traditional favourites for you to join in with.</p>\\r\\n<p>Originally formed as part of the Royal Albert Hall&rsquo;s official opening, the celebrated, 200-strong choir has sung here<strong>&nbsp;</strong>every Christmas since 1872.</p>\\r\\n<p>They are joined by the&nbsp;<strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;conducted by&nbsp;<strong>Richard Cooke</strong>, the&nbsp;<strong>British Imperial Military</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Band</strong>, and special guest presenter&nbsp;<strong>Alexander Armstrong</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>_____________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":251,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Afternoon Tea\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*A festive Afternoon Tea served in a Loggia box for 8 guests&nbsp;<br />*Quarter bottle Champagne per person <br />*Mineral water<br />*A dedicated service waiter per box <br />*A cracker and gift per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":253,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Afternoon Tea\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*A festive Afternoon Tea served in a Second Tier box for 4 guests&nbsp;<br />*Quarter bottle Champagne per person <br />*Mineral water<br />*A dedicated service waiter per box <br />*A cracker and gift per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"2021-100462\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100462,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100320,\"Date\":\"2026-12-07T19:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-03-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-12-07T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":0,\"MaximumPrice\":336.27,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents:&nbsp;<strong>Christmas with the Royal Choral Society</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Join the&nbsp;<strong>Royal Choral Society</strong>&nbsp;for a concert of festive songs, carols old and new and, of course, traditional favourites for you to join in with.</p>\\r\\n<p>Originally formed as part of the Royal Albert Hall&rsquo;s official opening, the celebrated, 200-strong choir has sung here<strong>&nbsp;</strong>every Christmas since 1872.</p>\\r\\n<p>They are joined by the&nbsp;<strong>Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;conducted by&nbsp;<strong>Richard Cooke</strong>, the&nbsp;<strong>British Imperial Military</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Band</strong>, and special guest presenter&nbsp;<strong>Alexander Armstrong</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>_____________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":87,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private hire of a Second Tier box for 4 guests&nbsp;<br />*Half bottle of Champagne, half bottle wine, mulled wine<br />*A selection of mineral water and soft drinks <br />*Luxury canap&eacute;s and a cold bowl dish served pre show <br />*Hot bowl dishes and dessert canap&eacute;s served in the interval <br />*A dedicated service waiter per box <br />*Programme per 2 guests, a cracker and gift per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":89,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private hire of a Loggia box for 8 guests&nbsp;<br />*Half bottle of Champagne, half bottle wine, mulled wine<br />*A selection of mineral water and soft drinks <br />*Luxury canap&eacute;s and a cold bowl dish served pre show <br />*Hot bowl dishes and dessert canap&eacute;s served in the interval <br />*A dedicated service waiter per box <br />*Programme per 2 guests, a cracker and gift per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2246,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":103120,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-12-01T19:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-12-01T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"The Salvation Army presents\",\"Title\":\"Christmas with the Salvation Army\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Begin your festive season by Celebrating Christmas with The Salvation Army.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Salvation-Army-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7869&token=277fdab3&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Salvation-Army-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7869&token=277fdab3&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Salvation-Army-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7869&token=277fdab3&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Salvation-Army-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7869&token=277fdab3&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Salvation-Army-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7869&token=277fdab3&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Orchestra performing on the Royal Albert Hall stage for Christmas by Salvation Army\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/103120\",\"Categories\":[\"Classical\",\"Entertainment\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/christmas-with-the-salvation-army\",\"DateDescription\":\"Tuesday 1 December 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#d72020\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Salvation-Army-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7869&token=277fdab3&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Salvation-Army-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7869&token=277fdab3&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Salvation-Army-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7869&token=277fdab3&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/12-December/Salvation-Army-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7869&token=277fdab3&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Orchestra performing on the Royal Albert Hall stage for Christmas by Salvation Army\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2246-103121\",\"PerformanceNumber\":103121,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":103120,\"Date\":\"2026-12-01T20:00:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-07-17T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-12-01T19:25:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":22,\"MaximumPrice\":50,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Begin your festive season by Celebrating Christmas with <strong>The Salvation Arm</strong>y.</p>\\r\\n<p>Join us for an exciting evening of live music, spoken word and celebrity guests. Sing along with your favourite carols and become immersed in Christmas readings. Featuring our own <strong>International Staff Band, International Staff Songsters</strong> and <strong>Salvation Army Big Band.</strong></p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1871,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":98739,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-27T19:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-27T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Metropolis Music presents\",\"Title\":\"Corinne Bailey Rae\",\"Suffix\":\"with Special Guest Laura Mvula\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Corinne Bailey Rae will be performing her Grammy Award-winning acclaimed debut album in full at the Hall in London on October 2026.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Corinne-Bailey-Rae-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6021&token=da8d9393&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Corinne-Bailey-Rae-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6021&token=da8d9393&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Corinne-Bailey-Rae-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6021&token=da8d9393&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Corinne-Bailey-Rae-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6021&token=da8d9393&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Corinne-Bailey-Rae-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6021&token=da8d9393&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Corinne Bailey Rae\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/98739\",\"Categories\":[\"Rock and Pop\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/corinne-bailey-rae\",\"DateDescription\":\"Tuesday 27 October 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#8c52de\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Corinne-Bailey-Rae-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6021&token=da8d9393&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Corinne-Bailey-Rae-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6021&token=da8d9393&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Corinne-Bailey-Rae-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6021&token=da8d9393&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Corinne-Bailey-Rae-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6021&token=da8d9393&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Corinne Bailey Rae\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"1871-98741\",\"PerformanceNumber\":98741,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":98739,\"Date\":\"2026-10-27T19:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2025-11-07T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-10-27T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":35,\"MaximumPrice\":242.16,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"6\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":65,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Image URL\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Corinne-Bailey-Rae-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6021&token=da8d9393\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Metropolis Music presents:</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Corinne Bailey Rae with Special Guest Laura Mvula</strong></p><p><br></p><p>2026 marks the 20th anniversary of Corinne Bailey Rae, the Grammy Award-winning singer’s acclaimed debut album that introduced the world to her soulful, sun-soaked sound. In celebration of the anniversary Corinne Bailey Rae will be performing the album in full at the Hall in London on October 26 2026.</p><p><br></p><p>Originally released in February 2006, the record went straight to Number 1 in the UK and produced timeless global hits like ‘Put Your Records On’ and ‘Like A Star’, earning critical praise, multi-platinum sales, and Brit Award and Grammy nominations.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>The show will also include hits from her further three albums – The Sea, The Heart Speaks In Whispers and Black Rainbows – all of which have been garlanded with critical praise around the world, including two Mercury Prize nominations in the UK.&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":79,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p><p><br></p><p>*Private hire of a box for 8 guests&nbsp;</p><p>*Box waiter&nbsp;</p><p>*4 bottles wine per box, 8 beers, mineral water and selection of soft drinks&nbsp;</p><p>*Cold bowl dish, loaded nachos, mini sliders and waffle fries&nbsp;</p><p>*Dessert canapes&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include</p><p><br></p><p>*Private hire of a box for 4 guests&nbsp;</p><p>*Box waiter&nbsp;</p><p>*2 bottles wine per box, 4 beers, mineral water and selection of soft drinks&nbsp;</p><p>*Cold bowl dish, loaded nachos, mini sliders and waffle fries&nbsp;</p><p>*Dessert canapes&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":293,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p><p><br></p><p>*Premium Stalls seat&nbsp;</p><p>*Pre and interval VIP Lounge</p><p>*Canapes, bowl dishes, desserts, wine, beer and soft drinks</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2241,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102862,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Lambert Jackson presents\",\"Title\":\"Darren Criss\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Darren Criss returns to London for a very special one-night-only concert at the Hall, where he’ll be taking audiences on a musical odyssey unlike anything he’s ever done before. \",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Darren-Criss-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7772&token=183452b9&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Darren-Criss-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7772&token=183452b9&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Darren-Criss-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7772&token=183452b9&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Darren-Criss-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7772&token=183452b9&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Darren-Criss-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7772&token=183452b9&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Darren Criss\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/102862\",\"Categories\":[\"Entertainment\",\"Musicals\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/darren-criss\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 18 October 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0d2626\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Darren-Criss-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7772&token=183452b9&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Darren-Criss-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7772&token=183452b9&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Darren-Criss-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7772&token=183452b9&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Darren-Criss-2820x1487.jpg?type=image&id=7772&token=183452b9&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Darren Criss\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2241-102863\",\"PerformanceNumber\":102863,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102862,\"Date\":\"2026-10-18T19:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-06-26T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-10-18T18:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":30,\"MaximumPrice\":267.65,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p><strong>Darren Criss</strong> returns to London for a very special one-night-only concert at the Hall, where he&rsquo;ll be taking audiences on a musical odyssey unlike anything he&rsquo;s ever done before. From cult internet sensation to acclaimed star of stage and screen, the Tony, Emmy and Golden Globe Award-winner will bring his unique brand of humour and storytelling to an eclectic playlist of songs that have defined his life and career as a performer.</p>\\r\\n<p>From his breakout role as Blaine Anderson in the global phenomenon Glee to his acclaimed turns in <em>Hedwig and the Angry Inch</em> and the Tony Award-winning <em>Maybe Happy Ending</em>, Criss reflects on the projects that have earned him a devoted following while sharing the music, memories and inspirations behind them.</p>\\r\\n<p>Part concert, part celebration and part personal scrapbook, this special event offers an intimate and deeply personal portrait of one of Broadway&rsquo;s most versatile, charismatic and beloved artists, bringing together the songs, stories and performances that have defined an extraordinary career.&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":87,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private Hire of a Second Tier Box for 4 guests<br />*Contemporary Box Menu of nachos and sliders, with wine, beer and soft drinks<br />*Box Waiter</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":89,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private Hire of a Loggia Box for 8 guests<br />*Contemporary Box Menu of nachos and sliders, with wine, beer and soft drinks<br />*Box Waiter</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":91,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP\",\"Content\":\"<p>VIP tickets include a pre-show meet and greet, a signed poster, and a professional photo with Darren Criss. Information regarding timings and location will be sent nearer to the time so please look out for this email and get in touch with <a href=\\\"mailto:customerservices@lambertjackson.co.uk\\\">customerservices@lambertjackson.co.uk</a> should you have any questions.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1969,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100128,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-11-25T19:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-11-25T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"AEG Presents in association with UTA\",\"Title\":\"Deep Purple\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Global rock icons Deep Purple will return to the Hall for a special one-off performance on 25 November 2026.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Deep-Purple-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6644&token=d889ef29&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Deep-Purple-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6644&token=d889ef29&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Deep-Purple-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6644&token=d889ef29&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Deep-Purple-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6644&token=d889ef29&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Deep-Purple-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6644&token=d889ef29&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Deep Purple\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/100128\",\"Categories\":[\"Rock and Pop\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/deep-purple\",\"DateDescription\":\"Wednesday 25 November 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#8c52de\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Deep-Purple-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6644&token=d889ef29&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Deep-Purple-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6644&token=d889ef29&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Deep-Purple-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6644&token=d889ef29&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Deep-Purple-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6644&token=d889ef29&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Deep Purple\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"1969-100170\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100170,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100128,\"Date\":\"2026-11-25T19:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-02-06T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-11-25T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":55,\"MaximumPrice\":125,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"6\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>AEG Presents in association with UTA:&nbsp;<strong>Deep Purple</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Global rock icons <strong>Deep Purple</strong> will return to the Hall for a special one-off performance on 25 November 2026, reconnecting the band with one of the most significant venues in their storied history. Celebrated for defining the sound of rock for more than five decades, Deep Purple remain one of the world&rsquo;s most revered live acts and will be joined for this unique show by UK rockers <strong>Jayler</strong>.</p>\\r\\n<p>With more than five decades of chart-topping albums, sold-out tours, and induction into the Rock &amp; Roll Hall of Fame, they remain one of the most influential and prestigious bands in the world. Their unparalleled catalogue &mdash; from <em>Smoke on the Water</em> to <em>Highway Star</em> &mdash; continues to inspire generations of musicians, while their live performances reaffirm their status as pioneers of hard rock.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2028,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100566,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-29T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-30T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Live Nation presents\",\"Title\":\"First Aid Kit\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Swedish duo First Aid Kit return to London this September for a very special one-night-only performance at the Hall on Tuesday 29 September 2026.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/First-Aid-Kit-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7019&token=06b27d69&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/First-Aid-Kit-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7019&token=06b27d69&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/First-Aid-Kit-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7019&token=06b27d69&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/First-Aid-Kit-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7019&token=06b27d69&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/First-Aid-Kit-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7019&token=06b27d69&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"First Aid Kit\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/100566\",\"Categories\":[\"Rock and Pop\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/first-aid-kit\",\"DateDescription\":\"Tuesday 29 - Wednesday 30 September 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#fc9400\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/First-Aid-Kit-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7019&token=06b27d69&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/First-Aid-Kit-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7019&token=06b27d69&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/First-Aid-Kit-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7019&token=06b27d69&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/First-Aid-Kit-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7019&token=06b27d69&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"First Aid Kit\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2028-100574\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100574,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100566,\"Date\":\"2026-09-29T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-03-13T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-29T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":40,\"MaximumPrice\":160,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"6\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Live Nation presents.</p>\\r\\n<p>Swedish duo&nbsp;<strong>First Aid Kit</strong>&nbsp;return to London this September. After two years off the road, the band will take to the iconic stage accompanied by a sixty five piece symphony orchestra.</p>\\r\\n<p>For this unique show, First Aid Kit will perform their breakthrough album&nbsp;<em>Stay Gold&nbsp;</em>in full for the first half of the evening. The second half will feature a selection of favourite songs, old and new.&nbsp;This marks the band&rsquo;s second time playing at the Hall, the last time was in 2014 in support of&nbsp;<em>Stay Gold</em>.</p>\\r\\n<p>Joining them will be the&nbsp;<strong>Gothenburg Symphony Orchestra</strong>, with arranger&nbsp;<strong>Erik Arvinder&nbsp;</strong>conducting. This special performance will see the duo&rsquo;s songs reimagined on a grand symphonic scale, bringing together their signature harmonies with the sound of a full orchestra for what will be their only UK show of the year.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"2028-100833\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100833,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100566,\"Date\":\"2026-09-30T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-03-13T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-30T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":40,\"MaximumPrice\":160,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"6\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2016,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100846,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-11-04T12:50:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-11-04T12:50:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Future Makers\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Bring your classes to Future Makers, the annual live music competition that's here to inspire young people to write music.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/Engagement/RS113738_010.jpg?type=image&id=7102&token=9a232e2e&mode=fill&top=16&left=0&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/Engagement/RS113738_010.jpg?type=image&id=7102&token=9a232e2e&mode=fill&top=22&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/Engagement/RS113738_010.jpg?type=image&id=7102&token=9a232e2e&mode=fill&top=32&left=0&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/Engagement/RS113738_010.jpg?type=image&id=7102&token=9a232e2e&mode=fill&top=36&left=0&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/Engagement/RS113738_010.jpg?type=image&id=7102&token=9a232e2e&mode=fill&top=45&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Pupils jumping at Future Makers.\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"Custom\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Book here\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/about-the-hall/our-work/engagement/future-makers-booking-form\",\"Categories\":[\"Engagement\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/future-makers\",\"DateDescription\":\"Wednesday 4 November 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#003dba\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/Engagement/RS113738_010.jpg?type=image&id=7102&token=9a232e2e&mode=fill&top=22&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/Engagement/RS113738_010.jpg?type=image&id=7102&token=9a232e2e&mode=fill&top=45&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/Engagement/RS113738_010.jpg?type=image&id=7102&token=9a232e2e&mode=fill&top=99&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/Engagement/RS113738_010.jpg?type=image&id=7102&token=9a232e2e&mode=fill&top=199&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Pupils jumping at Future Makers.\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2016-100847\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100847,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100846,\"Date\":\"2026-11-04T12:50:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-03-16T09:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-11-04T12:25:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":null,\"MaximumPrice\":null,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":50,\"ContentType\":\"Show Promo Code Box\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall Engagement presents:</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Future Makers </strong>is an exciting performance opportunity for young musicians. Talented young people aged 14-19 will be invited to apply from all over the UK, and following live auditions a final line-up will be selected This main stage event at the Royal Albert Hall will feature young creatives performing their original works to a stellar industry panel, invited guests and an audience of schoolchildren, in the hope that they are inspired to become Future Makers themselves.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1823,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":97960,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-25T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-27T18:00:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Harry Potter and the Philosopher’s Stone™ In Concert (PG)\",\"Suffix\":\"with the Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Experience the momentous scenes from the film on a giant HD screen all whilst John Williams’ unforgettable score is performed live. \",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/Harry-Potter-1/HP1-INTL-Film-Stills-1.jpg?type=image&id=5526&token=0d366b06&mode=fill&top=15&left=0&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/Harry-Potter-1/HP1-INTL-Film-Stills-1.jpg?type=image&id=5526&token=0d366b06&mode=fill&top=20&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/Harry-Potter-1/HP1-INTL-Film-Stills-1.jpg?type=image&id=5526&token=0d366b06&mode=fill&top=29&left=0&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/Harry-Potter-1/HP1-INTL-Film-Stills-1.jpg?type=image&id=5526&token=0d366b06&mode=fill&top=32&left=0&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/Harry-Potter-1/HP1-INTL-Film-Stills-1.jpg?type=image&id=5526&token=0d366b06&mode=fill&top=40&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Ron, Harry and Hermoine smiling on the Hogwarts Express. \",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/97960\",\"Categories\":[\"Children and family\",\"Film\",\"Entertainment\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/harry-potter-and-the-philosophers-stone-in-concert\",\"DateDescription\":\"Friday 25 - Sunday 27 September 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0d2626\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/Harry-Potter-1/HP1-INTL-Film-Stills-1.jpg?type=image&id=5526&token=0d366b06&mode=fill&top=20&left=0&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/Harry-Potter-1/HP1-INTL-Film-Stills-1.jpg?type=image&id=5526&token=0d366b06&mode=fill&top=40&left=0&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/Harry-Potter-1/HP1-INTL-Film-Stills-1.jpg?type=image&