e\":\"2026-09-26T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":16.36,\"MaximumPrice\":272.55,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":72,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Fine Dining \",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium Stalls Seating&nbsp;</p><p>*Three course dinner in Coda by Chavot Restaurant</p><p>*Welcome glass of champagne and half bottle of wine per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Still &amp; Sparkling mineral water, tea or coffee</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":79,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Private Hire of a Loggia Box for 8 guests</p><p>*Half bottle wine and mineral water per person</p><p>*Cold bowl dish, loaded nachos, sliders and fries and themed desserts&nbsp;</p><p>*Popcorn&nbsp;</p><p>*Box Waiter&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Private Hire of a Second Tier Box for 4 guests</p><p>*Half bottle wine and mineral water per person</p><p>*Cold bowl dish, loaded nachos, sliders and fries and themed desserts&nbsp;</p><p>*Popcorn&nbsp;</p><p>*Box Waiter&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":295,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Decrease Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":296,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Increase Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"1823-97969\",\"PerformanceNumber\":97969,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":97960,\"Date\":\"2026-09-27T12:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2025-10-16T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-27T11:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":16.36,\"MaximumPrice\":252.94,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents:</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Harry Potter and the Philosopher&rsquo;s Stone&trade; In Concert (PG)</strong><br /><strong>with the Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Years ago <em>Harry Potter and the Philosopher&rsquo;s Stone&trade;</em> enchanted our screens and now it&rsquo;s returning, with the <strong>Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra</strong> and <strong>Philharmonia Chorus</strong>, conducted by <strong>Justin Freer</strong>, bringing John Williams&rsquo; iconic score to life.</p>\\r\\n<p>Watch the film on a giant HD screen and experience every unforgettable moment - from the wand choosing the wizard to the chaos of a troll in the dungeon, as you reunite once more with Harry, Ron and Hermione in their first adventure.</p>\\r\\n<p>A<em>ll characters and elements &copy; &amp; &trade; Warner Bros. Entertainment Inc. Publishing Rights &copy; JKR.<br /><br /></em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><br />In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall. <br />This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office<em><br />_________________________________________________________<br /></em></p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":79,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Private Hire of Loggia Box for 8 guests &nbsp;</p><p>*Brunch style menu served in your box&nbsp;</p><p>*Box Waiter&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Private Hire of Second Tier Box for 4 guests &nbsp;</p><p>*Brunch style menu served in your box&nbsp;</p><p>*Box Waiter&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":295,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Decrease Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":296,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Increase Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"1823-97972\",\"PerformanceNumber\":97972,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":97960,\"Date\":\"2026-09-27T18:00:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2025-10-16T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-27T17:25:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":16.36,\"MaximumPrice\":267.65,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents:</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Harry Potter and the Philosopher&rsquo;s Stone&trade; In Concert (PG)</strong><br /><strong>with the Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Years ago <em>Harry Potter and the Philosopher&rsquo;s Stone&trade;</em> enchanted our screens and now it&rsquo;s returning, with the <strong>Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra</strong> and <strong>Philharmonia Chorus</strong>, conducted by <strong>Justin Freer</strong>, bringing John Williams&rsquo; iconic score to life.</p>\\r\\n<p>Watch the film on a giant HD screen and experience every unforgettable moment - from the wand choosing the wizard to the chaos of a troll in the dungeon, as you reunite once more with Harry, Ron and Hermione in their first adventure.</p>\\r\\n<p>A<em>ll characters and elements &copy; &amp; &trade; Warner Bros. Entertainment Inc. Publishing Rights &copy; JKR.<br /><br /></em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><br />In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall. <br />This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office<em><br />_________________________________________________________<br /></em></p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":72,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Fine Dining \",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium Stalls Seating&nbsp;</p><p>*Three course dinner in Coda by Chavot Restaurant</p><p>*Welcome glass of champagne and half bottle of wine per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Still &amp; Sparkling mineral water, tea or coffee</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":79,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Private Hire of a Loggia Box for 8 guests</p><p>*Half bottle wine and mineral water per person</p><p>*Cold bowl dish, loaded nachos, sliders and fries and themed desserts&nbsp;</p><p>*Popcorn&nbsp;</p><p>*Box Waiter&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Private Hire of a Second Tier Box for 4 guests</p><p>*Half bottle wine and mineral water per person</p><p>*Cold bowl dish, loaded nachos, sliders and fries and themed desserts&nbsp;</p><p>*Popcorn&nbsp;</p><p>*Box Waiter&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":295,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Decrease Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":296,\"ContentType\":\"Dynamic Increase Limit\",\"Content\":\"10\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2213,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102660,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-16T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-16T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"AEG presents\",\"Title\":\"Hasan Minhaj and Ronny Chieng\",\"Suffix\":\"Hasan Hates Ronny | Ronny Hates Hasan: A Debate to the Death\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Comedians Hasan Minhaj and Ronny Chieng are coming to the Hall in 