tent\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents: <strong>Home Alone in Concert (PG)</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>Relive this festive favourite on the big screen as&nbsp;<strong>John Williams</strong>&rsquo; charming score is performed live to picture by the&nbsp;<strong>Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<strong>Crouch End Festival Chorus,&nbsp;</strong>conducted by&nbsp;<strong>Anthony Gabriele</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>Macaulay Culkin stars as Kevin McCallister, an 8-year-old boy who&rsquo;s accidentally left behind when his family leaves for Christmas vacation, and who must defend his home against two bungling thieves (Joe Pesci and Daniel Stern). Also starring Catherine O&rsquo;Hara and John Candy, and nominated for two Academy Awards&reg; for Best Original Score and Best Original Song (<em>Somewhere in My Memory</em>),&nbsp;<em>Home Alone</em>&nbsp;is hilarious, heart-warming, festive fun for the entire family.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&copy; 1990 Twentieth Century Fox</p>\\r\\n<p>_____________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":72,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Fine Dining \",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium stalls seat </p><p>*Three course dinner in Coda by Chavot Restaurant</p><p>*Welcome glass of Champagne&nbsp;and half bottle of wine per person</p><p>*Still &amp; Sparkling mineral water, tea or coffee</p><p>*Christmas crackers</p><p>*Programme per person </p><p>*Gift per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":79,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p><br></p><p>*Private hire of a box&nbsp;for 8 people</p><p>*Festive Cinema Box Hospitality&nbsp;</p><p>*Wine, soft drinks&nbsp;</p><p>*Mineral water</p><p>*A dedicated service waiter per box&nbsp;</p><p>*A cracker and gift per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Programme if produced&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p><br></p><p>*Private hire of a box&nbsp;for 4 people</p><p>*Festive Cinema Box Hospitality&nbsp;</p><p>*Wine, soft drinks&nbsp;</p><p>*Mineral water</p><p>*A dedicated service waiter per box&nbsp;</p><p>*A cracker and gift per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Programme if produced&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":408,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge Stalls\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium stalls seat </p><p>*Access to 1871 VIP lounge </p><p>*Canapes, bowl dishes, desserts served pre-show and during the interval</p><p>*Wine, beer and soft drinks</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":416,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge Arena NEW\",\"Content\":\"<ul>\\r\\n<li>Front Arena seat (within first 7 rows)&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\\r\\n<li>Glass of Champagne on arrival, wine, beer and soft cocktail</li>\\r\\n<li>A festive menu served pre show in the Christmas VIP Lounge&nbsp;</li>\\r\\n</ul>\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"2007-102692\",\"PerformanceNumber\":102692,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100575,\"Date\":\"2026-12-05T14:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-06-19T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-12-05T13:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":306.86,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":72,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Fine Dining \",\"Content\":\"<ul>\\r\\n<li>Premium Stalls seats</li>\\r\\n<li>Two glasses of Champagne per person*</li>\\r\\n<li>Three course brunch menu served in Coda by Eric Chavot Restaurant</li>\\r\\n<li>Smoothie and filter coffee and tea</li>\\r\\n<li>Christmas cracker and a gift per person</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<p>*Alcohol can only be served after 11am.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":78,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Grand Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p><br></p><p>*Private hire of a box for 12 guests</p><p>*A festive Afternoon Tea served in box&nbsp;</p><p>*Quarter bottle Champagne per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Mineral water</p><p>*A dedicated service waiter per box&nbsp;</p><p>*A cracker and gift per person&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":79,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p><br></p><p>*Private hire of a box for 8 guests</p><p>*A festive Afternoon Tea served in box&nbsp;</p><p>*Quarter bottle Champagne per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Mineral water</p><p>*A dedicated service waiter per box&nbsp;</p><p>*A cracker and gift per person&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p><br></p><p>*Private hire of a box for 4 guests</p><p>*A festive Afternoon Tea served in box&nbsp;</p><p>*Quarter bottle Champagne per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Mineral water</p><p>*A dedicated service waiter per box&nbsp;</p><p>*A cracker and gift per person&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":408,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge Stalls\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium stalls seat </p><p>*Access to 1871 VIP lounge </p><p>*Canapes, bowl dishes, desserts served pre-show and during the interval</p><p>*Wine, beer and soft drinks</p\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":416,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge Arena NEW\",\"Content\":\"<ul>\\r\\n<li>Front Arena seat (within first 7 rows)&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\\r\\n<li>Glass of Champagne on arrival, wine, beer and soft cocktail</li>\\r\\n<li>A festive menu served pre show in the Christmas VIP Lounge&nbsp;</li>\\r\\n</ul>\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID