. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":72,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Fine Dining \",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium stalls seat </p><p>*Three course dinner in Coda by Chavot Restaurant</p><p>*Welcome glass of Champagne&nbsp;and half bottle of wine per person</p><p>*Still &amp; Sparkling mineral water, tea or coffee</p><p>*Christmas crackers</p><p>*Programme per person </p><p>*Gift per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":79,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p><br></p><p>*Private hire of a box&nbsp;for 8 people</p><p>*Festive Cinema Box Hospitality&nbsp;</p><p>*Wine, soft drinks&nbsp;</p><p>*Mineral water</p><p>*A dedicated service waiter per box&nbsp;</p><p>*A cracker and gift per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Programme if produced&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":80,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Hospitality\",\"Content\":\"<p><br></p><p>*Private hire of a box&nbsp;for 4 people</p><p>*Festive Cinema Box Hospitality&nbsp;</p><p>*Wine, soft drinks&nbsp;</p><p>*Mineral water</p><p>*A dedicated service waiter per box&nbsp;</p><p>*A cracker and gift per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Programme if produced&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":408,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge Stalls\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Premium stalls seat </p><p>*Access to 1871 VIP lounge </p><p>*Canapes, bowl dishes, desserts served pre-show and during the interval</p><p>*Wine, beer and soft drinks</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":416,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge Arena NEW\",\"Content\":\"<ul>\\r\\n<li>Front Arena seat (within first 7 rows)&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\\r\\n<li>Glass of Champagne on arrival, wine, beer and soft cocktail</li>\\r\\n<li>A festive menu served pre show in the Christmas VIP Lounge&nbsp;</li>\\r\\n</ul>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1907,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99211,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":nul