=199&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Jamie Cullum: The Pianoman at Christmas 12-12-25\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2022-101550\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101550,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101548,\"Date\":\"2026-12-10T19:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-04-30T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-12-10T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":25.45,\"MaximumPrice\":370.59,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall and Crosstown Concerts present</p>\\r\\n<h1>Jamie Cullum: The Pianoman at Christmas</h1>\\r\\n<p>Jamie Cullum returns to the Royal Albert Hall with his big band for a celebration of&nbsp;<em>The Pianoman at Christmas</em>. Joined by the brilliant Kansas Smitty&rsquo;s, who featured on the album&rsquo;s deluxe edition. This year&rsquo;s show brings a vibrant mix of festive flair and big band flair.</p>\\r\\n<p>Expect an evening packed with surprises, from special guest appearances to one-off collaborations, as Cullum takes audiences on a journey through the album&rsquo;s standout moments. From the intimate charm of&nbsp;<em>Beautiful Together</em>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>Christmas Don&rsquo;t Let Me Down</em>&nbsp;to the swing of&nbsp;<em>Hang Your Lights</em>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>It&rsquo;s Christmas.</em></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office</p>\\r\\n<p>____________________________________________________________________</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"2022-101551\",\"PerformanceNumber\":101551,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":101548,\"Date\":\"2026-12-11T19:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-04-30T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-12-11T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":25.45,\"MaximumPrice\":483.33,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2018,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100570,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-13T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-14T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Live Nation and Metropolis presents\",\"Title\":\"Jill Scott\",\"Suffix\":\"To Whom This May Concern 2026 Tour\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Three-time GRAMMY Award–winning singer-songwriter, Jill Scott is coming to the Hall with her To Whom This May Concern our in October 2026.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Jill-Scott-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7015&token=ef8de53f&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Jill-Scott-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7015&token=ef8de53f&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Jill-Scott-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7015&token=ef8de53f&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/10-October/Jill-Scott-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7015&token=ef8de53f&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&fo