SaleDate\":\"2026-11-13T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":30,\"MaximumPrice\":311.76,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":50,\"ContentType\":\"Show Promo Code Box\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":65,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Image URL\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/8391_16_Sylvia_WebImage_2820x1487px.jpg?type=image&id=5863&token=9f884d65\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Eleanor Lloyd Productions presents<strong>: </strong><strong style=\\\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(55, 65, 81);\\\">SYLVIA</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Sylvia Pankhurst.</p><p>Activist. Rebel. Icon.</p><p><br></p><p>Torn between loyalty, love, and revolution, see her remarkable story explode onto the stage when&nbsp;<strong>SYLVIA</strong>&nbsp;storms into London in 2026.</p><p>The Olivier Award-winning electrifying musical is fuelled by an irresistible soundtrack that joyously unites hip hop, funk, and soul, and is brought to life by world-renowned choreographer and storyteller&nbsp;<strong>Kate Prince</strong>&nbsp;(<em>ZooNation</em>).</p><p><br></p><p>Powerhouse talent&nbsp;<strong>Beverley Knight</strong>&nbsp;<em>(Sister Act, The Drifters Girl, Memphis The Musical</em>)?will reprise her Olivier award winning role as Emmeline Pankhurst, alongside?<strong>Sharon Rose</strong>?(<em>Hamilton, Motown, Beautiful: The Carol King Musical</em>)?as Sylvia.</p><p>Don't miss this revolutionary, uplifting musical direct from London’s Old Vic theatre.</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":87,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Private hire of box&nbsp;for 4 guests </p><p>*Box waiter&nbsp;</p><p>*Champagne, Wine, Soft drinks&nbsp;</p><p>*Canapes, bowl dishes, dessert canapes</p>\",\"Inactive\":