.S.P.E.C.T., Ain’t No Mountain High Enough, I Heard It Through the Grapevine, Reach Out (I’ll Be There), Dancing in the Street, Midnight Train to Georgia, Stop! In the Name of Love, Don’t You Worry ‘Bout A Thing, My Guy, Proud Mary, What Becomes of the Broken Hearted, You Can’t Hurry Love</em><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\"> and </span><em style=\\\"color: black;\\\">My Girl. </em></p><p><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">We are also thrilled to welcome back special guest presenter, </span><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Angie Greaves</strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\"> (Smooth Radio). </span></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Michael England </strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Conductor</span></p><p> <strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Gloria Onitiri</strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\"> Vocalist</span></p><p> <strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Trevor Dion Nicholas</strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\"> Vocalist</span></p><p> <strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\"> Angie Greaves</strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\"> Presenter</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">____________________________________________________________________________________________ </span></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">DYNAMIC PRICING </strong></p><p><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall. </span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office&nbsp;</span></p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1908,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99300,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-11-03T19:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-11-03T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"SJM Concerts presents\",\"Title\":\"The Australian Pink Floyd\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"The Australian Pink Floyd are bringing their The Happiest Days Of Our Lives tour to the UK for 2026.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Australian-Pink-Floyd-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6286&token=46200062&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Australian-Pink-Floyd-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6286&token=46200062&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Australian-Pink-Floyd-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6286&token=46200062&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Australian-Pink-Floyd-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6286&token=46200062&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Australian-Pink-Floyd-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6286&token=46200062&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"The Australian Pink Floyd\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/99300\",\"Categories\":[\"Rock and Pop\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/the-australian-pink-floyd\",\"DateDescription\":\"Tuesday 3 November 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#8c52de\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Australian-Pink-Floyd-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6286&token=46200062&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Australian-Pink-Floyd-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6286&token=46200062&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Australian-Pink-Floyd-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6286&token=46200062&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Australian-Pink-Floyd-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=6286&token=46200062&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"The Australian Pink Floyd\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"1908-99301\",\"PerformanceNumber\":99301,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":99300,\"Date\":\"2026-11-03T19:30:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":false,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2025-12-05T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-11-03T18:55:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":35,\"MaximumPrice\":364.71,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":10,\"ContentType\":\"Web Max Quantity Performance\",\"Content\":\"8\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<header>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>SJM Concerts presents\\r\\n<h1>The Australian Pink Floyd</h1>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</header>\\r\\n<div data-swiftype-index=\\\"true\\\">\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<p><strong>The Australian Pink Floyd</strong>&nbsp;are bringing their&nbsp;<em>The Happiest Days Of Our Lives</em>&nbsp;tour to the UK for 2026. The band will take to the stage with a collection of greatest hits that resonate deeply with Pink Floyd fans worldwide.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring a new stage set and video animation, cutting-edge lighting, precision lasers, massive inflatables, and impeccable live sound. TAPFS promises to offer an unforgettable experience for both long-time fans and newcomers. Covering music from every era of Pink Floyd&rsquo;s evolution, this tour highlights TAPFS's unwavering commitment to the legacy of Barrett, Waters, Gilmour, Wright, and Mason, delivering an authentic and heartfelt tribute to the legendary Pink Floyd productions.</p>\\r\\n<p>Having sold nearly 5 million tickets worldwide, The Australian Pink Floyd Show gave its first ever concert in Adelaide, Australia in 1988. Since then, they have performed in over 35 countries worldwide; played at David Gilmour&rsquo;s 50th birthday celebration and</p>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</div>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":87,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>*To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private hire of a box for 4 guests&nbsp;<br />*Box waiter <br />*Half bottle Champagne and wine per person <br />*Pre-show canapes, Interval bowl dishes and dessert canapes</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":89,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>*To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private hire of a box for 8 guests&nbsp;<br />*Box waiter <br />*Half bottle Champagne and wine per person <br />*Pre-show canapes, Interval bowl dishes and dessert canapes</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":91,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP\",\"Content\":\"<p>Echoes Experience</p>\\r\\n<p>*Enjoy a rarely featured live performance of Echoes<br />*Take part in a short Q&amp;A with the band with the chance to ask your questions<br />*Receive an official 2026 VIP laminate and lanyard<br />*Take home a bespoke tour souvenir, exclusive to VIP package holders<br />*Also included, first access to the tour merchandise</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":118,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Hospitality Dining\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Premium Stalls Seating <br />*Three course dinner in Coda by Chavot Restaurant<br />*Welcome glass Champagne and half bottle of wine per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":293,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Premium Front Arena<br />*Pre and interval VIP Lounge<br />*Canapes, bowl dishes, desserts, wine, beer and soft drinks</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1832,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":97979,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-10-08T14:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-10-08T14:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Cre8tive Productions Ltd presents\",\"Title\":\"The International Dance Festival 2026\",\"Suffix\":\"featuring the International Championships\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"The world’s best professional Ballroom and Latin American dancers compete with vigour to become International Champions.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0008_ballroom-dancing.png?type=image&id=2511&token=bc97a1df&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0008_ballroom-dancing.png?type=image&id=2511&token=bc97a1df&mode=f