Summary\":\"Prepare for an unforgettable evening as two of the greatest film composers of all time go head-to-head in The Music of Zimmer vs Williams at the Royal Albert Hall.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":null,\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/96473\",\"Categories\":[\"Film\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/the-music-of-zimmer-vs-williams-2026\",\"DateDescription\":\"Sunday 12 July 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f2e861\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":null,\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"1741-96474\",\"PerformanceNumber\":96474,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":96473,\"Date\":\"2026-07-12T14:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2025-06-13T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-07-12T13:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":18.64,\"MaximumPrice\":267.65,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"1741-96475\",\"PerformanceNumber\":96475,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":96473,\"Date\":\"2026-07-12T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2025-06-13T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-07-12T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":18.64,\"MaximumPrice\":267.65,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":65,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Image URL\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/6-June/Zimmer-vs-Williams-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2516&token=65acabc0\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Raymond Gubbay presents: <strong>The Music of Zimmer vs Williams </strong></p><p><strong>A Cinematic Battle of Epic Proportions </strong></p><p>Prepare for an unforgettable evening as two of the greatest film composers of all time go head-to-head in <strong>The Music of Zimmer vs Williams</strong> at the Royal Albert Hall. </p><p>Experience the best of <strong>Hans Zimmer </strong>and <strong>John Williams </strong>as the <strong>London Concert Orchestra</strong>, conducted by Anthony Inglis, brings to life the legendary scores that have defined the cinematic landscape for decades. This thrilling concert features music from the most iconic films, pitting the epic soundscapes of Zimmer against the timeless melodies of Williams. </p><p>Relive unforgettable moments with music from: </p><p><em>Star Wars, Harry Potter, E.T., Interstellar, Pirates of the Carribean, and many more... </em></p><p>Feel the power, emotion, and excitement of these world-renowned soundtracks, performed live by a 70-piece orchestra. Whether you're a fan of Zimmer's bold, immersive style or Williams' timeless, iconic themes, this concert offers the ultimate showdown in film music. </p><p>One night, two musical legends - don’t miss your chance to experience The Music of Zimmer vs Williams live at London's Royal Albert Hall, the ultimate cinematic duel.&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":1825,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":97860,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-19T14:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-19T14:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Raymond Gubbay presents\",\"Title\":\"The Planets 2026\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Join us as we journey to the stars with Holst’s The Planets, from fiery battles to shimmering serenity. \",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0011_the-planets.png?type=image&id=3161&token=8d98c470&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0011_the-planets.png?type=image&id=3161&token=8d98c470&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0011_the-planets.png?type=image&id=3161&token=8d98c470&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0011_the-planets.png?type=image&id=3161&token=8d98c470&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0011_the-planets.png?type=image&id=3161&token=8d98c470&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"A graphic image of Saturn\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/97860\",\"Categories\":[\"Classical\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/the-planets-2026\",\"DateDescription\":\"Saturday 19 September 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[{\"Type\":\"Person\",\"Title\":\"Lee Reynolds\",\"Role\":\"Conductor\",\"Website\":null},{\"Type\":\"Person\",\"Title\":\"Daniel Lebhardt\",\"Role\":\"Piano Soloist\",\"Website\":null},{\"Type\":\"Performing Group\",\"Title\":\"The Bach Choir\",\"Role\":null,\"Website\":null},{\"Type\":\"Music Group\",\"Title\":\"Royal Philharmonic Orchestra\",\"Role\":null,\"Website\":null}],\"ThemeColor\":\"#f2e861\",\"Theme\":\"light\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0011_the-planets.png?type=image&id=3161&token=8d98c470&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0011_the-planets.png?type=image&id=3161&token=8d98c470&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0011_the-planets.png?type=image&id=3161&token=8d98c470&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/New-Website-images/0011_the-planets.png?type=image&id=3161&token=8d98c470&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"A graphic image of Saturn\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"1825-97902\",\"PerformanceNumber\":97902,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":97860,\"Date\":\"2026-09-19T14:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Afternoon\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2025-09-19T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-19T13:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":19.55,\"MaximumPrice\":262.74,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":65,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Image URL\",\"Content\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2025/9-September/Planets-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=2522&token=33a3feca\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Raymond Gubbay presents: </span><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">The Planets&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Step into an afternoon of music that stirs the soul and sparks the imagination. </span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Feel the heart-stopping beauty of </span><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Rachmaninov’s </strong><em style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Piano Concerto No. 2</em><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\"> performed by acclaimed pianist </span><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Daniel Lebhardt </strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">come alive with sweeping melodies and emotional depth. Then join us as we journey to the stars with </span><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Holst</strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">’s </span><em style=\\\"color: black;\\\">The Planets</em><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">, from fiery battles to shimmering serenity. Let the </span><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\"> and conductor </span><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Lee Reynolds</strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">, guide you through this concert of sheer musical wonder. </span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Performers: </span></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Royal Philharmonic Orchestra</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Lee Reynolds</strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\"> - Conductor</span></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: black;\\\">Daniel Lebhardt </strong><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">- Piano Soloist</span></p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":87,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p><br></p><p>*Private hire of box for 4 people</p><p>*Box waiter&nbsp;</p><p>*Half bottle Champage, wine and mineral water per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Canapes and cold dish served pre show</p><p>*Hot dishes and desserts served in the interval&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":118,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Hospitality Dining\",\"Content\":\"<p>*Glass of Champagne on arrival&nbsp;</p><p>*Three course a la carte meal in Coda served pre show and in interval&nbsp;</p><p>*Half bottle wine per person&nbsp;</p><p>*Tea and Coffee&nbsp;</p><p>*Premium Stalls Seat&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2240,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102906,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-09-28T19:30:00+01:00\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-09-28T19:30:00+01:00\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall presents\",\"Title\":\"Top Gun: Maverick in Concert (12A)\",\"Suffix\":\"with the Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchestra\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Join us to celebrate the 40th Anniversary of Top Gun at Top Gun: Maverick in Concert, as part of our Films in Concert series.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/TG-Webbanner-Lead-1.jpg?type=image&id=7783&token=ee230dfb&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/TG-Webbanner-Lead-1.jpg?type=image&id=7783&token=ee230dfb&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/TG-Webbanner-Lead-1.jpg?type=image&id=7783&token=ee230dfb&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/TG-Webbanner-Lead-1.jpg?type=image&id=7783&token=ee230dfb&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/TG-Webbanner-Lead-1.jpg?type=image&id=7783&token=ee230dfb&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"The lead image for Top Gun: Maverick that shows Maverick (Tom Cruise) in fron of his plane at sunrise.\",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":\"Auditorium\",\"VenueDetails\":{\"ID\":4,\"StreetAddress\":\"Kensington Gore\",\"AddressLocality\":\"Kensington\",\"AddressRegion\":\"London\",\"PostalCode\":\"SW7 2AP\",\"AddressCountry\":\"GB\",\"MapURL\":\"https://www.royalalberthall.com/plan-your-visit-essential-safety-information/getting-here/\"},\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/102906\",\"Categories\":[\"Film\",\"Entertainment\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/top-gun-maverick-in-concert\",\"DateDescription\":\"Monday 28 September 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0d2626\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/TG-Webbanner-Lead-1.jpg?type=image&id=7783&token=ee230dfb&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/TG-Webbanner-Lead-1.jpg?type=image&id=7783&token=ee230dfb&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/TG-Webbanner-Lead-1.jpg?type=image&id=7783&token=ee230dfb&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/9-September/TG-Webbanner-Lead-1.jpg?type=image&id=7783&token=ee230dfb&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"The lead image for Top Gun: Maverick that shows Maverick (Tom Cruise) in fron of his plane at sunrise.\",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2240-103052\",\"PerformanceNumber\":103052,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":102906,\"Date\":\"2026-09-28T19:30:00+01:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-07-03T10:00:00+01:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-09-28T18:55:00+01:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":20.91,\"MaximumPrice\":267.65,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":1,\"ContentType\":\"Web SYOS\",\"Content\":\"yes\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":63,\"ContentType\":\"T&C Checkbox\",\"Content\":\"This film is rated 12A\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Join us to celebrate the 40th Anniversary of Top Gun at <em>Top Gun: Maverick in Concert</em>, as part of our Films in Concert series.</p>\\r\\n<p>Experience the Academy Award&reg;-winning blockbuster on a stunning 4K screen with surround sound. All whilst the epic score is performed live, composed by Harold Faltermeyer, Lady Gaga and Hans Zimmer and produced by Lorne Balfe.</p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring the <strong>Royal Philharmonic Concert Orchest</strong>ra, conducted by <strong>Ben Palmer.&nbsp;</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING&nbsp;</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>---------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":87,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Second Tier Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private Hire of a Second Tier Box for 4 guests <br />*Cold bowl dish, nachos, sliders and fries and dessert canapes <br />*Half bottle wine per person, 2 beers per person, selection of soft drinks</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":89,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Loggia Box Experience\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Private Hire of a Loggia Box for 8 guests <br />*Cold bowl dish, nachos, sliders and waffle fries and dessert canapes <br />*Half bottle wine per person, selection of soft drinks</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":118,\"ContentType\":\"PT: Hospitality Dining\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Premium Stalls Seating <br />*Three course dinner in Coda by Chavot Restaurant<br />*Welcome glass Champagne and half bottle of wine per person</p>\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":366,\"ContentType\":\"STC: Standing Room\",\"Content\":\"You are buying a standing space in the Gallery. We expect standing to be popular for this event so there may be more than one row. Standing spaces are on a first come first served basis.\",\"Inactive\":false},{\"ContentTypeId\":408,\"ContentType\":\"PT: VIP Lounge Stalls\",\"Content\":\"<p>To include:</p>\\r\\n<p>*Premium Stalls Seating <br />*Pre and interval VIP Lounge<br />*Canapes, bowl dishes, desserts, wine, beer and soft drinks included</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]}]},{\"ID\":2025,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100848,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-12-17T19:00:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-12-18T19:00:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Royal Albert Hall present\",\"Title\":\"Trevor Nelson's Soul Christmas\",\"Suffix\":\"BBC Concert Orchestra\",\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Soul pioneer Trevor Nelson is back for another party this Christmas. \",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/Trevor-Nelson.png?type=image&id=6990&token=3178cf1a&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/Trevor-Nelson.png?type=image&id=6990&token=3178cf1a&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/Trevor-Nelson.png?type=image&id=6990&token=3178cf1a&mode=fill&top=0&left=16&width=600&height=334&format=webp\",\"w650\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/Trevor-Nelson.png?type=image&id=6990&token=3178cf1a&mode=fill&top=0&left=17&width=650&height=361&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/Trevor-Nelson.png?type=image&id=6990&token=3178cf1a&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Trevor Nelson's Soul Christmas at the Royal Albert Hall \",\"caption\":null},\"Venue\":null,\"VenueDetails\":null,\"BookingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"BookingLabel\":\"Find Tickets\",\"BookingURL\":\"https://tickets.royalalberthall.com/production/100848\",\"Categories\":[\"Rock and Pop\",\"Entertainment\"],\"Accessibility\":[],\"EventURL\":\"/tickets/events/2026/trevor-nelsons-soul-christmas\",\"DateDescription\":\"Thursday 17 - Friday 18 December 2026\",\"Type\":\"EventPage\",\"UsePromsPlanner\":false,\"Program\":[],\"Artists\":[],\"ThemeColor\":\"#0d2626\",\"Theme\":\"dark\",\"MembersImage\":{\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/Trevor-Nelson.png?type=image&id=6990&token=3178cf1a&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w820\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/Trevor-Nelson.png?type=image&id=6990&token=3178cf1a&mode=fill&top=0&left=22&width=820&height=456&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/Trevor-Nelson.png?type=image&id=6990&token=3178cf1a&mode=fill&top=58&left=0&width=600&height=200&format=webp\",\"w1200\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Events/Auditorium/2026/CATH/Trevor-Nelson.png?type=image&id=6990&token=3178cf1a&mode=fill&top=116&left=0&width=1200&height=400&format=webp\",\"alt\":\"Trevor Nelson's Soul Christmas at the Royal Albert Hall \",\"caption\":null},\"Performances\":[{\"ID\":\"2025-100849\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100849,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100848,\"Date\":\"2026-12-17T19:00:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-03-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-12-17T18:25:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":25.45,\"MaximumPrice\":326.47,\"WebContents\":[{\"ContentTypeId\":66,\"ContentType\":\"Members - Web Description\",\"Content\":\"<p>Royal Albert Hall presents:&nbsp;<strong>Trevor Nelson's Soul Christmas</strong></p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Trevor Nelson</strong>&nbsp;is back with a big party, for two unmissable nights, this Christmas.</p>\\r\\n<p>Trevor returns with a host of special guests performing re-imagined and re-scored Soul and RnB tracks with a festive sprinkle, supported by the incomparable&nbsp;<strong><span class=\\\"caps\\\">BBC</span>&nbsp;Concert Orchestra</strong>&nbsp;led by musical director&nbsp;<strong>Troy Miller.&nbsp;</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>The award-winning&nbsp;DJ, celebrating 30 years at the BBC,&nbsp;will keep the party going on stage with a DJ set after party. This extra is included in your ticket, so don't go anywhere and continue dancing the night away with Trevor.</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>_____________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>DYNAMIC PRICING</strong></p>\\r\\n<p>In the normal way dynamic pricing is in place at the Hall for events promoted by the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra, Cirque du Soleil and the Royal Albert Hall.</p>\\r\\n<p>This means that promoter ticket prices might fluctuate for these events (both up and down) according to demand. Dynamic, or flexible pricing, has been commonly used in the airline and hotel industry for many years and is now becoming commonplace in entertainment as well. Any prices changes will apply to all tickets sold by the Hall's Box Office&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"Inactive\":false}]},{\"ID\":\"2025-100850\",\"PerformanceNumber\":100850,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":100848,\"Date\":\"2026-12-18T19:00:00+00:00\",\"TimeSlot\":\"Evening\",\"HasTicketsUnderX\":true,\"OnSaleDate\":\"2026-03-20T10:00:00+00:00\",\"OffSaleDate\":\"2026-12-18T18:25:00+00:00\",\"MinimumPrice\":0,\"MaximumPrice\":336.27,\"WebContents\":[]}]},{\"ID\":2252,\"ProductionSeasonNumber\":103086,\"PerformanceNumber\":null,\"WishlistNumber\":null,\"StartDate\":\"2026-11-21T19:30:00Z\",\"EndDate\":\"2026-11-21T19:30:00Z\",\"Prefix\":\"Letters Live presents\",\"Title\":\"Letters Live\",\"Suffix\":null,\"ListingIndicator\":null,\"Summary\":\"Returning for its 10th show, Letters Live features an all-star cast delivering powerful readings of extraordinary historical correspondence.\",\"Image\":{\"w300\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Letters-Live-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7872&token=f734d1b3&mode=fill&top=0&left=8&width=300&height=167&format=webp\",\"w410\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Letters-Live-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7872&token=f734d1b3&mode=fill&top=0&left=11&width=410&height=228&format=webp\",\"w600\":\"https://d117kfg112vbe4.cloudfront.net/public/Royal-Albert-Hall-DAMS/Promoter-Imagery/2026/11-November/Letters-Live-2820x1487.png?type=image&id=7872&token=f734d1b3&mode=fill&top=0